{
  "title": "CT Artifact Correction (Algotom)",
  "cn": {
    "func": "使用 Algotom 工具库对 CT 数据进行重建前/后的伪影校正。选择一个图像 Channel（可以是投影/正弦图堆栈，或已重建的切片），选择校正操作并设置相应参数后点击计算；插件逐切片处理并输出一个与原始网格对齐、形状相同的校正后 Channel。支持的操作：环形/条纹伪影去除（remove_all_stripe / remove_stripe_based_sorting）、亮点（zinger）去除、Paganin 相位恢复。本插件专注于伪影校正，与负责重建的 TomoRecon 插件相互独立、互为补充。",
    "scenarios": "适用于同步辐射与实验室 CT 的数据预处理与后处理：去除由探测器缺陷引起的环形/条纹伪影、去除散射亮点，以及对弱吸收样品做 Paganin 单材料相位恢复以增强对比度。校正后的数据可直接用于后续重建或分析。",
    "requirements": "首次使用点击 Setup Environment（默认使用 Dragonfly 自带 Python 构建本地计算环境，联网安装 algotom + numpy + scipy，仅需一次）。无需 GPU。请注意区分输入域：环形/条纹去除与 Paganin 恢复作用于投影域（每个 z 切片为一幅投影/正弦图）。在 Dragonfly 2027.1（Python 3.14）上不能用 Dragonfly 自带的 Python 创建该环境：请安装 python.org 的 Python（3.12、3.13 或 3.14）并填入面板的 Base Python；Dragonfly 2025.1 无需另装 Python。"
  },
  "en": {
    "func": "CT-specific pre/post-reconstruction artifact correction using the Algotom toolkit. Pick an image Channel (a projection/sinogram stack, or reconstructed slices), choose an operation and set its parameters, and click Compute; the plugin processes the stack slice-by-slice and outputs a corrected Channel with the same shape and geometry as the source. Operations: ring/stripe removal (remove_all_stripe / remove_stripe_based_sorting), zinger (bright-speckle) removal, and Paganin phase retrieval. It focuses on artifact correction and is distinct from - and complementary to - the TomoRecon plugin, which performs the reconstruction.",
    "scenarios": "Pre/post-processing for synchrotron and lab CT: removing ring/stripe artifacts caused by detector defects, removing scattering zingers, and single-material Paganin phase retrieval to boost contrast on weakly absorbing samples. The corrected data feeds straight into reconstruction or analysis.",
    "requirements": "First use: click Setup Environment (builds a local compute environment from Dragonfly's own Python by default and installs algotom + numpy + scipy from PyPI; needs internet once). No GPU required. Mind the input domain: ring/stripe removal and Paganin retrieval act on the projection domain (each z-slice = one projection/sinogram). On Dragonfly 2027.1 (Python 3.14) the bundled Python cannot build this environment: install a python.org Python (3.12, 3.13 or 3.14) and enter it in the panel's Base Python field; Dragonfly 2025.1 needs no separate Python."
  }
}

{
  "title": "Anomaly / Defect Detection (Anomalib)…",
  "cn": {
    "func": "使用 Anomalib 进行无监督异常/缺陷检测：仅用一批\"无缺陷\"的正常图像训练一个模型（可选 PatchCore / PaDiM / FastFlow），无需任何缺陷标注。训练完成后，将模型应用到待测 Channel，插件会逐切片计算异常热力图（分数越高越异常），以新的热力图 Channel 形式发布回场景；再按阈值（自动 F1 最优或手动指定）将异常区域二值化，发布为缺陷 MultiROI，可直接用于测量与可视化。主要面向 2D 图像；对 3D Channel 会按切片逐层处理。所有繁重计算（PyTorch CUDA + Anomalib）都在插件独立的虚拟环境子进程中运行，绝不进入 Dragonfly 自带的 Python。\n\n「Setup」页的**一键执行全部步骤（按当前设置）**会无人值守地跑完流程：环境安装 → 训练 → 检测，每一步都使用你按下按钮那一刻各自页签上显示的设置。有两个复选框控制它：**环境安装默认关闭**（它要创建虚拟环境并下载 CUDA 版 PyTorch 与 anomalib，成功一次即可，而且离线根本无法完成）；**训练默认开启**，因为异常检测模型是按样品拟合的，「先拟合、再检测」才是诚实的默认值——如果你想直接用「Apply」页已经指定的模型来检测，取消勾选即可。检测本身不是可选项：它就是这次运行的目的，并且会发布一个热力图 Channel 和一个缺陷 MultiROI。如果一步都没能启动，运行会如实报告为**已停止**并给出被拒绝的原因，而不会声称「已完成」。三个浏览按钮不在流程内——它们会弹出模态对话框，而无人值守的运行无法回答对话框，因此文件夹路径完全按输入框中的文字采用。所有页签始终可以打开和修改参数，以便在运行**之前**逐页检查；某一步所需的输入尚不存在时，会在**它自己的按钮**上给出提示，说明缺的是哪一步，而不是把整个页签锁住不让进入。",
    "scenarios": "适用于\"正常样本容易获得、缺陷样本稀少\"的检测场景：工业与材料 CT/显微镜图像中的裂纹、孔隙、夹杂、异物等异常；铸件及增材制造零件的表面/内部缺陷检测；半导体、电子元件及表面质检中的偏差识别。特别适合无法为每种缺陷收集足够标注、但拥有大量合格样品的用户——只需用合格样品训练，即可自动定位偏离\"正常\"分布的区域。",
    "requirements": "首次使用请点击\"Setup Environment\"（使用 Dragonfly 自带 Python 构建独立运行环境，联网下载 torch CUDA 轮子 + Anomalib，约数 GB）；需要联网和一块 NVIDIA GPU。预训练骨干网络权重会在首次训练/应用时在该环境内自动下载，插件本身不打包权重。在 Dragonfly 2027.1（Python 3.14）上不能用 Dragonfly 自带的 Python 创建该环境：请安装 python.org 的 Python（3.12 或 3.13）并填入面板的 Base Python；Dragonfly 2025.1 无需另装 Python。"
  },
  "en": {
    "func": "Unsupervised anomaly / defect detection with Anomalib. You train a model (PatchCore, PaDiM, or FastFlow) using only a set of DEFECT-FREE ('normal') images — no defect annotations needed. Once trained, you apply the model to a test Channel: the plugin computes a per-slice anomaly heatmap (higher = more anomalous) and publishes it back as a new heatmap Channel, then thresholds it (auto F1-optimal or a manual value) into a defect MultiROI ready for measurement and visualization. Primarily for 2D images; a 3D Channel is processed slice/slab-wise. All heavy computation (PyTorch CUDA + Anomalib) runs in the plugin's own isolated venv subprocess, never in Dragonfly's bundled Python.\n\n**Execute All Steps with Current Settings** on the Setup tab runs the workflow unattended - set up the environment, train, detect - each step with whatever its own tab shows at the moment you press it. Two tick boxes govern it: setting up the environment is OFF by default (it builds a venv and downloads CUDA PyTorch and anomalib, it only ever has to succeed once, and offline it cannot succeed at all), and training is ON, because an anomaly model is fitted per specimen, so 'fit, then detect' is the honest default - untick it to detect with the model the Apply tab already names. Detection itself is not optional: it is the point of the run, and it publishes a heatmap Channel and a defect MultiROI. A run in which nothing started reports itself as stopped, quoting the refusal, rather than claiming it finished. The three browse buttons stay out of the chain - they open a modal dialog that an unattended run cannot answer, so the folder boxes are taken exactly as they read. Every tab stays open at all times so the parameters can be read and changed BEFORE the run; a step whose input does not exist yet refuses at its own button and says which step is missing, instead of the tab being locked shut.",
    "scenarios": "Ideal when normal samples are plentiful but defect examples are rare: cracks, pores, inclusions, or foreign objects in industrial and materials CT / microscopy images; surface or internal defects in castings and additive-manufactured parts; deviation detection in semiconductor, electronics, and surface-quality inspection. Especially useful for anyone who cannot collect enough labeled examples of every defect but has many good parts — train on the good parts, then automatically locate regions that deviate from 'normal'.",
    "requirements": "First use: click Setup Environment (builds an isolated Python environment with Dragonfly's own Python and downloads torch CUDA wheels + Anomalib, several GB); needs internet + an NVIDIA GPU. Any pretrained backbone weights are downloaded inside that environment at first train/apply — no weights are bundled with the plugin. On Dragonfly 2027.1 (Python 3.14) the bundled Python cannot build this environment: install a python.org Python (3.12 or 3.13) and enter it in the panel's Base Python field; Dragonfly 2025.1 needs no separate Python."
  }
}

{
  "title": "Auto Backup & Exit",
  "cn": {
    "func": "功能：一键备份当前 Dragonfly 会话，然后退出 Dragonfly（可选再关机）。点“备份并退出”会在你选定的备份文件夹下创建一个带时间戳的子文件夹，并按勾选写入：**会话快照**（主窗口与各视图截图 + 已发布对象清单 + 保存的 .ORSSession 会话文件）、**对象关系图 PNG**（复用“Show Connections of All Objects”插件）、**当前视图截图**，以及可选的 **AI 工作日志**。AI 工作日志复用“WorkLog”插件及其本地大模型，仅在该插件已配置好（虚拟环境 + 模型文件）时才运行，否则自动跳过。快速步骤在界面线程执行，AI 工作日志在后台线程执行；退出前会弹出确认框。退出使用干净的事件循环退出（因为刚刚已保存会话，所以不会再弹保存提示）；关机使用 shutdown /s /t 60，60 秒内可用命令 shutdown /a 取消。也提供“仅备份（保持打开）”按钮，只备份不退出。",
    "scenarios": "适用场景：下班/长时间离开前一键留存整个会话的“现场”（截图 + 对象清单 + 可重新打开的 .ORSSession + 关系图），既做备份又生成可交接的记录；批处理或长任务跑完后自动备份并退出、甚至关机以省电；把当天的工作整理成 AI 工作日志随备份一起归档。",
    "requirements": "环境需求：快速步骤无需安装/联网/GPU/虚拟环境。对象关系图复用 Show Connections 插件、AI 工作日志复用 WorkLog 插件——这两个插件需随本包一起安装（本插件会自动定位它们）；AI 工作日志还需要 WorkLog 已完成一次性配置（本地模型 + 虚拟环境），未配置时该步会被跳过。关机功能为 Windows 专用且默认关闭，需显式勾选并确认。"
  },
  "en": {
    "func": "What it does: backs up the current Dragonfly session in one click, then quits Dragonfly (optionally shutting the computer down afterwards). 'Backup & Exit' creates a timestamped subfolder under the backup folder you pick and, per the ticked options, writes: a SESSION SNAPSHOT (main-window + per-view screenshots + a list of published objects + a saved .ORSSession file), the OBJECT-CONNECTIONS GRAPH as a PNG (reusing the 'Show Connections of All Objects' plugin), the CURRENT-VIEW screenshot, and optionally an AI WORK LOG. The AI Work Log reuses the 'WorkLog' plugin and its LOCAL LLM, and only runs if that plugin is set up (venv + model file); otherwise it is skipped. Fast steps run on the UI thread; the AI Work Log runs on a background thread; a confirmation dialog precedes exit. Exit uses a clean event-loop quit (no save prompt, since the session was just saved); shutdown uses 'shutdown /s /t 60' and can be cancelled within 60 seconds with 'shutdown /a'. A 'Backup now (keep open)' button backs up without exiting.",
    "scenarios": "Typical scenarios: at the end of the day, or before leaving for a long time, capture the whole session's 'scene' in one click (screenshots + object list + a reopenable .ORSSession + the relationship graph) — a backup and a handover record in one; after a batch job or a long task finishes, back up and exit automatically, or even shut down to save power; archive the day's work as an AI Work Log alongside the backup.",
    "requirements": "Requirements: the fast steps need no install/internet/GPU/venv. The object-connections graph reuses the Show Connections plugin and the AI Work Log reuses the WorkLog plugin — both must be installed alongside this one (this plugin locates them automatically); the AI Work Log additionally needs WorkLog's one-time setup (local model + venv), and is skipped when it is not set up. Shutdown is Windows-only, off by default, and requires an explicit tick plus confirmation."
  }
}

{
  "title_en": "Auto Backup & Exit",
  "title_cn": "Auto Backup & Exit（自动备份并退出）",
  "menu_en": "Auto Backup & Exit...",
  "version": "1.0",
  "date": "2026-07-26",
  "cn": [
    {"heading": "简介", "blocks": [
      {"kind": "p", "text": "**Auto Backup & Exit** 提供一个“自动备份并退出 Dragonfly”的按钮：一键把当前会话的现场保存下来，然后退出 Dragonfly，甚至可选在退出后关机。"},
      {"kind": "note", "text": "本功能由第三方（Prototype Labs / Prototype Apps）提供，非 Dragonfly 官方开发或支持。快速步骤全程在进程内完成，无需联网。关机功能默认关闭，需显式勾选并确认。"}
    ]},
    {"heading": "一次备份会包含什么", "blocks": [
      {"kind": "table", "table": {"headers": ["勾选项", "写入内容"], "rows": [
        ["会话快照", "主窗口截图、各视图截图、已发布对象清单（objects.txt）、以及保存的会话文件 session.ORSSession"],
        ["对象关系图（PNG）", "复用 Show Connections 插件绘制的对象关系图，保存为 object_connections.png"],
        ["当前视图截图（PNG）", "当前激活视图的截图 current_view.png"],
        ["AI 工作日志", "复用 WorkLog 插件与其本地大模型，把当天日志整理成 Markdown（仅在 WorkLog 已配置时运行）"]
      ]}},
      {"kind": "p", "text": "每次运行都会在你选定的备份文件夹下创建一个带时间戳的子文件夹（例如 backup_20260726_180000），上述文件都写入该子文件夹。"}
    ]},
    {"heading": "两个按钮 / 退出与关机", "blocks": [
      {"kind": "bullet", "text": "**仅备份（保持打开）**：只执行勾选的备份步骤，完成后打开该文件夹以供查看，不退出 Dragonfly。"},
      {"kind": "bullet", "text": "**备份并退出 Dragonfly**：先执行备份，弹出确认框，然后干净地退出 Dragonfly。因为刚刚已保存会话，退出时不会再弹保存提示。"},
      {"kind": "bullet", "text": "**退出后关机**（可选）：勾选后，退出前会安排一次 Windows 关机（shutdown /s /t 60）。60 秒倒计时内可在命令行运行 `shutdown /a` 取消。"}
    ]},
    {"heading": "工作原理（技术路径）", "blocks": [
      {"kind": "bullet", "text": "**复用而非重写**：对象关系图直接调用 Show Connections 插件、AI 工作日志直接调用 WorkLog 插件；本插件在打包目录（GenericMenuItems）中自动定位这两个同级插件。"},
      {"kind": "bullet", "text": "**线程模型**：快速步骤（截图/保存会话/对象图）在界面线程执行；较慢的 AI 工作日志（本地大模型）在后台线程执行，不冻结界面。"},
      {"kind": "bullet", "text": "**退出方式**：使用事件循环的干净退出（QApplication.quit），而不是触发保存守卫的关闭流程——因为备份阶段已保存会话。"}
    ]},
    {"heading": "使用步骤", "blocks": [
      {"kind": "steps", "steps": [
        "菜单 Prototype Apps ▸ Auto Backup & Exit… 打开面板。",
        "选择备份文件夹（默认 用户目录\\DragonflyBackups）。",
        "勾选需要包含的内容（会话快照 / 对象关系图 / 当前视图截图 / AI 工作日志；是否退出后关机）。",
        "点“仅备份”只备份不退出；或点“备份并退出 Dragonfly”，确认后自动备份并退出（如勾选，再关机）。"
      ]}
    ]},
    {"heading": "环境需求", "blocks": [
      {"kind": "p", "text": "快速步骤无需安装/联网/GPU/虚拟环境。对象关系图需随包安装 Show Connections 插件；AI 工作日志需随包安装 WorkLog 插件并完成其一次性配置（本地模型 + 虚拟环境），未配置时该步自动跳过。关机为 Windows 专用。"}
    ]}
  ],
  "en": [
    {"heading": "Introduction", "blocks": [
      {"kind": "p", "text": "**Auto Backup & Exit** gives you a single 'back up and quit Dragonfly' button: capture the current session's scene in one click, then quit Dragonfly — and optionally shut the computer down afterwards."},
      {"kind": "note", "text": "This feature is provided by a third party (Prototype Labs / Apps), not officially developed or supported by Dragonfly. The fast steps run entirely in-process with no internet. Shutdown is off by default and requires an explicit tick plus confirmation."}
    ]},
    {"heading": "What one backup contains", "blocks": [
      {"kind": "table", "table": {"headers": ["Ticked option", "What is written"], "rows": [
        ["Session snapshot", "main-window screenshot, per-view screenshots, a list of published objects (objects.txt), and a saved session file session.ORSSession"],
        ["Object-connections graph (PNG)", "the relationship graph drawn by the Show Connections plugin, saved as object_connections.png"],
        ["Current view screenshot (PNG)", "a screenshot of the currently active view, current_view.png"],
        ["AI Work Log", "reuses the WorkLog plugin and its local LLM to turn the day's logs into Markdown (runs only if WorkLog is set up)"]
      ]}},
      {"kind": "p", "text": "Each run creates a timestamped subfolder under the backup folder you pick (e.g. backup_20260726_180000); all of the above are written into that subfolder."}
    ]},
    {"heading": "Two buttons / exit and shutdown", "blocks": [
      {"kind": "bullet", "text": "**Backup now (keep open)**: runs only the ticked backup steps, then opens the folder for review; Dragonfly stays open."},
      {"kind": "bullet", "text": "**Backup & Exit Dragonfly**: backs up, asks for confirmation, then quits Dragonfly cleanly. Because the session was just saved, quitting does not re-prompt to save."},
      {"kind": "bullet", "text": "**Shut down after exit** (optional): when ticked, a Windows shutdown is scheduled before quitting (shutdown /s /t 60). Within the 60-second countdown you can cancel it by running `shutdown /a`."}
    ]},
    {"heading": "How it works (technical path)", "blocks": [
      {"kind": "bullet", "text": "**Reuse, not re-implement**: the object-connections graph calls the Show Connections plugin and the AI Work Log calls the WorkLog plugin directly; this plugin locates those two sibling plugins automatically inside the packaged directory (GenericMenuItems)."},
      {"kind": "bullet", "text": "**Threading**: fast steps (screenshots / save session / object graph) run on the UI thread; the slower AI Work Log (local LLM) runs on a background thread so the UI never freezes."},
      {"kind": "bullet", "text": "**How it exits**: a clean event-loop quit (QApplication.quit), rather than the close flow that triggers the save guard — because the session was already saved during the backup."}
    ]},
    {"heading": "How to use", "blocks": [
      {"kind": "steps", "steps": [
        "Menu Prototype Apps ▸ Auto Backup & Exit… to open the panel.",
        "Choose a backup folder (default: your home\\DragonflyBackups).",
        "Tick what to include (session snapshot / object-connections graph / current-view screenshot / AI Work Log; and whether to shut down after exit).",
        "Click 'Backup now' to back up without exiting; or click 'Backup & Exit Dragonfly' and confirm to back up and quit (then shut down, if ticked)."
      ]}
    ]},
    {"heading": "Requirements", "blocks": [
      {"kind": "p", "text": "The fast steps need no install/internet/GPU/venv. The object-connections graph requires the Show Connections plugin to be installed alongside; the AI Work Log requires the WorkLog plugin plus its one-time setup (local model + venv), and is skipped when not set up. Shutdown is Windows-only."}
    ]}
  ]
}

{
  "title": "BigStitcher Lite",
  "cn": {
    "func": "该插件把多个 Dragonfly Channel tile 拼接成一个新的 stitched Channel。用户可以在表格中按 Z/Y/X voxel 坐标输入每个 tile 的 offset，也可以选择用 phase correlation 相对前一个 tile 或第一个 tile 估计平移；融合方式支持 mean、max、first tile wins 和 last tile wins。插件会输出 stitched Channel 和 offsets.csv。",
    "scenarios": "适用于显微、CT 或其他分块采集数据已经导入 Dragonfly，但需要在 Dragonfly 内完成轻量级平移拼接和快速预览的场景。当前版本定位为 BigStitcher Lite，优先覆盖手动/平移拼接，不包含完整 BigStitcher 的复杂元数据导入、interest-point registration 或大规模分布式处理。",
    "requirements": "需要至少两个已存在的 Channel tile。首次使用需要在插件 Setup tab 中创建独立 venv 并安装 numpy、scipy、scikit-image；安装时需要联网。运行时不需要 GPU、Fiji、ImageJ 或 Java。在 Dragonfly 2027.1（Python 3.14）上不能用 Dragonfly 自带的 Python 创建该环境：请安装 python.org 的 Python（3.12、3.13 或 3.14）并填入面板的 Base Python；Dragonfly 2025.1 无需另装 Python。"
  },
  "en": {
    "func": "Stitches multiple Dragonfly Channel tiles into one stitched Channel. Users can enter each tile's Z/Y/X voxel offset in a table, or estimate translations by phase correlation relative to the previous tile or first tile; blending supports mean, max, first-tile-wins, and last-tile-wins. The plugin writes a stitched Channel and offsets.csv.",
    "scenarios": "For microscopy, CT, or other tiled acquisitions that are already loaded in Dragonfly and need lightweight translational stitching or quick preview fusion inside Dragonfly. This is BigStitcher Lite: it focuses on manual/translation stitching and does not include full BigStitcher metadata import, interest-point registration, or distributed large-scale processing.",
    "requirements": "Requires at least two existing Channel tiles. First use builds an isolated plugin venv and installs numpy, scipy, and scikit-image from PyPI; internet is needed for setup only. No GPU, Fiji, ImageJ, or Java is required. On Dragonfly 2027.1 (Python 3.14) the bundled Python cannot build this environment: install a python.org Python (3.12, 3.13 or 3.14) and enter it in the panel's Base Python field; Dragonfly 2025.1 needs no separate Python."
  }
}

{
  "title": "Load Images (Bio-Formats)",
  "cn": {
    "func": "用 Bio-Formats（OME 开源库，支持约 150 种显微镜/厂商图像格式，如 CZI、LIF、ND2、OIB、OME-TIFF、LSM、VSI、SVS/NDPI、IMS 等）在 Dragonfly 内打开图像文件。弹出窗口中：选择文件后点击 Preview 预览缩略图与元数据参数（格式、series 数、X/Y/Z 尺寸、通道数 C、时间点 T、像素类型、物理体素尺寸等）；可选择 series 与时间点；最后点击 Import 把该文件读入并 Publish 为 Dragonfly image Channel（多通道会拆成多个 Channel，物理像素尺寸写入体素 spacing）。读取逻辑沿用 UnitedVision 项目的 Bio-Formats 实现，但把 JVM 桥从 javabridge 换成 jpype/scyjava，安装更简单。",
    "scenarios": "适用于把 Dragonfly 原生不支持的显微镜/生物成像/数字病理厂商格式导入 Dragonfly：共聚焦/宽场荧光（CZI/LIF/ND2/OIB/LSM）、光片、数字病理切片（SVS/NDPI/VSI/SCN）、OME-TIFF 等。也可用于快速查看某个文件的维度与元数据后再决定导入哪个 series/通道。",
    "requirements": "首次使用需在 Setup 页创建独立 venv 并安装 jpype1、scyjava、bioformats_jar、numpy、Pillow（联网，均为预编译 wheel，无需 MSVC/无需手动装 JDK）。首次读取时 scyjava/cjdk 会自动下载一个约 40 MB 的 Java 运行时到用户缓存。不需要 GPU、Fiji、ImageJ，也不需要系统预装 Java。在 Dragonfly 2027.1（Python 3.14）上不能用 Dragonfly 自带的 Python 创建该环境：请安装 python.org 的 Python（3.12、3.13 或 3.14）并填入面板的 Base Python；Dragonfly 2025.1 无需另装 Python。"
  },
  "en": {
    "func": "Opens image files inside Dragonfly using Bio-Formats (the OME open-source library that reads ~150 microscopy/vendor formats: CZI, LIF, ND2, OIB, OME-TIFF, LSM, VSI, SVS/NDPI, IMS, ...). In the popup: pick a file and click Preview to see a thumbnail plus the metadata parameters (format, series count, X/Y/Z sizes, channels C, timepoints T, pixel type, physical voxel size); choose a series and timepoint; then click Import to read the file and Publish it as Dragonfly image Channel(s) (multi-channel is split into separate Channels; the OME physical pixel size is written to the voxel spacing). The reader logic is carried over from the UnitedVision project's Bio-Formats implementation, with the JVM bridge switched from javabridge to jpype/scyjava for far easier installation.",
    "scenarios": "For importing microscopy / bio-imaging / digital-pathology vendor formats that Dragonfly does not open natively: confocal/widefield fluorescence (CZI/LIF/ND2/OIB/LSM), light-sheet, whole-slide pathology (SVS/NDPI/VSI/SCN), OME-TIFF, and more. Also handy for quickly inspecting a file's dimensions and metadata before deciding which series/channel to import.",
    "requirements": "First use builds an isolated venv and installs jpype1, scyjava, bioformats_jar, numpy, Pillow (internet; all prebuilt wheels - no MSVC, no manual JDK). On the first read, scyjava/cjdk auto-downloads a ~40 MB Java runtime to the user cache. No GPU, Fiji, ImageJ, or pre-installed system Java required. On Dragonfly 2027.1 (Python 3.14) the bundled Python cannot build this environment: install a python.org Python (3.12, 3.13 or 3.14) and enter it in the panel's Base Python field; Dragonfly 2025.1 needs no separate Python."
  }
}

{
  "title": "BounTI Hard Tissue Segmentation",
  "cn": {
    "func": "把单一阈值会粘连成一整块的硬组织元素分开。六个编号步骤：选择通道与可选限定 ROI；确认体素尺寸；设定种子阈值（高）、最终阈值（低）、对象数量、阈值步数、连通性、最小种子体积与**标签冲突规则**；在降采样数据上预览（不发布任何对象）；全分辨率运行；最后发布最终 MultiROI 与种子，并导出对象表与 JSON。方法来自 BounTI：先在高阈值处取得彼此分离的致密核心作为种子，然后逐级降低阈值把已有标签生长进新暴露的体素，任何时候都不允许两个标签合并。标签冲突规则决定两个对象相遇处的边界如何确定，因此显式交由用户选择；默认规则不会凭空指定边界位置。本插件只做分离，不计算任何骨形态学指标。",
    "scenarios": "适用于：把颅骨 CT 中相互接触的各块骨分开；分离粘连的牙齿、骨化中心或其它致密结构；以及任何「单一阈值把本应分开的致密对象连成一片」的场合。",
    "requirements": "无需任何安装或配置：完全运行在 Dragonfly 自带的 Python 中，使用其已附带的 NumPy 与 SciPy。不联网、不下载、不需要 GPU、不创建虚拟环境。"
  },
  "en": {
    "func": "Separates touching hard-tissue elements that a single threshold merges into one blob, in six numbered steps: choose the Channel and an optional restricting ROI; confirm the voxel size; set the seed threshold (high), final threshold (low), number of objects, threshold steps, connectivity, minimum seed size and the **label-collision rule**; preview on downsampled data, publishing nothing; run at full resolution; and finally publish the resulting MultiROI and the seeds, and export the object table and JSON. Following BounTI: seed at a high threshold where the dense cores are still separate, then lower the threshold step by step, growing the existing labels into newly-revealed voxels while never letting two labels merge. The collision rule decides where the boundary between two objects falls and is therefore left explicitly to the user; the default never invents a boundary position. This is a separation tool and computes no bone morphometry.",
    "scenarios": "Use it to separate the individual bones of a skull in CT, to split touching teeth, ossification centres or other dense structures, and generally wherever a single threshold fuses objects that should be distinct.",
    "requirements": "Nothing to install or configure: it runs entirely in Dragonfly's own Python using the NumPy and SciPy it already ships. No internet, no download, no GPU, no virtual environment."
  }
}

{
  "title_en": "BounTI Hard Tissue Segmentation",
  "title_cn": "BounTI Hard Tissue Segmentation（BounTI 硬组织分割）",
  "menu_en": "BounTI Hard Tissue Segmentation...",
  "version": "1.0",
  "date": "2026-08-02",
  "cn": [
    {
      "heading": "简介",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "把单一阈值会粘连成一整块的硬组织元素分开——例如颅骨中相互接触的各块骨。方法来自 BounTI：先在**高阈值**处取得只剩致密核心、彼此仍分离的种子，保留其中最大的 N 个；随后逐级降低阈值，把已有标签生长到新暴露的体素中，且任何时候都不允许两个标签合并。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "note",
          "text": "**本插件只做「分离」**——判断每个体素属于哪个元素——不计算任何骨形态学指标（BV/TV、Tb.Th、Tb.Sp、连通密度等）。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "note",
          "text": "**标签冲突规则就是算法本身。** 两个对象同时到达同一个体素时，必须有规则来决定归属，而不同规则会给出不同结果，因此该规则显式交由用户选择。默认规则让争议体素保持未分配——插件绝不凭空指定边界位置——并报告争议体素的数量。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "适用场景",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "bullet",
          "text": "把颅骨 CT 中相互接触的各块骨分开。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "bullet",
          "text": "分离粘连的牙齿、骨化中心或其它致密结构。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "bullet",
          "text": "任何「单一阈值把本应分开的致密对象连成一片」的场合。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "安装与启用",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "steps",
          "steps": [
            "安装 Prototype Apps 完整包（或在 App Store 中勾选本插件）。",
            "本插件默认**未启用**，请在 App Store 或菜单项管理器中启用。",
            "**完全重启 Dragonfly**（插件只在启动时被发现）。"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "运行环境与首次配置",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "**无需任何安装或配置。** 完全运行在 Dragonfly 自带的 Python 中，使用其已附带的 NumPy 与 SciPy。不联网、不下载、不需要 GPU、不创建虚拟环境。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "界面说明",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "h3",
          "text": "1. 输入"
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "选择通道与可选的限定 ROI（只列出已发布对象）、时间步。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "h3",
          "text": "2. 标定与预处理"
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "确认体素尺寸；对象缺少几何信息时可手动指定。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "h3",
          "text": "3. 参数"
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "种子阈值（高）、最终阈值（低）、对象数量、阈值步数、连通性、最小种子体积，以及标签冲突规则。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "h3",
          "text": "4. 预览与质检"
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "在降采样数据上以较短的阈值阶梯快速运行。**不发布任何对象。**"
        },
        {
          "kind": "h3",
          "text": "5. 运行"
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "全分辨率运行完整阶梯，可随时取消。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "h3",
          "text": "6. 结果与导出"
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "每个对象的体素数、体积、种子体积与生长倍数；发布最终 MultiROI 与种子；导出对象表（CSV）与 JSON。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "使用步骤",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "steps",
          "steps": [
            "第 1 步选择通道。",
            "第 3 步把种子阈值设到只剩致密核心且彼此分离的位置。",
            "第 4 步预览，确认种子数量正确。",
            "第 5 步全分辨率运行。",
            "第 6 步检查争议体素数量，然后发布或导出。"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "参数说明",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "table",
          "table": {
            "headers": [
              "参数",
              "默认值",
              "说明"
            ],
            "rows": [
              [
                "种子阈值（高）",
                "200",
                "只有致密核心存活、各元素仍分离的阈值"
              ],
              [
                "最终阈值（低）",
                "80",
                "生长停止的阈值，必须低于种子阈值"
              ],
              [
                "对象数量",
                "2",
                "保留最大的 N 个种子"
              ],
              [
                "阈值步数",
                "10",
                "从种子阈值降到最终阈值的级数"
              ],
              [
                "连通性",
                "6 连通",
                "判定连通与生长方向"
              ],
              [
                "最小种子体积",
                "1",
                "小于此体积的种子被丢弃"
              ],
              [
                "标签冲突规则",
                "边界（不分配）",
                "另有「最近对象」与「置信度最高」"
              ]
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "输出结果",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "table",
          "table": {
            "headers": [
              "输出",
              "含义"
            ],
            "rows": [
              [
                "最终 MultiROI",
                "每个体素归属的元素"
              ],
              [
                "种子 MultiROI",
                "高阈值处的初始种子，用于核对"
              ],
              [
                "对象表",
                "每个对象的体素数、体积、种子体积与生长倍数"
              ],
              [
                "争议体素数",
                "被两个以上对象同时争夺的体素数量"
              ],
              [
                "生长曲线",
                "每一级阈值下各对象的体积"
              ]
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "常见问题与故障排除",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "bullet",
          "text": "**提示种子数量不足** —— 种子阈值太低，各核心尚未分开；提高它，或减少要求的对象数量。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "bullet",
          "text": "**提示种子阈值必须高于最终阈值** —— 本方法自高向低进行，两者写反了。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "bullet",
          "text": "**争议体素非常多** —— 说明这些元素在该处确实相接，边界位置是一种选择而非测量结果，请谨慎解读。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "bullet",
          "text": "**有体素高于最终阈值却未被分配** —— 它们与任何种子都不连通。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "注意事项与已知限制",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "bullet",
          "text": "整卷读入内存；超大体积请先裁剪或用预览确定参数。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "bullet",
          "text": "输入必须是**已发布**的通道。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "bullet",
          "text": "发布始终是第 6 步的显式操作。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "bullet",
          "text": "生长顺序无关：结果不依赖标签编号顺序。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "参考资料",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "方法来自 Didziokas 等人的 BounTI（MIT）：https://github.com/Didziokas/BounTI ——未复制其源代码。若发表使用本方法得到的结果，请引用 BounTI 作者的论文。"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "en": [
    {
      "heading": "Introduction",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "Separates touching hard-tissue elements that a single threshold merges into one blob — the individual bones of a skull, for instance. Following BounTI: seed at a **high threshold** where only the dense cores survive and the elements are still apart, keep the largest N, then lower the threshold step by step, growing the existing labels into newly-revealed voxels while never letting two labels merge."
        },
        {
          "kind": "note",
          "text": "**This is a separation tool** — it decides which element each voxel belongs to — and computes no bone morphometry (BV/TV, Tb.Th, Tb.Sp, connectivity density and so on)."
        },
        {
          "kind": "note",
          "text": "**The label-collision rule is the algorithm.** When two objects both reach the same voxel something has to break the tie, and different rules give different answers, so the choice is left explicitly to the user. The default leaves contested voxels unassigned — the plugin never invents a boundary position — and reports how many there were."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "Use cases",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "bullet",
          "text": "Separating the individual bones of a skull in CT."
        },
        {
          "kind": "bullet",
          "text": "Splitting touching teeth, ossification centres or other dense structures."
        },
        {
          "kind": "bullet",
          "text": "Anywhere a single threshold fuses dense objects that should be distinct."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "Installation & enabling",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "steps",
          "steps": [
            "Install the Prototype Apps package (or tick this plugin in the App Store).",
            "This plugin is **disabled by default** — enable it in the App Store or the Menu Item Manager.",
            "**Restart Dragonfly completely** (plugins are discovered at startup only)."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "Runtime environment & first-run setup",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "**Nothing to install or configure.** It runs entirely in Dragonfly's own Python using the NumPy and SciPy it already ships. No internet, no download, no GPU, no virtual environment."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "Interface",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "h3",
          "text": "1. Inputs"
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "Choose the Channel and an optional restricting ROI (published objects only), plus the timestep."
        },
        {
          "kind": "h3",
          "text": "2. Calibration & Preprocessing"
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "Confirm the voxel size, or set it by hand for objects without geometry."
        },
        {
          "kind": "h3",
          "text": "3. Parameters"
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "Seed threshold (high), final threshold (low), number of objects, threshold steps, connectivity, minimum seed size, and the label-collision rule."
        },
        {
          "kind": "h3",
          "text": "4. Preview & QC"
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "A fast pass on downsampled data with a short ladder. **Nothing is published.**"
        },
        {
          "kind": "h3",
          "text": "5. Run"
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "The full ladder at full resolution, cancellable at any time."
        },
        {
          "kind": "h3",
          "text": "6. Results & Export"
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "Per-object voxel count, volume, seed size and growth factor; publish the final MultiROI and the seeds; export the object table (CSV) and JSON."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "How to use",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "steps",
          "steps": [
            "Pick the Channel in step 1.",
            "In step 3 set the seed threshold where only the dense cores survive and they are separate.",
            "Preview in step 4 and confirm the right number of seeds was found.",
            "Run at full resolution in step 5.",
            "Check the contested-voxel count in step 6, then publish or export."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "Parameters",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "table",
          "table": {
            "headers": [
              "Parameter",
              "Default",
              "Meaning"
            ],
            "rows": [
              [
                "Seed threshold (high)",
                "200",
                "where only the dense cores survive and elements are still apart"
              ],
              [
                "Final threshold (low)",
                "80",
                "where growth stops; must be below the seed threshold"
              ],
              [
                "Number of objects",
                "2",
                "keep the largest N seeds"
              ],
              [
                "Threshold steps",
                "10",
                "levels between the seed and final thresholds"
              ],
              [
                "Connectivity",
                "6-connected",
                "how connectivity and growth directions are judged"
              ],
              [
                "Minimum seed size",
                "1",
                "seeds smaller than this are discarded"
              ],
              [
                "Label collision rule",
                "boundary (unassigned)",
                "or nearest object, or most confident object"
              ]
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "Output",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "table",
          "table": {
            "headers": [
              "Output",
              "Meaning"
            ],
            "rows": [
              [
                "Final MultiROI",
                "which element each voxel belongs to"
              ],
              [
                "Seeds MultiROI",
                "the initial high-threshold seeds, for checking"
              ],
              [
                "Object table",
                "voxels, volume, seed size and growth factor per object"
              ],
              [
                "Contested voxels",
                "how many voxels more than one object reached"
              ],
              [
                "Growth curves",
                "each object's volume at every threshold level"
              ]
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "FAQ & troubleshooting",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "bullet",
          "text": "**Fewer seeds than requested** — the seed threshold is too low and the cores have not separated; raise it, or ask for fewer objects."
        },
        {
          "kind": "bullet",
          "text": "**\"seed threshold must be HIGHER than the final threshold\"** — the method works downwards; the two values are the wrong way round."
        },
        {
          "kind": "bullet",
          "text": "**A very large contested set** — those elements genuinely touch there, so the boundary is a choice rather than a measurement. Interpret accordingly."
        },
        {
          "kind": "bullet",
          "text": "**Voxels above the final threshold left unassigned** — they are not connected to any seed."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "Notes & known limitations",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "bullet",
          "text": "The whole volume is read into memory; crop large data or settle parameters with the preview."
        },
        {
          "kind": "bullet",
          "text": "Inputs must be **published** Channels."
        },
        {
          "kind": "bullet",
          "text": "Publishing is always an explicit step-6 action."
        },
        {
          "kind": "bullet",
          "text": "Growth is order-independent: the result does not depend on how the labels are numbered."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "References",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "The method follows BounTI by Didziokas et al. (MIT): https://github.com/Didziokas/BounTI — no source was copied. Please cite the BounTI authors' publication if you publish results obtained with this method."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}

{
  "title": "Deep Denoising (CAREamics)…",
  "cn": {
    "func": "使用 CAREamics（基于 PyTorch）在您自己的数据上训练并应用深度学习去噪/复原模型，包含自监督的 Noise2Void 与 N2V2，以及有监督的 CARE 和 Noise2Noise。在 Train（训练）选项卡中选择一个含噪的图像 Channel、算法、patch 大小、训练轮数和模型名称即可训练；N2V/N2V2 只需含噪数据本身（自监督），CARE 需要一张干净的目标 Channel，Noise2Noise 需要第二次含噪采集作为目标。训练完成后在 Apply（应用）选项卡中选择训练好的模型和一个 Channel，插件即输出一个与原图同网格（相同 spacing/origin）的去噪 Channel，并保存模型供复用。Dragonfly 自带经典滤波器，但没有可学习的自监督去噪器，本插件填补了这一空白。\n\n「Setup」页的**一键执行全部步骤（按当前设置）**会无人值守地跑完流程：环境安装 → 训练 → 去噪并发布，每一步都使用你按下按钮那一刻各自页签上显示的设置。**环境安装是复选框且默认关闭**（要下载几个 GB，装一次即可）；**训练是复选框且默认开启**，因为训练结果的模型路径会直接写入「Apply」页，所以「训练完就去噪并发布」是一次过夜运行的**同一个意图**，而不该分成两次操作。未勾选的步骤会被记录为「未选择」，绝不会被悄悄跳过。两个浏览按钮不在流程内：它们会弹出无人值守运行无法回答的模态对话框，因此工作目录与模型路径完全按输入框中的文字采用。所有页签始终可以打开和修改参数，以便在运行**之前**逐页检查；某一步所需的输入尚不存在时，会在**它自己的按钮**上给出提示，说明缺的是哪一步，而不是把整个页签锁住不让进入。",
    "scenarios": "适用于任何噪声较大、经典滤波会损失细节的体数据或图像栈：低剂量 / 快速采集的显微 CT 与工业 CT、电子显微镜（TEM/SEM）、荧光与光片显微镜等。当没有干净的参考图像时使用 Noise2Void / N2V2（仅凭含噪数据本身即可去噪）；当有配对的干净图像时使用 CARE；当有两次独立含噪采集时使用 Noise2Noise。特别适合需要在保留细结构的前提下批量清理同类数据集的用户——训练一次，即可应用到其余数据。",
    "requirements": "首次使用请点击\"Setup Environment\"（使用 Dragonfly 自带 Python 构建独立运行环境，从 cu124 CUDA 轮子索引安装 torch/torchvision 再安装 careamics，下载数 GB）；需要联网和 NVIDIA GPU（Turing 显卡如 RTX 8000 请使用 fp16，勿用 bf16）。所有重计算均在该独立环境的子进程中运行，绝不加载进 Dragonfly 的 Python。在 Dragonfly 2027.1（Python 3.14）上不能用 Dragonfly 自带的 Python 创建该环境：请安装 python.org 的 Python（3.12 或 3.13）并填入面板的 Base Python；Dragonfly 2025.1 无需另装 Python。"
  },
  "en": {
    "func": "Trains and applies deep-learning denoising / restoration models on your own data with CAREamics (PyTorch): self-supervised Noise2Void and N2V2, plus supervised CARE and Noise2Noise. In the Train tab you pick a noisy image Channel, an algorithm, a patch size, epochs and a model name; N2V/N2V2 need only the noisy data itself (self-supervised), CARE needs a clean target Channel, and Noise2Noise needs a second noisy acquisition as the target. After training, the Apply tab takes a trained model plus a Channel and outputs a denoised Channel on the SAME grid (identical spacing/origin) as the input, and the trained model is saved for reuse. Dragonfly ships classical filters but no learned self-supervised denoiser, which this plugin adds.\n\n**Execute All Steps with Current Settings** on the Setup tab runs the workflow unattended - set up the environment, train, denoise and publish - each step with whatever its own tab shows when you press it. Setting up the environment is a tick box and is OFF by default (a few GB, built once); training is a tick box and is ON, because the training result's model path is handed straight to the Apply tab, so 'train, then denoise and publish' is a single overnight intent rather than two visits. An unticked step is logged as not selected, never passed over in silence. The two browse buttons stay out of the chain: they open a modal dialog an unattended run cannot answer, so the workspace folder and model path are taken exactly as the boxes read. Every tab stays open at all times so the parameters can be read and changed BEFORE the run; a step whose input does not exist yet refuses at its own button and says which step is missing, instead of the tab being locked shut.",
    "scenarios": "Ideal for noisy volumes or image stacks where classical filtering blurs fine detail: low-dose / fast-acquisition micro-CT and industrial CT, electron microscopy (TEM/SEM), fluorescence and light-sheet microscopy. Use Noise2Void / N2V2 when you have no clean reference (they denoise from the noisy data alone); use CARE when a paired clean image exists; use Noise2Noise when you have two independent noisy acquisitions. Especially useful for anyone cleaning many similar datasets while preserving fine structures — train once, then apply to the rest.",
    "requirements": "First use: click Setup Environment (builds an isolated environment with Dragonfly's own Python, installs torch/torchvision from the cu124 CUDA wheel index, then careamics — several GB download); needs internet + an NVIDIA GPU (on Turing cards such as RTX 8000, use fp16, not bf16). All heavy compute runs in that environment's subprocess, never loaded into Dragonfly's own Python. On Dragonfly 2027.1 (Python 3.14) the bundled Python cannot build this environment: install a python.org Python (3.12 or 3.13) and enter it in the panel's Base Python field; Dragonfly 2025.1 needs no separate Python."
  }
}

{
  "title": "CellFocus Volume Crop & QC",
  "cn": {
    "func": "在体积电镜（SBF-SEM 等）图像栈中找到细胞并裁剪到它的三维包围盒。六个编号步骤：选择通道与时间步；设定细胞极性、平滑与闭运算（均作用于工作副本，不修改输入对象）；设定面积上下限、最小对比度、裁剪边距、异常灵敏度与裁剪方式；在降采样数据上预览（不发布任何对象）；全分辨率运行；最后发布裁剪后的通道或细胞掩膜 ROI，并导出逐层表格与 JSON。默认的固定三维包围盒裁剪会明确携带并应用新的 origin，使每个体素保持其真实空间位置；若当前 Dragonfly 版本无法设置 origin，插件会在发布时明确警告并给出偏移量。",
    "scenarios": "适用于：体积电镜数据在进入分割或深度学习流程前的裁剪与瘦身；快速判断一个图像栈中哪些层存在充电、失焦或空白；为深度学习准备居中的训练帧（需明确接受其破坏层间几何关系）。",
    "requirements": "无需任何安装或配置：完全运行在 Dragonfly 自带的 Python 中，使用其已附带的 NumPy 与 SciPy。不联网、不下载、不需要 GPU、不创建虚拟环境。"
  },
  "en": {
    "func": "Finds the cell in a volume-EM (SBF-SEM and similar) stack and crops to its 3-D bounding box, in six numbered steps: choose the Channel and timestep; set cell polarity, smoothing and closing (all applied to a working copy, never to the input object); set the area bounds, minimum contrast, crop margin, anomaly sensitivity and crop mode; preview on downsampled data, publishing nothing; run at full resolution; and finally publish the cropped Channel or the cell-mask ROI and export the per-slice table and JSON. The default fixed 3-D bounding-box crop explicitly carries and applies the new origin so every voxel keeps its true position in space; if this Dragonfly build cannot set an origin, the plugin warns clearly at publish time and states the resulting offset.",
    "scenarios": "Use it to crop and shrink volume-EM data before segmentation or deep learning; to see at a glance which slices in a stack are charged, out of focus or blank; and to prepare centred training frames for deep learning, having explicitly accepted that this breaks the geometry between slices.",
    "requirements": "Nothing to install or configure: it runs entirely in Dragonfly's own Python using the NumPy and SciPy it already ships. No internet, no download, no GPU, no virtual environment."
  }
}

{
  "title_en": "CellFocus Volume Crop & QC",
  "title_cn": "CellFocus Volume Crop & QC（细胞体积裁剪与质检）",
  "menu_en": "CellFocus Volume Crop & QC...",
  "version": "1.0",
  "date": "2026-08-02",
  "cn": [
    {
      "heading": "简介",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "在体积电镜（SBF-SEM 等）图像栈中找到细胞，裁剪到它的三维包围盒，并给出足以判断这次裁剪是否可信的质检信息。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "note",
          "text": "**裁剪本质上是一次平移。** 因此插件会明确返回并在发布时应用新的 origin，让每个体素仍然位于其真实空间位置，裁剪之后所做的任何测量依然成立。若当前 Dragonfly 版本无法设置 origin，插件会在发布时**明确警告**并给出偏移量——绝不悄悄发布一个被挪动过的对象。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "note",
          "text": "**逐层重新居中会破坏几何关系。** 该模式为深度学习训练帧准备，它独立平移每一层，因此层与层之间的空间关系被破坏，输出上的任何三维测量都不再成立。它绝非默认选项，会保存每层的 dx/dy 以便撤销，并在运行**之前**就给出警告。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "适用场景",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "bullet",
          "text": "体积电镜数据在进入分割或深度学习流程前的裁剪与瘦身。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "bullet",
          "text": "快速判断一个图像栈中哪些层存在充电、失焦或空白。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "bullet",
          "text": "为深度学习准备居中的训练帧（需明确接受其破坏层间几何关系）。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "安装与启用",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "steps",
          "steps": [
            "安装 Prototype Apps 完整包（或在 App Store 中勾选本插件）。",
            "本插件默认**未启用**，请在 App Store 或菜单项管理器中启用。",
            "**完全重启 Dragonfly**（插件只在启动时被发现）。"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "运行环境与首次配置",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "**无需任何安装或配置。** 完全运行在 Dragonfly 自带的 Python 中，使用其已附带的 NumPy 与 SciPy。不联网、不下载、不需要 GPU、不创建虚拟环境。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "面板顶部会显示当前 Dragonfly 版本是否支持发布通道、发布 ROI 以及**设置 origin**。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "界面说明",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "h3",
          "text": "1. 输入"
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "选择通道（只列出已发布对象）与时间步；显示形状、三轴间距与 origin。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "h3",
          "text": "2. 标定与预处理"
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "细胞极性（亮/暗）、平滑 sigma、闭运算半径。预处理只作用于工作副本，绝不修改输入对象。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "h3",
          "text": "3. 参数"
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "最小/最大细胞面积占比、最小对比度、裁剪边距、异常灵敏度 k、裁剪方式，以及是否将背景置零。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "h3",
          "text": "4. 预览与质检"
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "在降采样数据上快速运行，显示包围盒与保留比例。**不发布任何对象**，也不启用导出按钮。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "h3",
          "text": "5. 运行"
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "全分辨率运行，可随时取消。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "h3",
          "text": "6. 结果与导出"
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "发布裁剪后的通道或细胞掩膜 ROI；导出逐层表格（CSV）与完整结果（JSON，含每层 dx/dy）。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "使用步骤",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "steps",
          "steps": [
            "第 1 步选择通道。",
            "第 2 步确认细胞极性。",
            "第 4 步先跑预览，确认包围盒合理、没有大量异常层。",
            "第 5 步全分辨率运行。",
            "第 6 步发布或导出。"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "参数说明",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "table",
          "table": {
            "headers": [
              "参数",
              "默认值",
              "说明"
            ],
            "rows": [
              [
                "细胞极性",
                "亮细胞",
                "细胞灰度高于还是低于背景"
              ],
              [
                "平滑 sigma",
                "2.0",
                "分割前的高斯平滑，抑制噪声"
              ],
              [
                "闭运算半径",
                "3",
                "填补细胞边缘的小缺口"
              ],
              [
                "最小细胞面积占比",
                "0.001",
                "小于此比例视为噪点，判为无细胞"
              ],
              [
                "最大细胞面积占比",
                "0.95",
                "大于此比例视为空白层被误分割"
              ],
              [
                "最小对比度",
                "3.0",
                "两类灰度均值之差；低于此值判定该层无结构"
              ],
              [
                "裁剪边距",
                "0",
                "在包围盒外额外保留的体素层数"
              ],
              [
                "异常灵敏度 k",
                "5.0",
                "偏离中位数多少个稳健标准差算异常"
              ],
              [
                "裁剪方式",
                "固定三维包围盒",
                "另一选项为逐层重新居中（破坏几何）"
              ],
              [
                "将背景置零",
                "关闭",
                "把掩膜之外的体素设为 0"
              ]
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "输出结果",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "table",
          "table": {
            "headers": [
              "输出",
              "含义"
            ],
            "rows": [
              [
                "裁剪后的通道",
                "裁剪结果，携带新的 origin"
              ],
              [
                "细胞掩膜 ROI",
                "逐层分割得到的细胞掩膜"
              ],
              [
                "逐层表格 CSV",
                "每层的面积、阈值、灰度、质心与异常标记"
              ],
              [
                "JSON",
                "包围盒、origin、压缩比、异常层、每层 dx/dy 与全部告警"
              ]
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "常见问题与故障排除",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "bullet",
          "text": "**提示某些层没有检测到细胞** —— 若这些层确实在细胞范围之外，属于正常现象；若不是，请检查细胞极性与最小对比度。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "bullet",
          "text": "**发布时出现 origin 警告** —— 当前 Dragonfly 版本无法设置对象 origin，发布出来的裁剪会位于源对象的位置，警告中给出了具体偏移量。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "bullet",
          "text": "**包围盒几乎等于整个体积** —— 通常是空白层被误分割成大块「细胞」；降低最大面积占比或提高最小对比度。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "注意事项与已知限制",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "bullet",
          "text": "整卷读入内存；超大体积请先用预览确定参数。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "bullet",
          "text": "输入必须是**已发布**的通道。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "bullet",
          "text": "发布始终是第 6 步的显式操作，预览与运行都不会发布任何对象。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "bullet",
          "text": "逐层重新居中后的数据**不可用于任何三维测量**。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "参考资料",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "工作流参考 Hermine-K/amira-sbfsem-cell-mask（MIT）：https://github.com/Hermine-K/amira-sbfsem-cell-mask ——未复制其源代码，运行时不需要 Amira 或 Hx API。阈值方法：N. Otsu, IEEE Trans. SMC 9(1), 1979。"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "en": [
    {
      "heading": "Introduction",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "Finds the cell in a volume-EM (SBF-SEM and similar) stack, crops to its 3-D bounding box, and reports enough QC to judge whether that crop is trustworthy."
        },
        {
          "kind": "note",
          "text": "**Cropping is a translation.** The plugin therefore returns the new origin and applies it when publishing, so every voxel keeps its true position in space and any measurement made after the crop is still valid. If this Dragonfly build cannot set an origin, the plugin **warns clearly** at publish time and states the resulting offset — it never quietly publishes a displaced object."
        },
        {
          "kind": "note",
          "text": "**Per-slice re-centring destroys geometry.** That mode exists for deep-learning training frames; it translates each slice independently, so the spatial relationship between slices is destroyed and no 3-D measurement on the output is meaningful. It is never the default, it saves every dx/dy so it can be undone, and it warns **before** the run, not only after."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "Use cases",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "bullet",
          "text": "Cropping and shrinking volume-EM data before segmentation or deep learning."
        },
        {
          "kind": "bullet",
          "text": "Seeing at a glance which slices in a stack are charged, out of focus or blank."
        },
        {
          "kind": "bullet",
          "text": "Preparing centred training frames for deep learning, having accepted that it breaks the geometry between slices."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "Installation & enabling",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "steps",
          "steps": [
            "Install the Prototype Apps package (or tick this plugin in the App Store).",
            "This plugin is **disabled by default** — enable it in the App Store or the Menu Item Manager.",
            "**Restart Dragonfly completely** (plugins are discovered at startup only)."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "Runtime environment & first-run setup",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "**Nothing to install or configure.** It runs entirely in Dragonfly's own Python using the NumPy and SciPy it already ships. No internet, no download, no GPU, no virtual environment."
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "The header reports whether this build can publish Channels, publish ROIs and **set an origin**."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "Interface",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "h3",
          "text": "1. Inputs"
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "Choose the Channel (published objects only) and timestep; shape, spacing and origin are shown."
        },
        {
          "kind": "h3",
          "text": "2. Calibration & Preprocessing"
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "Cell polarity, smoothing sigma and closing radius. Preprocessing acts on a working copy and never modifies the input object."
        },
        {
          "kind": "h3",
          "text": "3. Parameters"
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "Minimum and maximum cell area fraction, minimum contrast, crop margin, anomaly sensitivity k, crop mode, and whether to zero the background."
        },
        {
          "kind": "h3",
          "text": "4. Preview & QC"
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "A fast pass on downsampled data showing the box and the fraction kept. **Nothing is published** and the export buttons stay disabled."
        },
        {
          "kind": "h3",
          "text": "5. Run"
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "Full resolution, cancellable at any time."
        },
        {
          "kind": "h3",
          "text": "6. Results & Export"
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "Publish the cropped Channel or the cell-mask ROI; export the per-slice table (CSV) and the full result (JSON, including per-slice dx/dy)."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "How to use",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "steps",
          "steps": [
            "Pick the Channel in step 1.",
            "Confirm the cell polarity in step 2.",
            "Run a preview in step 4 and check the box looks sensible with few anomalous slices.",
            "Run at full resolution in step 5.",
            "Publish or export in step 6."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "Parameters",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "table",
          "table": {
            "headers": [
              "Parameter",
              "Default",
              "Meaning"
            ],
            "rows": [
              [
                "Cell polarity",
                "bright",
                "whether the cell is brighter or darker than background"
              ],
              [
                "Smoothing sigma",
                "2.0",
                "Gaussian smoothing before segmentation"
              ],
              [
                "Closing radius",
                "3",
                "closes small gaps in the cell outline"
              ],
              [
                "Minimum cell area fraction",
                "0.001",
