          "kind": "bullet",
          "text": "**Some slices report no cell** — normal if they lie outside the cell; otherwise check the polarity and the minimum contrast."
        },
        {
          "kind": "bullet",
          "text": "**An origin warning at publish time** — this build cannot set an object origin, so the published crop sits at the source's position; the warning states the exact offset."
