          "kind": "p",
          "text": "The workflow follows Hermine-K/amira-sbfsem-cell-mask (MIT): https://github.com/Hermine-K/amira-sbfsem-cell-mask — no source was copied and no Amira or Hx API is required. Thresholding: N. Otsu, IEEE Trans. SMC 9(1), 1979."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}

{
  "title": "Train Custom Model: Cellpose",
  "cn": {
    "func": "该插件让您直接使用 Dragonfly 中的数据训练属于自己的 Cellpose 细胞/目标分割模型，然后将其应用到完整图像上。在\"训练\"选项卡中，您选择一个图像通道（Channel）以及一个已标注目标的 MultiROI（每个标签对应一个目标），添加一张或多张已标注切片作为训练样本，选择起始基础模型（内置的 Cellpose-SAM 模型或此前的自定义模型），设置训练轮数与学习率，即可生成并保存一个新模型。在\"推理\"选项卡中，您选择任一已训练模型和一个图像通道，设置拼接与检测阈值，插件会逐切片进行分割、在整个堆栈中拼接结果，并将检测到的目标作为新的 MultiROI 发布回场景中。训练与推理选项卡都提供\"计算设备（Compute device）\"下拉框，可选择 Auto（有 GPU 时自动用 GPU）、GPU 或 CPU；当显卡显存不足（CUDA out of memory）或没有 GPU 时，选择 CPU 即可正常运行（速度较慢）。",
    "scenarios": "非常适合生命科学和生物医学成像场景：需要在二维切片或三维堆栈中分割细胞、细胞核或类似的圆形结构，且通用模型需要针对您自己的染色、放大倍率或样品类型进行微调时。它也适用于以下工作流程：您手动标注了少量切片，希望得到一个能推广到整个大型数据集的模型；也可调整用于分割材料或工业图像中的其他团块状特征。",
    "requirements": "在 Dragonfly 2025.1 或 2027.1 上均无需任何环境配置（两个版本都自带 Cellpose 4.x，插件使用 Dragonfly 自带的 Python 在进程内运行）。建议配备 NVIDIA GPU 以提升速度，但并非必需：训练和推理都支持纯 CPU 运行，可在\"计算设备\"下拉框中切换，因此在没有 GPU 或显存不足的机器上也能使用。"
  },
  "en": {
    "func": "This plugin lets you train your own Cellpose cell/object-segmentation model directly from your Dragonfly data and then apply it to full images. In the Train tab you pick an image Channel plus a MultiROI that already labels your objects (one label per object), add one or more labeled slices as training examples, choose a starting point (the built-in Cellpose-SAM model or a previous custom model), set epochs and learning rate, and produce a new saved model. In the Infer tab you select any trained model and an image Channel, set the stitching and detection thresholds, and the plugin runs segmentation slice by slice, stitches the results through the stack, and publishes the detected objects back into your scene as a new MultiROI. Both the Train and Infer tabs have a Compute device selector (Auto = GPU when available, GPU, or CPU); choose CPU to run anyway when the GPU is out of memory (CUDA out of memory) or absent (slower, but works on any machine).",
    "scenarios": "Ideal for life-science and biomedical imaging where you need to segment cells, nuclei, or similar rounded structures in 2D slices or 3D stacks and the generic model needs fine-tuning to your own staining, magnification, or sample type. It also suits any workflow where you have a few hand-labeled slices and want a model that generalizes to the rest of a large dataset, and it can be adapted to segment other blob-like features in materials or industrial images.",
    "requirements": "No setup needed on Dragonfly 2025.1 or 2027.1 (both bundle Cellpose 4.x; the plugin runs in-process using Dragonfly's own Python). An NVIDIA GPU is recommended for speed but not required: both training and inference support CPU-only execution, selectable from the Compute device dropdown, so it also runs on machines without a GPU or when the GPU is out of memory."
  }
}

{
  "title": "Centerline and Length (v2)",
  "cn": {
    "func": "功能：从一个已发布的 MultiROI 出发，分别对每个非零 label 做三维骨架化，先判定其形状再测量：开放或带分枝的骨架沿加权测地距离最长的路径测量（侧枝被排除，排除比例一并报告），闭合环按环测量周长，壳体或薄片则直接拒绝。可选地做平滑以消除数字骨架的阶梯效应，然后测量每条中心线的实际长度，并作为新的逐标签 scalar slot 写回源 MultiROI。原始与平滑中心线都可发布为带 Label ID 标量的 Dragonfly Graph。",
    "scenarios": "适用场景：用于细长、弯曲对象的逐标签长度测量，尤其适合原始体素骨架存在锯齿、会使折线长度偏大的数据（实测缓斜直线偏大 +9.0%，三维斜线 +10.5%，5:1 各向异性数据 +21.7%）。五个标签页依次为 Input、Centerline、Smooth、Length Measurement 和 Report；Input 页可按当前设置一键执行全部步骤，其中 Smooth 与 Report 可独立关闭。",
    "requirements": "环境需求：无需联网、GPU、管理员权限或独立虚拟环境；使用 Dragonfly 自带的 PyQt6、NumPy、SciPy 与 scikit-image。报告只写入本地 HTML，不会上传。长度按 Dragonfly 世界坐标计算并以米写入带长度量纲的 scalar slot；每个标签同时给出形状、被排除比例、长度／等效直径以及端部半径，任何不可靠的结果都会带提示而不会被悄悄输出。"
  },
  "en": {
    "func": "What it does: Starting from one published MultiROI, skeletonizes every non-zero label independently, classifies its shape and only then measures it: an open or branched skeleton is measured along its longest weighted geodesic path (side branches are excluded and the excluded fraction is reported), a closed ring is measured as a ring, and a shell or plate is refused. Optional smoothing removes the staircase bias of a digital skeleton, after which the path length is measured and appended to the source MultiROI as a new per-label scalar slot. Raw and smoothed paths can each be published as a Dragonfly Graph carrying a Label ID scalar.",
    "scenarios": "Typical scenarios: Per-label length measurement of slender, curved objects, especially when a voxel skeleton is jagged and would overestimate polyline length (measured: +9.0% on a shallow line, +10.5% on a 3-D diagonal, +21.7% at 5:1 anisotropy). The five tabs are Input, Centerline, Smooth, Length Measurement and Report. Input can execute the complete pipeline with current settings, while Smooth and Report are independently optional.",
    "requirements": "Requirements: No internet, GPU, administrator access or separate environment. It uses the PyQt6, NumPy, SciPy and scikit-image bundled with Dragonfly. Reports are local self-contained HTML files and are never uploaded. Length is computed in Dragonfly world coordinates and stored in metres with a length dimension; every label also reports its shape, its discarded fraction, its length / equivalent diameter and its end radius, so no unreliable figure is printed without a warning beside it."
  }
}

{
  "title_en": "Centerline and Length (v2)",
  "title_cn": "Centerline and Length (v2)（中心线与长度）",
  "menu_en": "Centerline and Length (v2)...",
  "version": "1.0",
  "date": "2026-09-22",
  "cn": [
    {
      "heading": "简介",
      "blocks": [
        {"kind": "p", "text": "从一个已发布的 **Multi-ROI** 出发，对每个非零 label 分别提取中心线、测量其**实际长度**，并把长度作为一个新的**逐标签 scalar slot** 写回该 Multi-ROI。五个标签页就是完整流程：**Input → Centerline → Smooth → Length measurement → Report**。"},
        {"kind": "p", "text": "与直接对骨架折线求和不同，本插件在测量之前**先判定每个标签的形状**：开放曲线和带分枝的骨架沿加权测地距离最长的路径测量；**闭合环按环测量周长**；壳体或薄片没有中心线，直接拒绝并说明原因。"},
        {"kind": "note", "text": "数字骨架是阶梯状的，直接求和会使长度**偏大**。实测：缓斜直线 +9.0%，三维斜线 +10.5%，5:1 各向异性数据 +21.7%。**Smooth** 页就是用来消除这一偏差的；使用默认参数时，同样的模型误差都在约 1% 以内。"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "适用场景",
