{
  "title": "Create Synthetic CAD Models (STEP)",
  "cn": {
    "func": "功能：从预设的多种参数化形状与设计（长方体、圆柱、球、圆锥、圆环、棱锥、楔形；六角螺栓、六角螺母、垫圈、正齿轮、L 形支架、法兰、管件；孔阵列板、阶梯规、球-柱标定件、多孔立方体、倒圆/倒角块等）中选择一种，设置尺寸参数，点击“Create CAD Model and Save STEP File”即可用 cadquery（OpenCASCADE）生成一个真实的 CAD 实体并保存为 STEP 文件；点击“Load to Dragonfly”可将该 STEP 作为网格（Mesh）导入当前场景。",
    "scenarios": "适用场景：需要标准或参数化的 CAD 测试件/标定件/演示模型（如 CT 标定球杆、孔隙率/多孔结构 CAD 假体、齿轮/法兰/支架样件）；为下游网格划分、仿真、逆向或算法测试快速生成 STEP 几何；教学与演示。",
    "requirements": "环境需求：首次使用点击“Setup Environment”一次，用 Dragonfly 自带 Python 构建一个 cadquery/cadquery-ocp 的独立 venv（安装在较短的 %LOCALAPPDATA% 路径下以规避 Windows 路径长度限制；首次需要联网下载，约数百 MB）。生成运行在该 venv 的子进程中。“Load to Dragonfly”仅在 Dragonfly 2027.1 及以上版本可用（更早版本无 STEP 导入）；无需 GPU。在 Dragonfly 2027.1（Python 3.14）上不能用 Dragonfly 自带的 Python 创建该环境：请安装 python.org 的 Python（3.12、3.13 或 3.14）并填入面板的 Base Python；Dragonfly 2025.1 无需另装 Python。"
  },
  "en": {
    "func": "What it does: Pick one of many preset parametric shapes/designs (box, cylinder, sphere, cone, torus, pyramid, wedge; hex bolt, hex nut, washer, spur gear, L-bracket, flange, pipe; hole-array plate, step gauge, sphere-on-stem, perforated cube, fillet/chamfer block), set its dimensions, and click 'Create CAD Model and Save STEP File' to build a real CAD solid with cadquery (OpenCASCADE) and write a STEP file. 'Load to Dragonfly' imports that STEP into the scene as a Mesh.",
    "scenarios": "Typical scenarios: you need standard or parametric CAD test/calibration/demo parts (CT sphere-on-stem, a CAD porosity phantom, gear/flange/bracket samples); quick STEP geometry for downstream meshing, simulation, reverse engineering or algorithm testing; teaching and demos.",
