    {
      "heading": "How it works, and what it is not",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "This plugin adds to the context menus **Dragonfly itself builds**, and it uses whichever of Dragonfly's two mechanisms actually fits the menu in question. They are not interchangeable."
