        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "**The view canvas is native.** Its menu is built by Dragonfly's C++ code - the text *Export Screenshot of View* appears in no Python file in the whole installation - and the selection it offers is not something a Python contextual menu item will accept: all 182 installed subclasses decline it, and the canvas menu is identical whether or not an object is selected. So nothing written that way can appear there."
