        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "**对象列表恰好是相反的情况。**它的菜单由 Python 构建，内容来自你**选中**的对象，这正是 Dragonfly 官方的上下文菜单通道。所以裁剪那一项是用官方方式注册的，由插件自己在**每次右键时**判断当前选择是否为一个图像、ROI 或 Multi-ROI。这里既没有注入、也没有监视、更没有轮询，该菜单项也绝不可能出现在不该出现的菜单上。由于 Dragonfly 在启动时读取插件菜单，这一项第一次出现需要重启一次；之后开关它立即生效。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "note",
          "text": "不删除、不修改任何已有条目。只添加一条分隔线和你启用的菜单项，且只加到相关的菜单上。重启 Dragonfly 会清除插件在内存里所做的一切；把菜单项带回来的是那个配置文件。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "以后如何增加新动作",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "剪贴板这一项只是开头，插件的结构让新增一个动作成为很小的局部改动：在 `custom_menus_core.py` 的动作表里加一条，给出中英文名称、一句说明和要执行的函数。它随后就会出现在 *添加菜单项…* 里、可加到任何已发现的菜单上，面板、持久化和菜单机制都不需要改。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "加到对象列表上的菜单项要多做一点，因为它出现在哪里是由 Dragonfly 决定而不是本插件决定：还需要向 Dragonfly 自己的上下文菜单机制注册，正是这一步让它能够精确声明想要的选择条件。面板对它的列出与开关方式和其它菜单项完全一样。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "限制",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "只能加到 Dragonfly 已经创建出来的菜单上 —— 这正是「已发现的菜单」页存在的原因，也是它提示你先打开界面上对应部分的原因。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "本插件不会删除或重排 Dragonfly 自己的菜单项，也不改变它们的行为。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "在视图画布上，菜单项添加在菜单末尾；本版本不支持指定它在该菜单内的位置。裁剪那一项的位置由 Dragonfly 决定，它会被放到其它 *Modify and Transform* 工具旁边。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "裁剪一次只处理一个对象，并且只沿体素坐标轴进行 —— 这里没有旋转裁剪、没有任意形状裁剪，也没有重采样。需要精确填写索引范围时用 Dragonfly 自带的 *Crop...*，需要旋转盒子时用它基于形状的提取功能。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "插件首次安装或更新后，裁剪那一项需要重启 Dragonfly 一次，因为插件的菜单是在启动时读取的。"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}

{
  "title": "Deconvolution (DeconvolutionLab2)",
  "cn": {
    "func": "在 Dragonfly 中选择一个图像 Channel 和一个 PSF（点扩散函数，可以是 PSF Channel，也可以由面板按高斯 sigma 合成），把它们导出为 Fiji 可读取的 TIFF，在本机 Fiji 中通过 DeconvolutionLab2 运行经典三维去卷积算法（Richardson-Lucy、RL-TV、FISTA、Tikhonov、Wiener、Landweber），可设置迭代次数与正则化参数，再把去卷积后的图像作为新的 Channel（与原网格对齐）导入回 Dragonfly。面板会自动查找 Fiji，也可手动指定 Fiji/ImageJ 启动器。",
    "scenarios": "适用于共聚焦、宽场荧光、显微 CT 等因光学模糊而需要复原的三维图像：在已知或可近似 PSF 的情况下，用经典去卷积提升轴向/横向分辨率与对比度，得到更清晰的 Channel 供后续分割与测量。",
    "requirements": "需要本机已安装 Fiji/ImageJ。DeconvolutionLab2（GPL-3.0）通过 Fiji 的 DeconvolutionLab2 更新站点提供，也可放入 DeconvolutionLab2_.jar 由 Fiji 自带 Java 运行；如果面板检测不到，会弹窗询问是否先启用该更新站点。启用/更新时需要联网；正常运行不需要 Python 虚拟环境或 GPU。DeconvolutionLab2 仅作为独立的 Fiji Java 子进程运行，不会被导入 Dragonfly 进程。"
  },
  "en": {
    "func": "Select a Dragonfly image Channel and a PSF (a PSF Channel, or a Gaussian synthesized from a sigma in the panel), export them as Fiji-readable TIFFs, run a classical 3D deconvolution algorithm (Richardson-Lucy, RL-TV, FISTA, Tikhonov, Wiener, Landweber) via DeconvolutionLab2 in the user's local Fiji with a chosen iteration count and regularization, then import the deconvolved image back into Dragonfly as a new Channel aligned to the source grid. The panel can auto-detect Fiji or use a user-selected Fiji/ImageJ launcher.",
    "scenarios": "For confocal, widefield fluorescence, and micro-CT 3D images degraded by optical blur: when the PSF is known or can be approximated, classical deconvolution restores axial/lateral resolution and contrast, yielding a sharper Channel for downstream segmentation and measurement.",
    "requirements": "Requires a local Fiji/ImageJ installation. DeconvolutionLab2 (GPL-3.0) is provided by Fiji's DeconvolutionLab2 update site (or as DeconvolutionLab2_.jar run via Fiji's bundled Java); if the panel cannot detect it, it prompts to enable that update site first. Internet is needed for installation/update only; normal processing needs no Python virtual environment or GPU. DeconvolutionLab2 runs only as a separate Fiji Java subprocess and is never imported into the Dragonfly process."
  }
}

{
  "title": "DECT Z-eff: Dual-Energy CT Decomposition",
  "cn": {
    "func": "利用双能CT数据计算有效原子序数（Z_eff）和相对电子密度（Rho_e）图。选择低能和高能两个体数据，在已知参考材料（如石英、方解石、盐水）上勾画ROI用于标定，设定两个有效能量后运行——即可在场景中生成 Z_eff 和 Rho_e 两个新通道，日志中会报告标定质量（R²）。内置演示可生成合成双能体模，无需任何数据即可体验完整流程。",
    "scenarios": "数字岩石物理与岩石物理学：在岩心双能显微CT扫描中识别矿物并定量分析成分。也适用于材料科学和工业CT等场景——只要有两个不同能量的扫描数据，需要超越简单灰度的材质区分能力即可使用。",
    "requirements": "首次使用：点击 Setup Environment 构建一个小型计算环境（numpy/scipy/xraydb）；仅需一次联网，无需GPU。"
  },
  "en": {
    "func": "Computes effective atomic number (Z_eff) and relative electron density (Rho_e) maps from dual-energy CT data. Select a low-energy and a high-energy volume, mark ROIs on known reference materials (e.g. quartz, calcite, brine) for calibration, set the two effective energies, and run — two new channels, Z_eff and Rho_e, are published into the scene, with calibration quality (R²) reported in the log. A built-in demo generates a synthetic dual-energy phantom so you can try the workflow without any data.",
    "scenarios": "Digital rock physics and petrophysics: identifying minerals and quantifying composition in dual-energy micro-CT scans of rock cores. Also useful in materials science and industrial CT wherever two scans at different energies are available and material discrimination beyond simple grayscale is needed.",
    "requirements": "First use: click Setup Environment to build a small compute environment (numpy/scipy/xraydb); needs internet once, no GPU required."
  }
}

{
  "title": "EBSD Grains (DefDAP)",
  "cn": {
    "func": "使用开源 DefDAP 库对 EBSD 取向图做晶粒分割与分析。输入一张二维 EBSD 图（或三维数据的单个切片），设置取向差容限与最小晶粒尺寸，插件检测晶界、分割晶粒，并生成 KAM（核平均取向差）、GROD 等图。该插件仅接收二维图像或三维图像的一个切片。",
    "scenarios": "适用于材料科学中的晶粒尺寸与形貌统计、变形与取向梯度分析（KAM/GROD 常用于评估局部塑性变形）。",
    "requirements": "首次使用点击 Setup Environment 构建独立运行环境（默认使用 Dragonfly 自带 Python，需联网一次）。无需 GPU。在 Dragonfly 2027.1（Python 3.14）上不能用 Dragonfly 自带的 Python 创建该环境：请安装 python.org 的 Python（3.12、3.13 或 3.14）并填入面板的 Base Python；Dragonfly 2025.1 无需另装 Python。"
  },
  "en": {
    "func": "Segments and analyzes grains from an EBSD orientation map with the open-source DefDAP library. Provide a 2D EBSD map (or a single slice of a 3D dataset), set the misorientation tolerance and minimum grain size, and the plugin detects boundaries, segments grains, and produces KAM (kernel average misorientation) and GROD maps. It accepts only a 2D image or one slice of a 3D image.",
    "scenarios": "Grain-size and morphology statistics and deformation / orientation-gradient analysis in materials science (KAM/GROD assess local plastic deformation).",
    "requirements": "First use: click Setup Environment (uses Dragonfly's own Python by default; needs internet once). No GPU required. On Dragonfly 2027.1 (Python 3.14) the bundled Python cannot build this environment: install a python.org Python (3.12, 3.13 or 3.14) and enter it in the panel's Base Python field; Dragonfly 2025.1 needs no separate Python."
  }
}

{
  "title": "DL Model Organizer",
  "cn": {
    "func": "统一管理 Dragonfly DeepTrainer 深度学习模型,把它们从 C 盘搬到任意盘,并在需要时临时挂回某个版本用于训练/推理,用完再释放 C 盘空间——而且只保留一份模型,让不同版本按需共享。背景:DeepTrainer 把每个模型存成一个文件夹(model.ORSModel + data.json + checkpoints),固定放在每个版本各自的 C 盘目录 %LOCALAPPDATA%\\comet\\Dragonfly<版本>\\pythonUserExtensions\\PythonPluginExtensions\\DeepTrainer\\models\\ 下,官方不提供改位置的设置,容易吃满 C 盘,且多版本会各存一份。本插件:在弹出窗口里设一个「中央模型库」根目录(如 D:\\DragonflyModels,持久化);表格列出各版本与库中的所有模型,显示名称、来源版本(读自 data.json 的 dragonflyVersion)、大小、所在位置;提供操作:(1)Move to Library——把某版本 C 盘里的模型移进库,立即释放 C 盘;(2)Attach——把库里的模型挂到「目标版本」,默认用 Windows 目录联接(mklink /J,免管理员、瞬时、几乎不占 C 盘、库里只留一份),或改为物理移动(move);(3)Detach——从某版本移除(联接则删除联接,库中真身不动;若是重复的真实拷贝且库中已有,可确认后删除)。挂载/卸载后,对当前正在运行的这个 Dragonfly 版本会自动刷新模型列表(refreshModelsList),无需重启即可在 AI/DeepTrainer 中看到变化;其它版本下次启动生效。兼容性:2026.1 与 2027.1 视为同一格式(改名);来源版本与目标版本不同的会给出兼容性警告。此外:表格每行显示最后修改时间,并带一个 Notes 按钮(编辑保存在模型文件夹内的 notes.md,随模型迁移);顶部有搜索框可按名称/ID/版本/位置快速筛选;右键某个模型可「Review Training Images and Visual Feedback」,在弹窗中浏览该模型训练过程中保存的可视化反馈快照(visual_feedback_*.ORSObject):以灰度显示输入图像并叠加各类别彩色分割(预测标签),支持按时间戳在多个快照间切换、滑动条浏览预测切片、调节叠加透明度、并可另存为 PNG。",
    "scenarios": "适用于:C 盘被 DeepTrainer 模型占满(实测单个版本可达数十 GB)想搬到别的盘;在多个 Dragonfly 版本之间共享同一批训练好的模型而不想各存一份;训练/推理前临时把需要的模型挂到当前版本、用完再释放空间。",
    "requirements": "纯进程内运行,无需 venv、无需联网、无需 GPU、无需管理员权限(目录联接 mklink /J 不需要管理员)。仅在同机 NTFS 各盘之间用联接;网络盘/可移动盘请用 move 模式。删除类操作(移除重复真实拷贝)有二次确认;联接的卸载只删联接、绝不会误删库中真身。"
  },
  "en": {
    "func": "One place to manage Dragonfly DeepTrainer deep-learning models: move them off C: to any drive, temporarily attach them back to a given version for training/inference, then free C: again — keeping a SINGLE copy shared across versions on demand. Background: DeepTrainer stores each model as a folder (model.ORSModel + data.json + checkpoints) in a fixed per-version C: directory (%LOCALAPPDATA%\\comet\\Dragonfly<ver>\\pythonUserExtensions\\PythonPluginExtensions\\DeepTrainer\\models\\), with no built-in setting to relocate it, so C: fills up and each version keeps its own duplicate. The panel: set a central library root (e.g. D:\\DragonflyModels, persisted); a table lists all models across every version + the library with name, origin version (read from data.json's dragonflyVersion), size and location; operations: (1) Move to Library — move a version's C: model into the library, freeing C: immediately; (2) Attach — place a library model into a chosen target version, by default via a Windows directory junction (mklink /J: no admin, instant, ~0 C: usage, one shared copy), or by physically moving it; (3) Detach — remove it from a version (a junction is just unlinked and the library copy is untouched; a redundant REAL duplicate already in the library can be deleted after confirmation). After attach/detach, the model list of the CURRENTLY running version is auto-refreshed (refreshModelsList) so the change shows in AI/DeepTrainer without a restart; other versions pick it up on next launch. Compatibility: 2026.1 and 2027.1 are treated as the same format (rename); attaching a model whose origin version differs from the target raises a warning. Also: each row shows a Last-modified time and a Notes button (edits a notes.md kept inside the model folder, so it travels with the model); a search box filters by name/ID/version/location; and right-clicking a model offers \"Review Training Images and Visual Feedback\", a popup that browses the visual-feedback snapshots saved during training (visual_feedback_*.ORSObject) — the input image in grayscale with the per-class predicted segmentation overlaid, with a snapshot selector, a slider to scrub the prediction slices, an opacity control, and Save-PNG.",
    "scenarios": "For: reclaiming C: when DeepTrainer models fill it (tens of GB per version in practice); sharing one set of trained models across multiple Dragonfly versions without duplicating them; temporarily attaching the models you need to the current version for a training/inference session, then freeing the space.",
    "requirements": "Runs purely in-process — no venv, no internet, no GPU, and NO admin rights (directory junctions via mklink /J need no admin). Junctions work between local NTFS drives only; use move mode for network/removable drives. Destructive actions (deleting a redundant real duplicate) require confirmation; detaching a junction only removes the link and can never delete the library's real files."
  }
}

