{
  "title": "Fiber ROI to MultiROI (Large Volume)",
  "cn": {
    "func": "把一个 Dragonfly 二值 Fiber ROI 转换为逐根纤维的 MultiROI，但针对超大体数据降低运行时内存峰值：导出时可先裁剪到 ROI 前景 bounding box；骨架图、junction、切割分支和重连步骤使用稀疏 skeleton 坐标而不是整块 int32 label volume；最终从中心线扩张回 ROI 时按 z-slab 分块写入 uint16 label 文件，并用 KD-tree 查询最近中心线，避免全体积 distance_transform_edt。插件不会输出或发布 skeleton、junction、cut zone、segments 等中间结果，只导入并发布最终 MultiROI。\n\n所有页签随时都可以打开和修改，任何页签都不会被锁住。如果某一步所需的输入还不存在，它会**在它自己的按钮上**拒绝执行：按钮保持可点击，但不会启动任何计算，并说明缺的是什么。这里**有意没有**「一键执行全部步骤」按钮：「输出」页上的按钮已经会按第 2–5 页当前显示的设置跑完整条流程；而唯一剩下的另一步是环境安装——它要联网创建虚拟环境，必须排除在无人值守运行之外。这样一来，「流程」里其实只剩一步，等于把一个已经存在的按钮再做一遍。",
    "scenarios": "适用场景：标准 Fiber ROI to MultiROI 在大尺寸 ROI 上因为整块连通域标记或 distance transform 内存不足时使用；尤其适合前景 ROI 只占总体积一部分、或只需要最终每根纤维 MultiROI 而不需要调试预览对象的任务。算法思路沿用标准 Fiber 插件，参数仍包括 skeleton 方法、连通性、junction degree、cut radius、最小分段体素、tangent reconnect 半径/角度/采样长度。",
    "requirements": "需要一个已存在的二值 Fiber ROI。首次使用需要在插件 Setup tab 中创建独立 venv 并安装 numpy、scipy、scikit-image；安装时需要联网，运行时不需要 GPU。最终发布 MultiROI 仍需要 Dragonfly 读取 uint16 label volume，因此非常大的最终结果仍会占用必要内存。在 Dragonfly 2027.1（Python 3.14）上不能用 Dragonfly 自带的 Python 创建该环境：请安装 python.org 的 Python（3.12、3.13 或 3.14）并填入面板的 Base Python；Dragonfly 2025.1 无需另装 Python。"
  },
  "en": {
    "func": "Converts one binary Dragonfly Fiber ROI into an individual-fiber MultiROI with lower peak memory for large volumes. Export can crop to the foreground bounding box; skeleton graph, junction cutting, branch components, and tangent reconnection run on sparse skeleton coordinates instead of dense full-volume int32 labels; final ROI expansion writes a uint16 label file in z slabs and uses a KD-tree nearest-centerline query instead of a full-volume distance_transform_edt. The plugin does not write or publish skeleton, junction, cut-zone, segment, or centerline debug objects; it imports and publishes only the final MultiROI.\n\nEvery tab can be opened and edited at any time, and no tab is ever locked shut. A step whose input is missing refuses at its own button instead: the button stays live, starts nothing, and names what is missing. There is deliberately no 'Execute All Steps' button here: the Output tab's button already runs the entire pipeline from the settings tabs 2-5 show at that moment, and the only other step is the environment installer, which builds a venv over the network and must stay out of an unattended run - so a chain would have exactly one step in it and would duplicate a button that already exists.",
    "scenarios": "Typical scenarios: use this when the standard Fiber ROI to MultiROI tool runs out of memory during dense connected-component labeling or distance transform on a very large ROI. It is especially useful when the foreground ROI occupies only part of the grid, or when only the final per-fiber MultiROI is needed. The algorithm follows the standard Fiber plugin workflow and keeps the same tuning concepts: skeleton method, connectivity, junction degree, cut radius, minimum segment voxels, and tangent reconnect radius/angle/sample length.",
    "requirements": "Requires an existing binary Fiber ROI. First use builds an isolated plugin venv and installs numpy, scipy, and scikit-image from PyPI; internet is needed for setup only. No GPU is required. Publishing the final MultiROI still requires Dragonfly to read the uint16 label volume, so very large final results still require the memory needed for that final object. On Dragonfly 2027.1 (Python 3.14) the bundled Python cannot build this environment: install a python.org Python (3.12, 3.13 or 3.14) and enter it in the panel's Base Python field; Dragonfly 2025.1 needs no separate Python."
  }
}

{
  "title": "Fiber ROI to MultiROI",
  "cn": {
    "func": "把一个 Dragonfly 二值 Fiber ROI 按向导流程转换为逐根纤维的 MultiROI：ROI 先 skeletonize，然后构建骨架图，查找 junction，切开 junction，再按局部切线方向重连被切开的分支，最后把每根 fiber 的中心线标签扩张回原始 ROI 体素并导入为 MultiROI。界面采用多个 tab，分别对应 Setup、Input ROI、Skeleton、Graph/Junctions、Reconnect、Output 和 Auto-Tune。Auto-Tune 页可根据结果自动重设所有参数：选择结果 MultiROI 是过分割(一根纤维被切成多段)还是欠分割(不同纤维被合并成一个)，可选填写纤维典型粗细(体素)，点 Re-recommend Parameters 就按验证过的规则(例如 reconnect_radius≈2×cut_radius+粗细)把所有参数朝正确方向调整，或点 Use Default Parameters 恢复默认，然后回到 Output 重新运行。Output 页还提供 Generate Report 按钮，把本次运行的数据、参数、结果整理成一个易读的 .docx 报告并保存到任务临时文件夹，可用 Open Folder / Open Report 打开该文件夹或直接用默认软件打开报告。所有生成的对象都是分割对象(ROI/MultiROI)而非原始 image channel：骨架、junction、cut zone 等二值预览以单标签 MultiROI 发布，分段/中心线/最终纤维以多标签 MultiROI 发布。注意：面板上标为红色的参数(切割半径 cut radius、最小分段体素、重连搜索半径、最小对向夹角、切线采样体素)强烈依赖图像(纤维粗细/长度/间距)，默认值只是通用起点，请务必按你的数据调整(将鼠标悬停到红色参数上查看调参提示)。\n\n所有页签随时都可以打开和修改，任何页签都不会被锁住。如果某一步所需的输入还不存在，它会**在它自己的按钮上**拒绝执行：按钮保持可点击，但不会启动任何计算，并指明必须先完成哪一步。这里**有意没有**「一键执行全部步骤」按钮：这些页签是**同一次计算**的参数面板与预览，而不是彼此接力的步骤——「输出」页上的「运行完整流程并创建 MultiROI」本身就已经是「全部执行」按钮；把这些页签串起来只会把同一条流程跑三遍，并发布互相重叠的对象。",
    "scenarios": "适用于纤维网络、交叉/接触纤维、纤维束或多孔材料中细长结构已经被分割成一个整体 ROI，但需要拆成单根 fiber 标签进行后续测量、统计或可视化的场景。",
    "requirements": "需要一个已存在的二值 Fiber ROI。首次使用需要在插件 Setup tab 中创建独立 venv 并安装 numpy、scipy、scikit-image；安装时需要联网，运行时不需要 GPU。在 Dragonfly 2027.1（Python 3.14）上不能用 Dragonfly 自带的 Python 创建该环境：请安装 python.org 的 Python（3.12、3.13 或 3.14）并填入面板的 Base Python；Dragonfly 2025.1 无需另装 Python。"
  },
  "en": {
    "func": "Converts one binary Dragonfly Fiber ROI into an individual-fiber MultiROI through a wizard workflow: skeletonize the ROI, build a skeleton graph, find junctions, cut junctions, reconnect branch stubs by local tangent direction, then expand each fiber centerline label back into the original ROI voxels and import the result as a MultiROI. Every object it creates is a segmentation object (ROI/MultiROI), never a raw image Channel: the binary previews (skeleton, junctions, cut zone) are published as single-label MultiROIs and the labelled maps (segments, centerlines, final fibers) as multi-label MultiROIs. The UI is organized as tabs for Setup, Input ROI, Skeleton, Graph/Junctions, Reconnect, Output, and Auto-Tune. The Auto-Tune tab re-recommends every parameter from the result: choose whether the MultiROI is over-segmented (one fiber split into several labels) or under-segmented (different fibers merged into one), optionally enter the typical fiber thickness in voxels, and click Re-recommend Parameters to nudge all parameters in the verified direction (e.g. reconnect_radius ~= 2*cut_radius + thickness), or Use Default Parameters to restore the defaults, then re-run on the Output tab. The Output tab also has a Generate Report button that compiles this run's data, parameters and results into a readable .docx saved in the job folder, with Open Folder / Open Report buttons to open the folder or launch the report in the default app. NOTE: the parameters shown in RED (cut radius, min segment voxels, reconnect search radius, minimum opposite angle, tangent sample voxels) are strongly image-dependent (fiber thickness / length / gap); the defaults are only a generic starting point - tune them to your data (hover a red parameter for guidance).\n\nEvery tab can be opened and edited at any time, and no tab is ever locked shut. A step whose input is missing refuses at its own button instead: the button stays live, starts nothing, and names the step that has to run first. There is deliberately no 'Execute All Steps' button here, because the tabs are parameter panes and previews over ONE computation rather than steps that feed each other - 'Run Full Workflow + Create MultiROI' on the Output tab is already the run-everything button, and chaining the tabs would run the identical pipeline three times and publish overlapping objects.",
    "scenarios": "For fiber networks, crossing or touching fibers, bundles, and elongated structures that have already been segmented as one ROI but need to be split into per-fiber labels for measurement, statistics, or visualization.",
    "requirements": "Requires an existing binary Fiber ROI. First use builds an isolated plugin venv and installs numpy, scipy, and scikit-image from PyPI; internet is needed for setup only. No GPU is required. On Dragonfly 2027.1 (Python 3.14) the bundled Python cannot build this environment: install a python.org Python (3.12, 3.13 or 3.14) and enter it in the panel's Base Python field; Dragonfly 2025.1 needs no separate Python."
  }
}

