     "kind": "note",
     "text": "With \"Compute all presets\" ticked, the rehearsal runs every preset - and the run will then NOT choose between them. It says so and step 2 falls back to the parameter fields of step 1, rather than quietly committing the whole volume to whichever preset happened to finish last."
    },
    {
     "kind": "p",
     "text": "Every tab is open and editable from the start, including before anything has run: an unattended run is only worth leaving if you could set every tab first. A step whose input does not exist yet **refuses at its own button** and names the step that has to run first - for example, \"Compute measurements\" with no MultiROI selected says to run step 2 first instead of doing nothing at all."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "heading": "Requirements",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "kind": "p",
     "text": "No venv and no admin rights. It uses the cellpose package and Cellpose-SAM model Dragonfly bundles; on FIRST use cellpose downloads the ~1 GB cpsam weights once (offline afterwards). A CUDA GPU makes it much faster but is not required - untick GPU to run on the CPU (noticeably slower). Needs at least one PUBLISHED image Channel in the session."
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}

{
  "title": "Grain Size & Stereology (GrainSizeTools)",
  "cn": {
    "func": "基于 GrainSizeTools（Lopez-Sanchez，Apache-2.0）对二维晶粒/颗粒分割结果做粒度与立体学分析。选择一个包含二维晶粒标签的 MultiROI，插件由每个标签的面积换算等效圆直径（ECD = 2*sqrt(面积/pi)），计算描述性粒度统计（均值、中位数、几何均值、面积/体积加权均值、众数等），并可用 Saltykov 与两步法（two-step）立体学方法由二维切面反演三维晶粒尺寸分布。输出粒度统计表、Saltykov 三维分布以及分布图 PNG。",
    "scenarios": "适用于岩石学/构造地质、金相与材料科学中的晶粒尺寸表征——由二维切片估计三维晶粒尺寸分布，例如变质岩重结晶粒径、合金晶粒度、陶瓷与多晶材料的粒度分析。使用前请先对图像分割并分离相互接触的晶粒。",
    "requirements": "首次使用点击 Setup Environment（使用 Dragonfly 自带 Python 构建本地计算环境，安装 numpy/scipy/pandas/matplotlib，需联网一次；GrainSizeTools 未发布到 PyPI，其模块已随插件内置，Apache-2.0）。无需 GPU。在 Dragonfly 2027.1（Python 3.14）上不能用 Dragonfly 自带的 Python 创建该环境：请安装 python.org 的 Python（3.12、3.13 或 3.14）并填入面板的 Base Python；Dragonfly 2025.1 无需另装 Python。"
  },
  "en": {
    "func": "Grain-size and stereology analysis of 2D grain/particle segmentations with GrainSizeTools (Lopez-Sanchez, Apache-2.0). Pick a MultiROI of 2D grain labels; the plugin converts each label's area to an equivalent circular diameter (ECD = 2*sqrt(area/pi)), computes descriptive grain-size statistics (mean, median, geometric mean, area/volume-weighted means, mode, etc.), and can estimate the 3D grain-size distribution from the 2D section by the Saltykov and two-step stereology methods. Outputs a grain-size statistics table, a Saltykov 3D distribution, and a plot PNG.",
    "scenarios": "Grain-size characterization in petrology/structural geology, metallography, and materials science - estimating a 3D grain-size distribution from 2D sections (e.g. recrystallized grain size in metamorphic rocks, alloy grain size, ceramics and polycrystalline materials). Segment the image and split touching grains first.",
    "requirements": "First use: click Setup Environment (builds a local compute environment from Dragonfly's own Python and installs numpy/scipy/pandas/matplotlib; needs internet once). GrainSizeTools is not on PyPI - its module is bundled with the plugin (Apache-2.0). No GPU required. On Dragonfly 2027.1 (Python 3.14) the bundled Python cannot build this environment: install a python.org Python (3.12, 3.13 or 3.14) and enter it in the panel's Base Python field; Dragonfly 2025.1 needs no separate Python."
  }
}

{
  "title": "Photo2Mesh: gsplat…",
  "cn": {
    "func": "利用高斯泼溅（Gaussian Splatting，一种现代神经渲染技术）从围绕真实物体拍摄的一系列普通照片重建其三维表面网格，整个流程完全基于可商用的开源软件栈。您可以将照片作为 Dragonfly 中的活动图像堆栈（每个切片对应一张照片）或指定一个照片文件夹，设置训练迭代次数和网格提取方法后点击“Reconstruct Mesh”；插件会自动估计相机位姿、训练高斯泼溅模型并提取表面，最终将结果作为 Mesh（网格）发布到 Dragonfly 场景中，可直接用于测量与分析。",
    "scenarios": "适用于无需 CT 扫描即可获得实物样品数字三维模型的场景——例如用手机或单反照片数字化岩芯、化石、铸件、机加工或增材制造零件、生物标本、考古文物，以及将拍照获得的外部几何与内部 CT 数据进行比对。在三个 Photo2Mesh 方案中，它通常在纹理丰富的物体上给出保真度最高的表面，代价是计算时间更长。",
    "requirements": "首次使用需点击“Setup Environment”（耗时较长，下载数 GB）；需要联网、NVIDIA CUDA 显卡、已安装的 CUDA 工具包 + MSVC 编译工具 + git，以及一个 COLMAP 可执行文件（可由 Photo2Mesh: COLMAP 插件下载获得）。在 Dragonfly 2027.1（Python 3.14）上不能用 Dragonfly 自带的 Python 创建该环境：请安装 python.org 的 Python（3.12，其他版本未验证）并填入面板的 Base Python；Dragonfly 2025.1 无需另装 Python。"
  },
  "en": {
    "func": "Reconstructs a 3D surface mesh of a real object from a series of ordinary photos taken around it, using Gaussian Splatting (a modern neural rendering technique) built entirely on a commercially safe software stack. You provide the photos either as the active image stack in Dragonfly (each slice is one photo) or as a folder of photo files, choose the training iterations and meshing method, and click Reconstruct Mesh; the plugin estimates the camera positions, trains a Gaussian Splatting model, extracts a surface, and publishes the result as a Mesh in your Dragonfly scene, ready for measurement and analysis.",
    "scenarios": "Useful whenever you need a digital 3D model of a physical sample without a CT scan — for example digitizing rock cores, fossils, castings, machined or additively manufactured parts, biological specimens, or archaeological objects from smartphone/DSLR photos, and for comparing external photographed geometry against internal CT data. Of the three Photo2Mesh options it typically gives the highest-fidelity surfaces on well-textured objects, at the cost of longer computation.",
    "requirements": "First use requires clicking Setup Environment (long, several GB download); needs internet, an NVIDIA CUDA GPU, an installed CUDA toolkit + MSVC build tools + git, and a COLMAP executable (e.g. from the Photo2Mesh: COLMAP plugin). On Dragonfly 2027.1 (Python 3.14) the bundled Python cannot build this environment: install a python.org Python (3.12; other versions not verified) and enter it in the panel's Base Python field; Dragonfly 2025.1 needs no separate Python."
  }
}

{
  "title": "Half-Height Slope Width",
  "cn": {
    "func": "功能：测量“半高坡宽度”（计算半高坡宽度的 Prototype Apps 版）。沿选定的标尺（Ruler）在选定通道上采样灰度剖面（100 点），自动找到剖面内部的峰或谷，在其两侧斜坡上分别取“基线与极值的中点”（半高点，线性插值），测量两个半高点之间的宽度，结果以毫米显示，并可一键在两个半高点位置生成并发布一条新标尺。两种用法：菜单 Prototype Apps ▸ Half-Height Slope Width… 打开面板（可选择通道与标尺）；或选中一条标尺后右键 ▸ Half-Height Slope Width 半高坡宽度（与旧版 CalWidthOfHalfHighSlope 插件一致的一键流程）。**右键菜单上的这一项，名称前会显示一个标记（默认是圆点 ●），表示它是 Prototype Apps 添加的，而 Dragonfly 原生的菜单项不带标记；因此本手册引用的一律是不带标记的名称。这个标记不在本插件里设置，而是整个 Prototype Apps 共用的一个设置，位于「Custom Context Menus（自定义右键菜单）」插件面板「1 菜单项」页的「在 Dragonfly 菜单上标记本插件添加的项」分组 —— 在那里可以换成其他标记，也可以完全关掉，改动会同时作用于所有带标记的菜单项，并在你下次右键时生效，不需要重启。若未安装或已禁用 Custom Context Menus，本项显示默认标记，且没有可修改标记的界面。**",
    "scenarios": "适用场景：CT/显微图像中测量线状特征（焊缝、涂层、裂缝、条带）的有效宽度——以半高点定义边界，比人工目测更客观、可重复；替代旧版本地插件（旧版在启动时加载重库拖慢 Dragonfly 启动，本版已按 Prototype Apps 规范改为按需加载）。",
    "requirements": "环境需求：无需安装/联网/GPU/虚拟环境，纯进程内运行。需要会话中至少有一个通道（Channel）和一条标尺（Ruler 标注）。多通道时面板可直接选择；右键流程会弹出通道选择。"
  },
  "en": {
    "func": "What it does: measures the HALF-HEIGHT SLOPE WIDTH (a Prototype Apps port of the legacy CalWidthOfHalfHighSlope plugin). The intensity profile along a selected ruler is sampled on a selected channel (100 points); the internal peak or valley is found automatically; on each slope the half-height point (midpoint between the baseline and the extremum, linearly interpolated) is located; the width between the two half-height points is measured, shown in millimetres, and a new ruler spanning the two points can be published in one click. Two entry points: menu Prototype Apps > Half-Height Slope Width... opens a panel (choose channel + ruler); or right-click a selected ruler > 'Half-Height Slope Width 半高坡宽度' for the legacy one-click flow. That right-click entry is displayed with a marker in front of its name — a dot (●) by default — to show that Prototype Apps added it and Dragonfly did not; Dragonfly's own entries never carry one, and the name quoted here is the plain name, without it. The marker is NOT a setting of this plugin: it is one setting shared by all of Prototype Apps, in the 'Mark our entries on Dragonfly's menus' group of the '1 Entries' tab of the Custom Context Menus panel, where it can be changed or switched off completely for every marked entry together. No restart is needed — this entry is rebuilt by Dragonfly on every right-click, so a change shows at your next right-click. If Custom Context Menus is not installed or is disabled, this entry shows the default marker and there is nowhere to change it.",
    "scenarios": "Typical scenarios: measuring the effective width of linear features (welds, coatings, cracks, bands) in CT/microscopy images — the half-height definition of the edges is objective and repeatable, unlike eyeballing; replaces the legacy local plugin (which imported heavy libraries at startup and slowed Dragonfly's launch — this port loads on demand per Prototype Apps conventions).",
    "requirements": "Requirements: no install/internet/GPU/venv — pure in-process. Needs at least one Channel and one ruler annotation in the session. With multiple channels the panel offers a picker; the contextual flow pops up a channel selection."
  }
}

{
  "title_en": "Half-Height Slope Width",
  "title_cn": "Half-Height Slope Width（半高坡宽度）",
  "menu_en": "Half-Height Slope Width...",
  "version": "1.2",
  "date": "2026-08-10",
  "cn": [
    {"heading": "简介", "blocks": [
      {"kind": "p", "text": "**Half-Height Slope Width** 测量沿标尺灰度剖面的**半高坡宽度**：在选定通道上沿选定标尺采样灰度剖面（100 点），自动找到剖面内部的峰或谷，在两侧斜坡上分别取“基线与极值的中点”（半高点，线性插值），测量两个半高点之间的宽度（毫米），并可一键在半高点位置生成新标尺。本插件是旧本地插件 CalWidthOfHalfHighSlope（计算半高坡宽度）的 Prototype Apps 移植版。"},
      {"kind": "note", "text": "本功能由第三方（Prototype Labs / Prototype Apps）提供，非 Dragonfly 官方开发或支持。与旧版不同，本版启动时不加载任何重库（旧版在 Dragonfly 启动时导入 numpy 等，拖慢启动）。"}
    ]},
    {"heading": "两种用法", "blocks": [
      {"kind": "bullet", "text": "**面板**：菜单 Prototype Apps ▸ Half-Height Slope Width…，在面板中选择通道与标尺，点“计算”；勾选“生成新标尺”则同时在半高点位置发布一条新标尺（标题为“原标尺名 (half-height)”）。"},
      {"kind": "bullet", "text": "**右键（与旧版一致）**：在对象列表中选中一条标尺 ▸ 右键 ▸ Half-Height Slope Width 半高坡宽度：一键计算并弹出结果，可选择“确定并生成新标尺”。多通道时会先弹出通道选择。"},
      {"kind": "note", "text": "**右键菜单上那一项带一个标记 —— 而本手册引用的是不带标记的名称。** 在 Dragonfly 自带的右键菜单里，这一项的名称前会显示一个标记，默认是圆点 `●`，用来表示它是 Prototype Apps 添加的，而不是 Dragonfly 原生的 —— Dragonfly 自带的菜单项永远不带标记。所以本项的**名称**是「Half-Height Slope Width 半高坡宽度」，而在默认标记下，它在菜单上显示为 `● Half-Height Slope Width 半高坡宽度`。"},
      {"kind": "note", "text": "**标记不在本插件里设置。**它是整个 Prototype Apps 共用的一个设置，位于另一个插件的面板里：**Custom Context Menus（自定义右键菜单）** ▸「1 菜单项」页 ▸ **在 Dragonfly 菜单上标记本插件添加的项** 分组。在那里可以换成别的标记（`•`、`▪`、`@`），也可以选「不加标记」彻底关掉，改动会同时作用于所有带标记的菜单项。本项由 Dragonfly 在每次右键时重新生成，因此改动在你**下次右键**时生效，不需要重启。这个设置保存在两个插件之外的共用文件里，因此即使 Custom Context Menus 没有安装、或在 App Store 中被禁用，你选定的标记（包括「不加标记」）仍然对本项生效。那种情况下失去的只是**修改**入口：此时没有任何面板可供选择；而从未设置过的安装则显示默认标记。"}
    ]},
    {"heading": "算法", "blocks": [
      {"kind": "steps", "steps": [
        "沿标尺在通道上等距采样 100 个点的灰度均值（与 Dragonfly 剖面工具同一 API）。",
        "找内部极值：比较内部最大/最小值相对两端基线均值的偏离，取偏离更大者（峰或谷）。",
        "左侧斜坡：目标幅度 =（左端基线 + 极值）/2，线性插值求穿越点；右侧同理。",
        "宽度 = 两个半高点的间距；结果按两点的世界坐标距离换算为毫米。"
      ]},
      {"kind": "p", "text": "极值位于标尺端点、剖面单调或采样点不足 3 个时给出明确错误提示而不是失败。三角形剖面与高斯剖面（对照解析 FWHM）均通过单元测试验证。"}
    ]},
    {"heading": "环境需求", "blocks": [
      {"kind": "p", "text": "无需安装/联网/GPU/虚拟环境。需要会话中至少一个通道和一条标尺标注。"}
    ]}
  ],
  "en": [
    {"heading": "Introduction", "blocks": [
      {"kind": "p", "text": "**Half-Height Slope Width** measures the width between the two **half-height slope crossings** of the intensity profile along a ruler: the profile is sampled on a selected channel along a selected ruler (100 points), the internal peak or valley is found automatically, the half-height point (midpoint between baseline and extremum, linearly interpolated) is located on each slope, and the width between the two points is reported in millimetres — optionally publishing a new ruler spanning them. This is the Prototype Apps port of the legacy local plugin CalWidthOfHalfHighSlope (计算半高坡宽度)."},
      {"kind": "note", "text": "This feature is provided by a third party (Prototype Labs / Apps), not officially developed or supported by Dragonfly. Unlike the legacy plugin, it imports nothing heavy at Dragonfly startup."}
    ]},
    {"heading": "Two ways to use it", "blocks": [
      {"kind": "bullet", "text": "**Panel**: menu Prototype Apps > Half-Height Slope Width..., pick a channel and a ruler, click Calculate; tick the publish option to also create a new ruler at the half-height points (titled '<ruler> (half-height)')."},
      {"kind": "bullet", "text": "**Right-click (legacy flow)**: select a ruler in the object list > right-click > 'Half-Height Slope Width 半高坡宽度': one click computes and shows the result, with an 'OK + new ruler' option. With multiple channels a picker appears first."},
      {"kind": "note", "text": "**The right-click entry carries a marker - and this manual quotes its name without one.** On Dragonfly's own right-click menu the entry is displayed with one glyph in front of its name, `●` by default, so you can see at a glance that Prototype Apps added it and Dragonfly did not; Dragonfly's own entries never carry one. So the entry's **name** is *Half-Height Slope Width 半高坡宽度*, and with the default marker it reads `● Half-Height Slope Width 半高坡宽度` on the menu."},
      {"kind": "note", "text": "**The marker is not a setting of this plugin.** It is one setting shared by all of Prototype Apps, and it lives in a DIFFERENT plugin's panel: **Custom Context Menus** ▸ the *1 Entries* tab ▸ the **Mark our entries on Dragonfly's menus** group. There you can pick another glyph (`•`, `▪`, `@`) or choose *no marker* to switch the feature off completely, and every marked entry across the plugins changes with it. Dragonfly rebuilds this entry on every right-click, so a change shows at your **next right-click** - no restart. The setting lives in a shared file outside both plugins, so your choice - including *no marker* - still applies to this entry when Custom Context Menus is not installed or is disabled in the App Store. What you lose in that case is only the place to CHANGE it: there is then no panel offering the choice, and an installation that never made one shows the default marker."}
    ]},
    {"heading": "Algorithm", "blocks": [
      {"kind": "steps", "steps": [
        "Sample 100 equidistant mean-intensity points along the ruler (the same API as Dragonfly's profile tool).",
        "Find the internal extremum: compare the internal max/min deviation from the mean of the two end baselines; take the larger (peak or valley).",
        "Left slope: target amplitude = (left baseline + extremum)/2, crossing found by linear interpolation; right slope likewise.",
        "Width = distance between the two half-height points, converted to millimetres from their world coordinates."
      ]},
      {"kind": "p", "text": "An extremum at a ruler end, a monotonic profile, or fewer than 3 samples produce clear error messages instead of failures. Unit-tested against a triangle profile and a Gaussian (matches the analytic FWHM)."}
    ]},
    {"heading": "Requirements", "blocks": [
      {"kind": "p", "text": "No install/internet/GPU/venv. Needs at least one Channel and one ruler annotation in the session."}
    ]}
  ]
}

{
  "title": "Load HDF5 / Zarr (OME-Zarr)",
  "cn": {
    "func": "浏览并导入分块(chunked)容器里的数据集:HDF5 文件,或 Zarr / OME-Zarr / N5 文件夹。弹出窗口:选择文件(HDF5)或文件夹(Zarr)后点 List datasets 列出容器内所有数据集(路径、形状、dtype、chunks);选中某个数据集,点 Preview 预览缩略图与元数据(含 OME-Zarr 的体素 scale);可设置 Downsample(按步长抽取空间轴,适合超大数据)与体素单位;点 Import 读取(可降采样)并 Publish 为 Dragonfly image Channel。>3 维数据(如 OME-Zarr 的 t,c,z,y,x)会自动取前导轴索引 0 归约为 (Z,Y,X);OME-Zarr 的 scale 会按所选/自带单位写入体素 spacing(降采样时相应放大)。",
    "scenarios": "适用于大型分块数据集与下一代格式:光片显微、电镜、云端 OME-NGFF/OME-Zarr、以及把结果存成 HDF5/NeXus 的各种科学数据。Downsample 让你先以低分辨率快速导入超大体数据的预览。",
    "requirements": "首次使用需在 Setup 页创建独立 venv 并安装 h5py、zarr、numpy、Pillow(联网,均为预编译 wheel,无需 Java、无需 MSVC)。不需要 GPU。N5 为尽力支持(经 zarr)。在 Dragonfly 2027.1（Python 3.14）上不能用 Dragonfly 自带的 Python 创建该环境：请安装 python.org 的 Python（3.12、3.13 或 3.14）并填入面板的 Base Python；Dragonfly 2025.1 无需另装 Python。"
  },
  "en": {
    "func": "Browses and imports datasets inside a chunked container: an HDF5 file, or a Zarr / OME-Zarr / N5 folder. In the popup: pick a file (HDF5) or folder (Zarr), click List datasets to enumerate every dataset (path, shape, dtype, chunks); choose one and click Preview to see a thumbnail and metadata (including OME-Zarr voxel scale); set a Downsample factor (stride the spatial axes - good for very large data) and a voxel unit; click Import to read (optionally downsampled) and Publish as a Dragonfly image Channel. Arrays with >3 dimensions (e.g. OME-Zarr t,c,z,y,x) are reduced to (Z,Y,X) by taking index 0 on the leading axes; the OME-Zarr scale is written to the voxel spacing using the chosen/embedded unit (scaled up when downsampling).",
    "scenarios": "For large chunked datasets and next-generation formats: light-sheet microscopy, electron microscopy, cloud OME-NGFF/OME-Zarr, and scientific results stored as HDF5/NeXus. Downsample lets you quickly import a low-resolution view of a huge volume first.",
    "requirements": "First use builds an isolated venv and installs h5py, zarr, numpy, Pillow (internet; all prebuilt wheels - no Java, no MSVC). No GPU required. N5 is best-effort (via zarr). On Dragonfly 2027.1 (Python 3.14) the bundled Python cannot build this environment: install a python.org Python (3.12, 3.13 or 3.14) and enter it in the panel's Base Python field; Dragonfly 2025.1 needs no separate Python."
  }
}

{
  "title": "Image Exporter",
  "cn": {
    "func": "功能：把图像通道导出为其它软件所需的确切文件格式，每个标签页对应一种目标软件/格式，共五个标签页。面板顶部有一个对全部标签页生效的「导出数值」选项：导出**原始灰度值**（默认）或**校准值**（即 Dragonfly 的 readout values：原始值 × slope + offset）；校准值一律以 float32（4 字节浮点）导出，通道的 slope/offset 无法读取时会明确拒绝而不是退回原始值。（1）**Bruker CTAn**：按编号排列的 8 位灰度 BMP 切片序列——CTAn 只对 8 位灰度（和 1 位黑白）图像做分析；非 8 位数据先映射到 0–255（自动最小/最大、自定义范围、或已是 8 位时保持原值），编号位数可选（3 位 = 000–999 等）、起始编号可设、位数不够时先拒绝；可同时生成 NRecon 风格 .log 记录像素尺寸，CTAn/CTvox/DataViewer 会自动读取。（2）**DICOM 序列**：使用与 Dragonfly 自带 DICOM 导出完全无关的独立写入器（内置 pydicom 2.4.4），每切片一个 CT Image Storage 文件，逐片写明几何信息（PixelSpacing 按 [行,列]=[Y,X]、ImagePositionPatient、SliceThickness），像素以 16 位存储并写入可换算回原始值的 rescale slope/intercept——当 Dragonfly 自身导出在其它软件中出现偏差时可作对照。（3）**NIfTI**：.nii / .nii.gz（手写 NIfTI-1，毫米单位；NIfTI 坐标轴为 RAS，x、y 轴按 ITK 的写法取反写入，图像与本插件导出的 NRRD / MetaImage 落在同一组物理位置），即 3D Slicer、ITK-SNAP、nnU-Net、MONAI 的通用格式。（4）**ITK / 3D Slicer**：MetaImage .mhd+.raw、单文件 .mha、或 NRRD（gzip 编码）。（5）**VGStudio**：.vgi + .vol 原始数据对，体素尺寸以毫米写入 .vgi，VGSTUDIO 可直接打开。所有写入器均为自行实现、输出字节确定，测试中用 SimpleITK 作为独立解码器交叉验证。本插件不创建、不修改会话中的任何对象，只在指定文件夹写文件。",
    "scenarios": "适用场景：把 Dragonfly 里重建/处理好的 CT 数据交给 Bruker CTAn 做骨形态计量等分析；Dragonfly 自带 DICOM 导出在第三方软件中出现偏差时，用独立 DICOM 写入器导出同一数据做对照；把数据交给 3D Slicer / ITK-SNAP / nnU-Net / MONAI（NIfTI）、elastix / ITK 流程（MHD/NRRD）或 VGSTUDIO（.vgi+.vol）；把 16 位/浮点数据按指定灰度窗口转成 8 位切片序列；需要控制切片文件编号宽度或起始编号的场合（Dragonfly 自带导出固定 3 位编号）。",
    "requirements": "环境需求：无需安装、联网、GPU 或虚拟环境——进程内 PyQt6 + numpy，DICOM 写入用内置的 pydicom（随插件一起分发）。需要会话中有已发布的图像通道（Channel）。除 CTAn 的 BMP 外，其余格式都携带几何信息：体素尺寸无法读取时会拒绝导出而不是写入猜测值；原点未知时写 0 并明确说明。CTAn 不会从 BMP 读取像素尺寸——请勾选生成 .log，或按面板显示的体素尺寸在 CTAn 中手动填写。4D 数据可选时间步，每次导出一个时间步。"
  },
  "en": {
    "func": "What it does: exports image channels in the exact file format some OTHER software expects, one tab per target, five tabs. A panel-wide 'Values to export' option applies to every tab: export the ORIGINAL grayscale values (default) or the CALIBRATED values (Dragonfly's readout values: raw x slope + offset); calibrated values are always exported as float32 (4-byte float), and a channel whose slope/offset cannot be read is refused loudly rather than silently falling back to raw values. (1) Bruker CTAn: a numbered stack of 8-bit grayscale BMP slices - CTAn analyses only 8-bit grayscale (and 1-bit monochrome); non-8-bit data is remapped to 0-255 first (auto min/max, a custom range, or kept as-is when already 8-bit), the file-number width is selectable (3 digits = 000-999 etc.) with a settable start number and a refuse-on-overflow check; optionally writes an NRecon-style .log carrying the pixel size, which CTAn/CTvox/DataViewer read automatically. (2) DICOM series: an INDEPENDENT writer (vendored pydicom 2.4.4, sharing none of Dragonfly's own DICOM export code) - one CT Image Storage file per slice with the geometry stated per slice (PixelSpacing in DICOM's [row,col]=[Y,X] order, ImagePositionPatient, SliceThickness) and pixels stored as 16-bit with a rescale slope/intercept that maps them back to the original values; built as a cross-check for when Dragonfly's own export shows deviations in other software. (3) NIfTI: .nii / .nii.gz (hand-written NIfTI-1, millimetres; NIfTI's axes are RAS, so the x and y axes are written negated exactly as ITK writes them and the image lands on the same physical points as this plugin's NRRD / MetaImage files) - the common format of 3D Slicer, ITK-SNAP, nnU-Net and MONAI. (4) ITK / 3D Slicer: MetaImage .mhd+.raw, single-file .mha, or NRRD (gzip encoding). (5) VGStudio: a .vgi + .vol raw pair with the voxel size in mm in the .vgi, opened directly by VGSTUDIO. Every writer is hand-rolled and byte-deterministic; the tests read the outputs back through SimpleITK as an independent decoder. The plugin creates and modifies nothing in the session; it only writes files where you point it.",
    "scenarios": "Typical scenarios: handing CT data reconstructed/processed in Dragonfly to Bruker CTAn for bone morphometry or other analysis; exporting the same data through an independent DICOM writer as a cross-check when Dragonfly's own DICOM export lands with deviations in third-party software; handing data to 3D Slicer / ITK-SNAP / nnU-Net / MONAI (NIfTI), to elastix / ITK pipelines (MHD/NRRD), or to VGSTUDIO (.vgi+.vol); converting 16-bit/float data to an 8-bit slice stack with a chosen gray window; any case needing control over the slice-number width or start number (Dragonfly's own export hard-codes a 3-digit counter).",
    "requirements": "Requirements: no install, no internet, no GPU, no venv - in-process PyQt6 + numpy, with vendored pydicom for the DICOM tab (distributed with the plugin). Needs a published image Channel in the session. All formats except CTAn's BMP carry geometry: when the voxel size cannot be read the export is REFUSED rather than writing a guess; an unknown origin is written as 0 and stated. CTAn does not read the pixel size from BMP - tick the .log option, or type the voxel size shown in the panel into CTAn. For 4D data a time step is selectable; one time step is exported per run."
  }
}

{
  "title_en": "Image Exporter",
  "title_cn": "Image Exporter（图像导出器）",
  "menu_en": "Image Exporter...",
  "version": "2.0",
  "date": "2026-08-11",
  "en": [
    {
      "heading": "Introduction",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "Exports image channels in the exact file format some **other software** expects. The panel is a set of tabs — one per target software or file format: **Bruker CTAn** (8-bit BMP stack), **DICOM series**, **NIfTI**, **ITK / 3D Slicer** (MetaImage / NRRD) and **VGStudio** (.vgi + .vol)."
