        {
          "kind": "bullet",
          "text": "**ITK / 3D Slicer**: MetaImage as .mhd + .raw pair or single-file .mha, or NRRD (gzip encoding, LPS space). The formats of the ITK/elastix/Slicer world; the file-name extension follows the chosen format automatically."
