{
  "title": "ImageJ / Fiji Bridge",
  "cn": {
    "func": "在 Dragonfly 与本机已安装的 ImageJ/Fiji 之间架起桥梁。在面板里建立一份输入清单（1 到 N 个已发布的 Channel，外加 MultiROI/ROI），选用内置的常用操作（滤波、阈值、形态学、投影、颗粒分析、图像计算器、标记对象等）或运行一段宏（macro）；插件把输入导出为 ImageJ 格式的 TIFF，在无界面模式下调用本机 Fiji 处理，再按您勾选的内容回传结果——新的 Channel、新的 MultiROI，以及 ImageJ 的测量结果表（可另存 CSV）。4 维图像可只处理指定的时间点范围；整数结果保持整数；每次运行都留下作业文件夹（导出的输入、真正运行的宏、runner_log.txt）便于排查。内置一批带出处引用的流行宏（含细胞显微图像分析、双输入运算、标签输出等），并提供“Import ImageJ/Fiji Macro”按钮——既可导入宏文件，也可在文本框中粘贴宏文本后保存；按旧版“单入单出”约定写的自定义宏仍按原样运行。",
    "scenarios": "适用于希望在 Dragonfly 内直接复用 ImageJ/Fiji 庞大生态（插件、宏、算法）的用户——生命科学显微图像分析、材料图像处理，以及把 Fiji 的专有算法接入 Dragonfly 工作流。典型用法包括：用 Image Calculator 做减背景、除本底或两个时间点相减；用 Analyze Particles 得到逐对象的测量表；把分割结果标记成一个个对象后作为 MultiROI 带回 Dragonfly；用 MultiROI 当掩膜只保留感兴趣区域；对时间序列只处理关心的那几个时间点。",
    "requirements": "需要本机已安装 ImageJ/Fiji；无需搭建 Python 环境（TIFF 读写用 Dragonfly 自带的 tifffile，直接调用本机 Fiji）。首次使用时在面板中指向 Fiji 的启动程序即可，建议选择 ImageJ-win64.exe——新的 Jaunch 启动器无法执行无界面宏。"
  },
  "en": {
    "func": "Bridges Dragonfly and a locally installed ImageJ/Fiji. Build an input list in the panel (1..N published Channels, plus MultiROIs/ROIs), choose a built-in operation (filters, thresholding, morphology, projections, particle analysis, Image Calculator, object labelling, ...) or run a macro; the plugin exports the inputs as ImageJ TIFFs, drives your local Fiji headlessly, and brings back whatever you ticked - a new Channel, a new MultiROI, and ImageJ's measurements table (saveable as CSV). A 4-D image can be processed over a chosen time-point range only, integer results stay integral, and every run leaves a job folder behind (the exported inputs, the macro that ran, runner_log.txt) for diagnosis. It ships a set of popular, referenced macros (cell microscopy, two-input arithmetic, label output) and an \"Import ImageJ/Fiji Macro\" button - import a macro file, or paste macro text into a box and save it; custom macros written for the older one-in/one-out contract keep running unchanged.",
    "scenarios": "For users who want to reuse ImageJ/Fiji's huge ecosystem (plugins, macros, algorithms) directly inside Dragonfly - life-science microscopy analysis, materials image processing, and wiring Fiji-specific algorithms into Dragonfly workflows. Typical uses: Image Calculator for background subtraction, flat-field division or differencing two time points; Analyze Particles for a per-object measurements table; labelling a segmentation and bringing it back as a MultiROI; using a MultiROI as a mask; processing only the time points you care about in a series.",
    "requirements": "Requires ImageJ/Fiji installed on this machine; there is no Python environment to build (TIFF I/O uses Dragonfly's bundled tifffile and it drives your local Fiji directly). On first use, point the panel at your Fiji launcher - prefer ImageJ-win64.exe, because the newer Jaunch launcher cannot run headless macros."
  }
}

