{
  "title": "Classify MultiROI Labels",
  "cn": {
    "func": "对一个 MultiROI 里的每一个 label（每个 label 通常对应图像上的一个颗粒/物体）自动分类，并把分类分组编号（1..N；0 = 未分类/离群）作为一个名为 “Classification Group” 的 scalar value slot 写回该 MultiROI，同时按分组着色。做法：先用 Channel 的图像和 MultiROI 的 label，逐 label 提取大量图像特征（用 Dragonfly 自带的 pyradiomics：一阶灰度统计 + 形状 + GLCM/GLRLM/GLSZM/GLDM/NGTDM 纹理，约 90+ 个特征），再对特征做标准化 + PCA 白化，然后分类。三种模式：1) 无监督 K-Means——可手动指定分组数 N，或点 “Auto” 用聚类有效性指标（silhouette / Calinski-Harabasz / Davies-Bouldin 共识）给出建议 N 并显示各 N 的曲线（这是建议，真正数目请自行确认）；可选把离群 label 归为 group 0；2) 半监督——在几个已知类型的 label 上打标签（在 Dragonfly 里选中这些 label 后点 “Add Dragonfly selection”，或直接填 label ID），用随机森林训练并对全部 label 预测；3) 分组编号可按 簇大小 / 平均灰度 / 体积 排序，便于解释。流程：1. Input & Features 选 Channel + MultiROI，勾选特征族，Extract features；2. Classify & Write 选模式、设参数、Classify，然后 “Write groups → MultiROI”。可导出 每 label 的特征 + 分组 CSV，以及 PCA 散点图。全程在 Dragonfly 内进程运行，用其自带的 scikit-learn / scikit-image / pyradiomics，无需 venv、无需联网、无需 GPU。",
    "scenarios": "适用于：一张图里有几百个颗粒（已用分割得到 MultiROI），肉眼能区分出 N 种不同类型的颗粒（按亮度/纹理/形状/大小），希望自动把每个颗粒归类并上色分组；矿物/岩石薄片的物相分类、粉末颗粒分型、孔隙/夹杂物分型、细胞/晶粒按形态分型等。已知类型数就用手动 N（最稳）或半监督（最贴合你的判定标准）；不确定时用 Auto 看曲线。",
    "requirements": "输入需要：一个灰度强度 Channel + 一个与之同网格的 MultiROI（每个 label 一个颗粒）。二维、三维均可（二维自动使用 shape2D 纹理）。无需安装环境（用 Dragonfly 自带的 numpy/scipy/scikit-learn/scikit-image/pyradiomics/SimpleITK 在进程内运行），无需 GPU 或联网。太小/退化的 label 可能无法计算纹理，会被跳过或归为未分类。"
  },
  "en": {
    "func": "Automatically classifies every label in a MultiROI (each label usually a particle/object) and writes the classification group id (1..N; 0 = unclassified/outlier) back as a scalar-value slot named \"Classification Group\", coloring the MultiROI by group. How: using the intensity Channel + the MultiROI labels, it extracts many per-label image features with Dragonfly's bundled pyradiomics (first-order intensity + shape + GLCM/GLRLM/GLSZM/GLDM/NGTDM texture, ~90+ features), standardizes + PCA-whitens them, then classifies. Three modes: 1) Unsupervised K-Means - set the number of groups N manually, or click \"Auto\" to suggest N from a consensus of cluster-validity indices (silhouette / Calinski-Harabasz / Davies-Bouldin) with the per-N curve shown (a suggestion - confirm the real count yourself); optionally flag outlier labels as group 0. 2) Semi-supervised - tag a few example labels per type (select them in Dragonfly and click \"Add Dragonfly selection\", or type label IDs), train a RandomForest, predict all labels. 3) Groups 1..N can be numbered by cluster size / mean intensity / volume for interpretability. Workflow: tab 1 Input & Features - pick Channel + MultiROI, choose feature families, Extract features; tab 2 Classify & Write - pick mode, set parameters, Classify, then \"Write groups -> MultiROI\". You can export a per-label features+group CSV and a PCA scatter plot. Runs in-process in Dragonfly using its bundled scikit-learn / scikit-image / pyradiomics - no venv, no internet, no GPU.",
    "scenarios": "For an image with hundreds of particles (already segmented into a MultiROI) where the eye can tell N particle types apart (by brightness/texture/shape/size) and you want each particle auto-classified and color-grouped: mineral/rock thin-section phase classification, powder-particle typing, pore/inclusion typing, cell/grain morphology typing, etc. If you know the type count use manual N (most robust) or semi-supervised (closest to your own criteria); when unsure use Auto and inspect the curve.",
    "requirements": "Needs an intensity Channel + a MultiROI on the same grid (one label per particle). 2D or 3D (2D uses shape2D texture automatically). No environment setup (runs in-process with Dragonfly's bundled numpy/scipy/scikit-learn/scikit-image/pyradiomics/SimpleITK); no GPU or internet. Very small/degenerate labels where texture is undefined are skipped or left unclassified."
  }
}

