        {
          "kind": "bullet",
          "text": "**准确的体素尺寸**:体素尺寸由 TXM 的 `ImageInfo/PixelSize`(单位微米)读出;ZEISS 体数据为各向同性,发布时按物理尺寸写入 X/Y/Z spacing(以米为单位,符合 ORS 约定)。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "bullet",
          "text": "**数据类型映射**:`DataType == 5` → `uint16`,其余 → `float32`,与 UnitedVision 的读取一致。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "bullet",
          "text": "**不卡界面**:较慢的整卷解码在**后台工作线程**上进行,进度条实时显示 `[i/n]` 进度,只有对象模型(发布 Channel)那几步才会切回 Qt UI 线程;随时可点 **Cancel** 中止。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "bullet",
          "text": "**列表管理**:**Remove** 移除选中项、**Clear** 清空列表;底部日志区显示每个文件的解码与发布过程。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "使用步骤",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "steps",
          "steps": [
            "在 **Prototype Apps ▸ Load TXM Files...** 打开面板(位于 Reconstruction & Imaging 分组)。",
            "点 **Add Files...** 选择一个或多个 `.txm` 文件;或点 **Add Folder...** 选一个文件夹,插件会递归扫描其中所有 `.txm` 并加入列表。",
            "(可选)在列表里点选某个文件,查看右侧的尺寸、数据类型、体素尺寸,以及中间切片预览缩略图,确认这是你要导入的数据。",
            "(可选)用 **Remove** 移除不需要的项,或 **Clear** 清空重来。",
            "点 **Load into Dragonfly**,插件会逐个解码并发布——进度条显示总体进度,日志区打印每个文件的 shape 与 spacing。",
            "完成后每个 `.txm` 会成为对象列表里的一个新 **Channel**(名称取自文件名),体素 spacing 已按 PixelSize 写好,可直接在 2D/3D 视图中查看。若中途要停止,点 **Cancel**。"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "环境需求",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "**纯进程内运行,零配置:无需建立 venv、无需联网、无需 GPU、无需管理员权限。**"
        },
        {
          "kind": "bullet",
          "text": "仅依赖 Dragonfly 自带的 **numpy**,以及随插件打包的**纯 Python `olefile`**(OLE2 读取器,BSD 许可,位于 `txm_code/vendor/olefile`)——首次使用**无需任何下载或安装步骤**。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "bullet",
          "text": "**内存**:整卷会一次性读入内存后再发布,请确保内存足以容纳该体数据。一个约 990 张切片的 `uint16` 体数据(约 2 GB)解码约需数十秒;插件在处理下一个文件前会主动释放上一卷占用的内存。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "bullet",
          "text": "安装:运行 `python install_load_txm_plugin.py`(任意 Python 3 均可),然后**完全重启 Dragonfly**;`--uninstall` 可卸载。本插件也随 Full / Apps 安装包分发(id `load_txm`,默认启用)。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "提示与注意事项",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "bullet",
          "text": "**为什么不用内置加载器**:Dragonfly 本身也能打开 `.txm`,但本插件特意改用 UnitedVision 那套读取代码,以保证两个工具的体素 spacing、切片顺序与 dtype **逐位一致**,便于复现。若你只想快速打开、不在意与 UnitedVision 对齐,用 Dragonfly 自带的导入也可以。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "bullet",
          "text": "**预览失败不影响导入**:预览是尽力而为的;即使某个文件读不出缩略图或元数据,通常仍可点 **Load into Dragonfly** 正常导入(真正的失败会在日志里打印完整堆栈)。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "bullet",
          "text": "**只认 `.txm`**:文件筛选与文件夹扫描都只匹配 `.txm` 扩展名;若文件不是合法的 OLE2 容器,读取会报 `Not a valid TXM/OLE image container`。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "bullet",
          "text": "**缺少 PixelSize 时**:体素尺寸会显示为 unknown,Channel 仍会发布,但没有物理 spacing——后续如需真实尺寸,请在 Dragonfly 里手动设置。"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "en": [
    {
      "heading": "Introduction",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "**Load TXM Files** opens ZEISS Xradia **`.txm`** reconstructed volume files inside Dragonfly and publishes them as Dragonfly image **Channels**. It is a dockable panel under **Prototype Apps**: use **Add Files...** to pick one or more `.txm` files, or **Add Folder...** to recursively scan a folder for every `.txm`; select a file in the list to see its dimensions, data type, voxel size and a mid-slice preview thumbnail; then click **Load into Dragonfly** to read and publish every listed file."
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "The plugin **deliberately does not use any Dragonfly built-in loader**. Its decode logic is carried over verbatim from the working TXM reader in the **UnitedVision** project, so the read path (voxel spacing, slice order, dtype mapping) is identical to UnitedVision — useful whenever you want reproducible results across the two tools."
        },
        {
          "kind": "note",
          "text": "A `.txm` is really an **OLE2 compound file**: the reconstructed volume is stored as one grayscale slice per `ImageDataN/ImageM` stream, while `ImageInfo/*` streams hold the dimensions, dtype code and pixel size. The plugin reads them stream-by-stream with a bundled pure-Python `olefile`, so there is no compiled dependency."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "Features",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "bullet",
          "text": "**Batch import:** add many `.txm` files at once; **Add Folder...** recursively scans a whole folder and adds every `.txm` it finds, sorted by path."
        },
        {
          "kind": "bullet",
          "text": "**Preview before import:** selecting a file in the list shows its **Dimensions (X x Y x Z)**, **Data type**, **Voxel size** and **File size** on the right, plus a **grayscale thumbnail of the middle slice** — the preview reads only a single slice, so it is fast."
        },
        {
          "kind": "bullet",
          "text": "**Accurate voxel size:** the voxel spacing is read from the TXM `ImageInfo/PixelSize` (in micrometres); ZEISS volumes are isotropic, so the X/Y/Z spacing is written from the physical size (in metres, per the ORS convention) when the Channel is published."
        },
        {
          "kind": "bullet",
          "text": "**Data-type mapping:** `DataType == 5` maps to `uint16`, everything else to `float32`, matching UnitedVision's reader."
        },
        {
          "kind": "bullet",
          "text": "**Responsive UI:** the slow full-volume decode runs on a **background worker thread** with a live `[i/n]` progress bar; only the object-model calls (publishing the Channel) are marshaled onto the Qt UI thread, and you can hit **Cancel** at any time."
        },
        {
          "kind": "bullet",
          "text": "**List management:** **Remove** drops the selected items and **Clear** empties the list; a log pane at the bottom traces each file's decode and publish steps."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "How to use",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "steps",
          "steps": [
            "Open the panel at **Prototype Apps ▸ Load TXM Files...** (in the Reconstruction & Imaging group).",
            "Click **Add Files...** to pick one or more `.txm` files; or **Add Folder...** to pick a folder, and the plugin recursively scans it for every `.txm` and adds them to the list.",
            "(Optional) Select a file in the list to inspect its dimensions, data type and voxel size on the right, plus the mid-slice preview thumbnail, and confirm it is the data you want.",
            "(Optional) Use **Remove** to drop unwanted entries, or **Clear** to start over.",
            "Click **Load into Dragonfly**; the plugin decodes and publishes each file in turn — the progress bar shows overall progress and the log prints each file's shape and spacing.",
            "When it finishes, each `.txm` becomes a new **Channel** in the object list (named from the file name) with voxel spacing already set from PixelSize, ready to view in 2D/3D. Click **Cancel** to stop partway."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "Requirements",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "**Runs purely in-process with zero setup: no venv, no internet, no GPU and no admin rights.**"
        },
        {
          "kind": "bullet",
          "text": "It depends only on Dragonfly's bundled **numpy** plus a **pure-Python `olefile`** (a BSD-licensed OLE2 reader packaged under `txm_code/vendor/olefile`) — there is **no download or install step** on first use."
        },
        {
          "kind": "bullet",
          "text": "**Memory:** the full volume is read into memory before publishing, so make sure you have room for it. A ~990-slice `uint16` volume (~2 GB) takes on the order of tens of seconds to decode; the plugin releases each volume's memory before starting the next file."
        },
        {
          "kind": "bullet",
          "text": "Install: run `python install_load_txm_plugin.py` (any Python 3), then **fully restart Dragonfly**; `--uninstall` removes it. The plugin also ships in the Full / Apps packages (id `load_txm`, enabled by default)."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "Tips & notes",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "bullet",
          "text": "**Why not the built-in loader:** Dragonfly can open `.txm` natively, but this plugin intentionally uses UnitedVision's read code so the voxel spacing, slice order and dtype are **bit-for-bit identical** across the two tools, for reproducibility. If you just want a quick open and do not care about matching UnitedVision, the built-in importer is fine too."
        },
        {
          "kind": "bullet",
          "text": "**A failed preview does not block import:** the preview is best-effort — even if a file's thumbnail or metadata cannot be read, you can usually still click **Load into Dragonfly** and import it (a real failure prints the full stack trace in the log)."
        },
        {
          "kind": "bullet",
          "text": "**`.txm` only:** both the file filter and the folder scan match only the `.txm` extension; if a file is not a valid OLE2 container the read fails with `Not a valid TXM/OLE image container`."
        },
        {
          "kind": "bullet",
          "text": "**When PixelSize is missing:** the voxel size shows as unknown and the Channel is still published, but without physical spacing — set it manually in Dragonfly afterwards if you need real-world units."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}

{
  "title": "LocateAnything: Find Objects by Text Prompt",
  "cn": {
    "func": "LocateAnything 让您只需输入想找的目标（如\"孔隙\"或\"细胞\"），即可在图像的二维切片中自动定位对象。选择一个通道（或将最多三个灰度通道合成为伪彩色图像），设定切片方向和位置，输入文字提示后点击运行。检测结果以 MultiROI 形式返回——每个检测对象对应一个带标签的区域——并附带注释标签，可直接用于后续分割、测量或标注，同时生成叠加图便于快速目视检查。",
    "scenarios": "适用于无需训练模型即可快速定位候选特征的场景：在材料科学和工业 CT 切片中查找孔隙、裂纹或夹杂物，在显微图像中定位细胞或染色结构，或在精细分割前预先圈定感兴趣区域。注意：底层 AI 模型基于自然照片训练，用于灰度 CT/显微图像属实验性质，请结合叠加图核查结果。",
    "requirements": "需要 NVIDIA 显卡（建议 8 GB 以上显存）和网络连接；首次使用点击\"Setup Environment\"（约 5-15 分钟，基于 Dragonfly 自带 Python 构建），并一次性下载免费的 NVIDIA LocateAnything-3B 模型权重（无需登录）。在 Dragonfly 2027.1（Python 3.14）上不能用 Dragonfly 自带的 Python 创建该环境：请安装 python.org 的 Python（3.12、3.13 或 3.14）并填入面板的 Base Python；Dragonfly 2025.1 无需另装 Python。"
  },
  "en": {
    "func": "LocateAnything lets you find objects in a 2D slice of your image simply by typing what you are looking for (e.g. \"pores\" or \"cells\"). Pick a channel (or compose up to three grayscale channels into a false-color image), choose a slice orientation and index, enter a text prompt, and click Run. The detections come back as a MultiROI — one labeled region per detected object — plus annotation labels, ready for further segmentation, measurement, or annotation, along with an overlay image for a quick visual check.",
    "scenarios": "Useful whenever you want to quickly locate candidate features without training a model: finding pores, cracks, or inclusions in materials-science and industrial CT slices, spotting cells or stained structures in microscopy, or pre-selecting regions of interest before detailed segmentation. Note the underlying AI model was trained on natural photographs, so results on grayscale CT/microscopy are experimental — always check the overlay.",
    "requirements": "Needs an NVIDIA GPU (8 GB+ recommended) and internet; click Setup Environment on first use (~5-15 min, builds on Dragonfly's own Python) and download the free NVIDIA LocateAnything-3B model weights once (no login needed). On Dragonfly 2027.1 (Python 3.14) the bundled Python cannot build this environment: install a python.org Python (3.12, 3.13 or 3.14) and enter it in the panel's Base Python field; Dragonfly 2025.1 needs no separate Python."
  }
}

{
  "title": "Train Custom Model: LocateAnything",
  "cn": {
    "func": "在您自己的标注数据上微调 LocateAnything AI 检测模型，使其学会识别您样品中特有的目标物体。您可以直接在 Dragonfly 会话中构建训练集——选择一幅图像、一个包含标注对象的 MultiROI、一个切片和一个类别名称（如\"孔隙\"），逐个添加训练样例——然后开始训练。训练结果是一个自定义模型文件夹，只需在 LocateAnything（推理）插件中选中它，即可在新图像中检测您的目标物体。",
    "scenarios": "适用于通用模型检测效果不佳的目标对象：例如材料科学和工业 CT 扫描中的孔隙、裂纹、夹杂物或纤维，以及生命科学图像中的细胞等结构。只需少量标注切片即可让模型学会您的特定对象类别。",
    "requirements": "需要先安装 LocateAnything（推理）插件并完成其环境搭建和基础模型下载；需要显存不低于 24 GB 的 NVIDIA GPU。训练所得模型仅限非商业/科研用途（NVIDIA 许可）。"
  },
  "en": {
    "func": "Fine-tunes the LocateAnything AI detection model on your own labeled data so it learns to find the objects specific to your samples. You build a training set directly from your Dragonfly session — pick an image, a MultiROI with your labeled objects, a slice, and a category name (e.g. \"pores\"), then add examples one by one — and start training. The result is a custom model folder that you simply select in the LocateAnything (inference) plugin to detect your objects in new images.",
    "scenarios": "For anyone whose objects of interest are not detected well by the general-purpose model: e.g. pores, cracks, inclusions or fibers in materials-science and industrial CT scans, or cells and other structures in life-science images. A handful of labeled slices is enough to teach the model your specific object category.",
    "requirements": "Requires the LocateAnything (inference) plugin installed with its environment set up and base model downloaded; needs an NVIDIA GPU with at least 24 GB VRAM. Trained models are for non-commercial/research use only (NVIDIA license)."
  }
}

{
  "title": "3D Object Analysis (MCIB3D)",
  "cn": {
    "func": "在 Dragonfly 中选择一个 Channel 或二值 MultiROI，把它导出为 Fiji 可读取的 TIFF，在本机 Fiji 中调用 3D ImageJ Suite（MCIB3D）执行真三维对象分割（3D Simple Segmentation / 3D 分水岭 / 3D 斑点分割）、逐对象三维形状测量（体积、表面积、致密度、伸长度）以及三维空间分布统计（最近邻距离），再把 Fiji 输出的三维标签图导入回 Dragonfly 生成 MultiROI，并显示逐对象测量表格（可另存为 CSV）。面板会自动查找 Fiji，也可以手动指定 Fiji/ImageJ 启动器。",
    "scenarios": "适用于需要在三维体数据（孔隙、颗粒、细胞、气泡等）上做真三维对象分割、逐对象三维形貌统计与空间分布分析的用户，例如把相互接触的三维对象拆开并统计每个对象的体积/形状，或分析对象之间的最近邻间距。",
    "requirements": "需要本机已安装 Fiji/ImageJ。MCIB3D 通过 Fiji 的 mcib3d 更新站点提供（3D ImageJ Suite）；如果面板检测不到 MCIB3D，会弹窗询问是否先安装该 Fiji 更新站点。安装/更新 MCIB3D 时需要联网；正常运行不需要 Python 虚拟环境或 GPU。MCIB3D 为 GPL-3.0 许可，仅作为独立的无界面 Fiji JVM 子进程被调用，不会被导入 Dragonfly 进程。"
  },
  "en": {
    "func": "Select a Dragonfly Channel or binary MultiROI, export it as a Fiji-readable TIFF, run the 3D ImageJ Suite (MCIB3D) in the user's local Fiji for true-3D object segmentation (3D Simple Segmentation / 3D watershed / 3D spot segmentation), per-object 3D shape descriptors (volume, surface area, compactness, elongation), and 3D spatial-distribution statistics (nearest-neighbour distances), then import the Fiji 3D label image back into Dragonfly as a MultiROI and show a per-object measurements table (savable as CSV). The panel can auto-detect Fiji or use a user-selected Fiji/ImageJ launcher.",
    "scenarios": "For users who need true-3D object segmentation, per-object 3D morphometry, and spatial-distribution analysis on volumetric data (pores, grains, cells, bubbles), such as splitting touching 3D objects and reporting each object's volume/shape, or analysing nearest-neighbour spacing between objects.",
    "requirements": "Requires a local Fiji/ImageJ installation. MCIB3D is provided by Fiji's mcib3d update site (3D ImageJ Suite); if the panel cannot detect MCIB3D, it prompts to install that Fiji update site first. Internet is needed for installation/update only; normal processing needs no Python virtual environment or GPU. MCIB3D is GPL-3.0 licensed and is driven ONLY as a separate headless Fiji JVM subprocess - it is never imported into the Dragonfly process."
  }
}

{
  "title": "3D Measurement & Acquisition QA",
  "cn": {
    "func": "在做任何测量之前，先回答「这份采集数据能不能用来测量」。六个编号步骤：选择通道（可选 ROI 掩膜与 MultiROI 对象，体素间距自动读自 Dragonfly 几何）；图像质量（整体与分块聚焦度，可定位失焦区域；饱和裁剪比例；强度统计；基于中位数绝对偏差的噪声与信噪比；通道相关性；功率谱斜率）；真正的三维形态学粒度分析（开运算尺寸谱，给出主导结构尺度与分布宽度）；按 MultiROI 逐标签的三维径向分布（等体积同心壳层、强度占比、径向变异系数、可按强度加权求中心）；按阈值规则给出 pass / warn / fail 判定；最后发布聚焦度或噪声通道，并导出 CSV / JSON / 自包含 HTML 报告。各向异性数据在需要各向同性的步骤会真正重采样，而不是把三轴间距平均后当作物理长度。",
    "scenarios": "适用于：大批扫描进入分析流程前的自动质量筛查（失焦、过曝、信噪比不足的数据先挑出来）；多通道成像检查通道间是否串扰或错位；材料或生物样品中确定主导颗粒/孔隙尺度；以及考察每个对象内部强度是均匀分布还是集中在边缘（例如壳层结构、镀层、染色渗透深度）。",
    "requirements": "无需任何安装或配置：完全运行在 Dragonfly 自带的 Python 中，使用其已附带的 NumPy 与 SciPy。不联网、不下载、不需要 GPU、不创建虚拟环境。"
  },
  "en": {
    "func": "Answers 'is this acquisition good enough to measure?' before anyone measures it, in six numbered steps: choose a Channel (optionally an ROI mask and MultiROI objects; voxel spacing is read from Dragonfly's geometry); image quality (global and per-block focus so an out-of-focus region is located, saturation clipping, intensity statistics, MAD-based noise and SNR, channel correlation, power-spectrum slope); a real 3D morphological granulometry giving the dominant structure scale and the spread of the size distribution; per-label 3D radial distribution over equal-volume concentric shells with intensity fractions, radial CV and an optional intensity-weighted centre; a pass / warn / fail verdict from threshold rules; and finally publishing a focus or noise Channel and exporting CSV, JSON and a self-contained HTML report. Anisotropic data is genuinely resampled where a metric needs isotropy, instead of averaging the three spacings and calling the result a physical length.",
    "scenarios": "Use it to screen a batch of scans before analysis (catching out-of-focus, clipped or noisy data early), to check multi-channel acquisitions for bleed-through or misalignment, to find the dominant particle or pore scale in a material or biological sample, and to see whether intensity inside each object is uniform or concentrated at its edge — shells, coatings and stain penetration depth.",
    "requirements": "Nothing to install or configure: it runs entirely in Dragonfly's own Python using the NumPy and SciPy it already ships. No internet, no download, no GPU, no virtual environment."
  }
}

{
  "title_en": "3D Measurement & Acquisition QA",
  "title_cn": "3D Measurement & Acquisition QA（三维测量与采集质量检查）",
  "menu_en": "3D Measurement & Acquisition QA...",
  "version": "1.0",
  "date": "2026-08-01",
  "cn": [
    {"heading": "简介", "blocks": [
      {"kind": "p", "text": "在做任何测量之前，本插件先回答一个更基础的问题：**这份采集数据能不能用来测量？** 它检查聚焦、饱和、噪声与频谱，给出主导结构尺度，并考察每个对象内部的强度分布。"},
      {"kind": "p", "text": "面板分为 6 个编号步骤。任何上游输入或参数变化都会使下游结果失效，导出的数字永远对应当前设置；长任务在工作线程中运行，取消或失败都不会发布任何东西。"},
      {"kind": "note", "text": "体素间距自动读自 Dragonfly 几何。**各向异性数据在需要各向同性的步骤会真正重采样**，而不是把三轴间距平均后当作物理长度——那样得到的「尺寸」不是长度。"}
    ]},
    {"heading": "适用场景", "blocks": [
      {"kind": "bullet", "text": "批量扫描进入分析流程前的自动质检：先挑出失焦、过曝、信噪比不足的数据。"},
      {"kind": "bullet", "text": "多通道成像：检查通道之间是否串扰或错位（通道相关性）。"},
      {"kind": "bullet", "text": "确定主导颗粒或孔隙尺度（三维粒度分析）。"},
      {"kind": "bullet", "text": "考察对象内部强度是均匀还是集中在边缘：壳层结构、镀层、染色渗透深度。"}
    ]},
    {"heading": "安装与启用", "blocks": [
      {"kind": "steps", "steps": [
        "安装 Prototype Apps 完整包（或在 App Store 中勾选本插件）。",
        "本插件默认**未启用**，请在 App Store 或菜单项管理器中启用。",
        "**完全重启 Dragonfly**（插件只在启动时被发现）。",
        "从菜单打开：Prototype Apps ▸ 3D Measurement & Acquisition QA…（分组：Measurements & Analysis）。"
      ]}
    ]},
    {"heading": "运行环境与首次配置", "blocks": [
      {"kind": "p", "text": "**无需任何安装或配置。** 完全运行在 Dragonfly 自带的 Python 中，使用其已附带的 NumPy 与 SciPy。不联网、不下载、不需要 GPU、不创建虚拟环境。"},
      {"kind": "p", "text": "面板顶部的 **Environment** 一行显示当前可用能力（是否可发布通道、是否可读取 MultiROI）。不可用的功能会被禁用并说明原因。"}
    ]},
    {"heading": "界面说明", "blocks": [
      {"kind": "p", "text": "顶部固定显示运行环境、当前输入、当前任务、进度条与 **Cancel**。"},
      {"kind": "h3", "text": "1. 数据与环境"},
      {"kind": "p", "text": "选择通道（只列出**已发布**对象），可选 ROI 掩膜与 MultiROI 对象，以及时间步。选定后会显示形状、三轴间距、是否各向异性和时间步数，并据此自动设定粒度分析的半径量程。"},
      {"kind": "h3", "text": "2. 图像质量"},
      {"kind": "p", "text": "输出聚焦度（整体与分块的最小值/中位数/5 分位）、饱和比例（分别统计触底与触顶）、强度统计、噪声（MAD×1.4826）与信噪比、功率谱斜率。"},
      {"kind": "h3", "text": "3. 粒度分析"},
      {"kind": "p", "text": "以一系列**物理半径**做开运算，得到保留曲线与尺寸谱，并给出峰值半径。半径量程根据体素尺寸自动设定；超出上限的半径会被跳过并明确提示，而不是耗尽内存。"},
      {"kind": "h3", "text": "4. 径向分布"},
      {"kind": "p", "text": "对 MultiROI 的每个标签，按**等体积**同心壳层统计强度占比与均值，并给出径向变异系数。等体积而非等厚度，否则最外层仅因为体积大就总是占优。"},
      {"kind": "h3", "text": "5. 批量质检规则"},
      {"kind": "p", "text": "对第 2 步测得的指标套用阈值规则，给出 pass / warn / fail 与触发原因。规则引用了但测量未提供的指标会被标为 **missing**，绝不当作通过。"},
      {"kind": "h3", "text": "6. 结果与导出"},
      {"kind": "p", "text": "发布聚焦度或噪声通道（新对象，继承源几何），或导出 CSV / JSON / 自包含 HTML 报告。"}
