          "kind": "p",
          "text": "The overall workflow, and the choice of which quantities are worth reporting, were informed by NREL's MATBOX Microstructure Analysis Toolbox (BSD 2-Clause, Copyright (c) 2020, Alliance for Sustainable Energy, LLC): https://github.com/NREL/MATBOX_Microstructure_analysis_toolbox — **no source was copied, ported, translated or bundled**, and no MATLAB, MATLAB Runtime or Octave is required at runtime; every metric is implemented from its algorithmic description in NumPy/SciPy and tested against analytic phantoms. PoreSpy (MIT) is prior art for chord-length and two-point correlation measurement."
        },
