   "heading": "Runtime environment & first-run setup",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "kind": "p",
     "text": "**Nothing to set up.** The plugin runs in-process in Dragonfly's own Python (PyQt6 + the numpy, openpyxl and matplotlib Dragonfly ships): no virtual environment, no GPU, no admin rights. **python-pptx 1.0.2** (MIT), which PowerPoint output needs, **ships with the plugin** — there is no download on first use any more."
    },
