          "kind": "p",
          "text": "Pick the image already imported into Dragonfly. **The voxel size comes from the channel**, so calibrate the image in Dragonfly once and every length in this plugin is in micrometres. If Dragonfly reports no voxel size, the panel says so and every length is labelled in voxels instead of quietly pretending."
        },
