          "text": "**Distance to surface** — from the pore's surface to the part's surface: the thinnest wall of material between the cavity and the outside. Surfaces are the voxel FACES, matched with a k-d tree. This is exact when the two surfaces are flat and parallel, which is the usual near-surface case; on an oblique staircase surface, face-centre sampling can overestimate by at most half a face diagonal."
