            "**2 Segment** — choose whether the material is the bright phase (usual for metal in CT), the dark phase, or a value band. Press **Otsu** for a starting threshold, or click on the histogram, or type the value. Adjust the clean-up if you need it, then press **Segment the solid and find the pores**. The report gives the pore count and the porosity; the preview shows solid / pore / outside.",
