in size without losing any of the Learn material or the per-step buttons. Every tab stays open so the parameters can be read and changed BEFORE the run, and a step whose input does not exist yet now REFUSES at its button instead of quietly falling back to a default threshold and reporting a confident, wrong porosity.",
