  ],
  "en": [
    {
      "heading": "Introduction",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "This plugin merges two jobs into **one plugin**: **show/hide the top-level “Prototype Apps” menu**, and **remove all Prototype Apps menus & plugins at once**. It exposes both through a **Configurable Action** (“Toggle Prototype Apps menu”) and a **dockable panel** (Prototype Apps ▸ Prototype Apps Menu Manager…). Everything here affects **only Prototype Apps** and **never** touches the Prototype Labs core (Developer ▸ Prototype Labs…)."
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "The core is that configurable action: default shortcut **Left Ctrl + Left Shift + P**. One press toggles the top “Prototype Apps” menu's visibility **at runtime** — **no restart** — and the menu returns automatically on the next Dragonfly launch. Dragonfly's menu bar is **compiled C++** with no Python hide API, so the plugin reaches the main window's menu bar through **Qt** and flips that menu action's visibility."
        },
        {
          "kind": "note",
          "text": "Use it to hide/restore the top Prototype Apps menu with a keystroke (demos, screen recording, decluttering the UI), or to hide / fully remove all Prototype Apps components on this machine at once."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "Features",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "bullet",
          "text": "**One-key menu toggle:** the configurable action “Toggle Prototype Apps menu” flips the top “Prototype Apps” menu's visibility at runtime (no restart; it returns on next launch)."
        },
        {
          "kind": "bullet",
          "text": "**Rebindable shortcut:** default **Left Ctrl + Left Shift + P**, changeable any time in **Preferences ▸ Configurable Actions** → search “Toggle Prototype Apps menu” and double-click to set any key."
        },
        {
          "kind": "bullet",
          "text": "**“Toggle now” button in the panel:** the panel top explains the shortcut and offers a **Toggle Prototype Apps menu now** button, so you can toggle without remembering the key."
        },
        {
          "kind": "bullet",
          "text": "**Hide all (reversible):** removes only the Prototype Apps menu entries while keeping the plugin files and built environments; re-run the installer or use the App Store to restore."
        },
        {
          "kind": "bullet",
          "text": "**Permanently delete (irreversible):** on top of hiding, also deletes the plugin code dirs, the App Store support module, the central store, and file-based environments (venvs / downloads / WSL distros); requires a confirmation checkbox."
        },
        {
          "kind": "bullet",
          "text": "**Prototype Apps only:** both removals are driven by the shared central store (the same `state.json` / `.pl_managed.json` contract as the installers, the App Store and the Menu Item Manager), never touching the Prototype Labs core or your own files."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "Shortcut: toggle the menu",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "After install, **restart Dragonfly**. The action “Toggle Prototype Apps menu” appears in **Preferences ▸ Configurable Actions**, bound to **Left Ctrl + Left Shift + P** by default."
        },
        {
          "kind": "steps",
          "steps": [
            "Press **Left Ctrl + Left Shift + P** in any view — the top “Prototype Apps” menu hides immediately; press it again to bring it back.",
            "To rebind: open **Preferences ▸ Configurable Actions**, search “Toggle Prototype Apps menu”, **double-click** the row, and press the new key combination to save.",
            "Prefer a button: open the **Prototype Apps ▸ Prototype Apps Menu Manager…** panel and click **Toggle Prototype Apps menu now** — same effect."
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "note",
          "text": "Hiding is only a runtime state — **the menu comes back on the next Dragonfly launch** and nothing is permanently removed. If the installer reported a binding status of `no-section`, preferences.xml had no such section yet; just bind it once in the dialog above."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "How to use: the manager panel",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "Open **Prototype Apps ▸ Prototype Apps Menu Manager…**. The top half is the shortcut explanation + the Toggle-now button; the bottom half is the **removal tool** (the former “Remove All Menus & Plugins” tool)."
        },
        {
          "kind": "steps",
          "steps": [
            "In the bottom half, choose a mode: **Hide all menus (keep files & environments)** — reversible; or **Permanently DELETE all files** — irreversible.",
            "For the delete mode, tick the **“I understand this permanently deletes all files and cannot be undone.”** checkbox to enable the bottom button.",
            "Click the bottom button (**Hide All** in hide mode, **Delete All** in delete mode). A log pane opens below and lists each component as it is hidden/deleted.",
            "When you see **RESTART Dragonfly for the menu to update.**, **restart Dragonfly** so the menu bar refreshes."
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "note",
          "text": "On a full delete, environments outside the safe locations (`%LOCALAPPDATA%`, `comet`, the central store) are NOT auto-deleted — the log lists them under “NOT auto-deleted” for you to remove manually; WSL distros are unregistered with `wsl --unregister`."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "Requirements",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "bullet",
          "text": "**Runs in-process:** a pure PyQt6 UI with **no venv, GPU or internet**; it downloads nothing."
        },
        {
          "kind": "bullet",
          "text": "**The configurable action** appears in Preferences ▸ Configurable Actions only **after a Dragonfly restart**; the default key is written into `preferences.xml` by the installer."
        },
        {
          "kind": "bullet",
          "text": "**Install with Dragonfly closed:** Dragonfly rewrites `preferences.xml` on exit, so a key pre-seeded while it is running would be overwritten. The plugin copy + old-component cleanup are unaffected (they take effect on next restart)."
        },
        {
          "kind": "bullet",
          "text": "**The removal feature needs the installed Prototype Apps central store** (`full_package_store.py`). If Prototype Apps was never installed via the Full/Apps package, the panel reports “No Prototype Apps package store found” and there is nothing to remove."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "Tips & notes",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "bullet",
          "text": "**Hide ≠ delete:** both the toggle shortcut and “Hide all menus” are reversible — the former returns on next launch, the latter is restored by re-running the installer or the App Store. Only “Permanently DELETE all files” actually removes files."
        },
        {
          "kind": "bullet",
          "text": "**The toggle acts on the loaded menu bar:** the action finds the main window that owns the menu bar via Qt and flips the “Prototype Apps” action's visibility; if that menu no longer exists (already deleted), the shortcut has no visible effect."
        },
        {
          "kind": "bullet",
          "text": "**Left/right modifiers are not distinguished:** Dragonfly's stored key code doesn't tell left from right Ctrl/Shift, so the default binding effectively fires on **any Ctrl + any Shift + P**."
        },
        {
          "kind": "bullet",
          "text": "**The core is always safe:** whether you hide or delete, the Prototype Labs core (Developer ▸ Prototype Labs…) and your own images, objects and project files are never touched."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}

{
  "title": "GPU Image Filters (pyclesperanto)",
  "cn": {
    "func": "使用 pyclesperanto（OpenCL，BSD-3-Clause）在 GPU 上对图像 Channel 做快速滤波与一键标记。选择一个 Channel、一种操作（高斯模糊、Top-hat 背景扣除、高斯差分 DoG、Otsu 阈值分割、Voronoi-Otsu 标记、连通域标记）并设置 sigma/半径后点击计算：滤波类操作输出为新的 Channel，标记类操作（Voronoi-Otsu、连通域）直接输出为 MultiROI。可在下拉框中选择 OpenCL 设备。",
    "scenarios": "适用于大体积 CT / 显微图像的批量预处理与分割前处理——去噪与平滑、背景扣除、边缘/斑点增强、二值化，以及颗粒/细胞的一键实例标记；在大图像栈上比 CPU 版 scikit-image 快很多。",
    "requirements": "首次使用点击 Setup Environment（默认用 Dragonfly 自带 Python 构建本地 venv 并安装 pyclesperanto + numpy，需联网一次）。需要 OpenCL ICD：GPU 驱动通常自带；若无 GPU，可用 CPU 版 OpenCL 运行时（POCL / Intel CPU runtime）作为回退设备。在 Dragonfly 2027.1（Python 3.14）上不能用 Dragonfly 自带的 Python 创建该环境：请安装 python.org 的 Python（3.12、3.13 或 3.14）并填入面板的 Base Python；Dragonfly 2025.1 无需另装 Python。"
  },
  "en": {
    "func": "GPU (OpenCL) image filtering and one-shot labeling of an image Channel with pyclesperanto (BSD-3-Clause). Pick a Channel, choose an operation (Gaussian blur, top-hat background subtraction, difference-of-Gaussian, Otsu threshold, Voronoi-Otsu labeling, connected-components labeling), set sigma/radius, and Compute: filter operations publish a new Channel, while the labeling operations (Voronoi-Otsu, connected components) publish a MultiROI directly. The OpenCL device is selectable from a dropdown.",
    "scenarios": "Fast pre-processing and pre-segmentation of large CT / microscopy stacks - denoising and smoothing, background subtraction, edge/blob enhancement, thresholding, and one-click instance labeling of particles/cells; far faster than CPU scikit-image on big stacks.",
    "requirements": "First use: click Setup Environment (builds a local venv from Dragonfly's own Python and installs pyclesperanto + numpy; needs internet once). Requires an OpenCL ICD: a GPU driver usually provides one; with no GPU, a CPU OpenCL runtime (POCL / Intel CPU runtime) works as a fallback device. On Dragonfly 2027.1 (Python 3.14) the bundled Python cannot build this environment: install a python.org Python (3.12, 3.13 or 3.14) and enter it in the panel's Base Python field; Dragonfly 2025.1 needs no separate Python."
  }
}

{
  "title": "Mesh Repair & Remesh (PyMeshLab)",
  "cn": {
    "func": "网格修复与重划分（PyMeshLab）对 Dragonfly 场景中的任意表面网格执行专业的网格修复与重划分操作。选择一个网格，挑选操作——屏蔽泊松表面重建（由点/法线生成表面）、各向同性显式重划分、二次误差边折叠简化、填补孔洞、移除非流形边/顶点的修复清理，或 Taubin/Laplacian 平滑——设置参数后点击运行。结果会作为新网格发布回场景，原始网格保持不变。PyMeshLab（MeshLab）为 GPL-3.0 许可，仅在插件自建的独立 venv 子进程中运行，绝不导入 Dragonfly 进程——该子进程即为许可隔离边界。",
    "scenarios": "适用于对由 CT 或显微数据提取的网格进行修复与预处理：为仿真或 3D 打印进行清理与重划分；填补分割网格中的孔洞、移除非流形几何；对巨大网格进行简化（减面）；以及由点云（顶点/法线）重建封闭表面——这些正是 Open3D 所欠缺的网格操作。",
    "requirements": "首次使用：在 Setup 选项卡点击\"Setup Environment\"（约几分钟，下载数百 MB，需联网）。仅用 CPU，无需 GPU。在 Dragonfly 2027.1（Python 3.14）上不能用 Dragonfly 自带的 Python 创建该环境：请安装 python.org 的 Python（3.12、3.13 或 3.14）并填入面板的 Base Python；Dragonfly 2025.1 无需另装 Python。"
  },
  "en": {
    "func": "Mesh Repair & Remesh (PyMeshLab) applies professional mesh repair and remeshing operations to any surface mesh in your Dragonfly scene. Pick a mesh, choose an operation — Screened-Poisson surface reconstruction (from points/normals), isotropic explicit remeshing, quadric edge-collapse decimation, close holes, repair (remove non-manifold edges/vertices), or Taubin/Laplacian smoothing — set the parameters, and click Run. The result is published back into the scene as a new mesh, leaving the original untouched. PyMeshLab (MeshLab) is GPL-3.0-only and runs only in the plugin's own venv subprocess — it is never imported into the Dragonfly process, and that subprocess is the license isolation boundary.",
    "scenarios": "Useful whenever meshes extracted from CT or microscopy data need repair and clean-up before further work: cleaning and remeshing for simulation or 3D printing; closing holes and removing non-manifold geometry in segmentation meshes; simplifying huge meshes (decimation); and reconstructing a watertight surface from a point cloud (vertices/normals) — the mesh operations Open3D lacks.",
    "requirements": "First use: click \"Setup Environment\" on the Setup tab (a few minutes, a few hundred MB download; needs internet). CPU only — no GPU required. On Dragonfly 2027.1 (Python 3.14) the bundled Python cannot build this environment: install a python.org Python (3.12, 3.13 or 3.14) and enter it in the panel's Base Python field; Dragonfly 2025.1 needs no separate Python."
  }
}

{
  "title": "Minkowski Functionals (QuantImPy)",
  "cn": {
    "func": "对三维二值图像计算四个 Minkowski 泛函（体积、表面积、积分平均曲率、Euler 示性数），并可选地进行形态学运算（腐蚀/膨胀/开运算/闭运算）。输入可以是一个二值 ROI、MultiROI 的某个标签，或一幅 Channel 加阈值；体素尺寸可自动取自网格几何信息，从而以物理单位给出结果。计算完成后在面板中列出泛函数值表，形态学结果可作为新的二值 Channel 发布。",
    "scenarios": "适用于材料科学与生命科学中多孔介质、泡沫、骨小梁、颗粒堆积等三维结构的定量分析——Minkowski 泛函可用于表征孔隙率、比表面积、平均曲率与连通性（Euler 示性数），是形貌学与积分几何常用的稳健描述量。",
    "requirements": "首次使用点击 Setup Environment（默认使用 Dragonfly 自带 Python 构建本地计算环境并安装 quantimpy，需联网一次）。无需 GPU。注意：QuantImPy 采用 GPL-3.0-or-later 许可，仅在其独立虚拟环境的子进程中运行，绝不导入 Dragonfly 自身的 Python（保持许可隔离）。在 Dragonfly 2027.1（Python 3.14）上不能用 Dragonfly 自带的 Python 创建该环境：请安装 python.org 的 Python（3.12，其他版本未验证）并填入面板的 Base Python；Dragonfly 2025.1 无需另装 Python。"
  },
  "en": {
    "func": "Computes the four Minkowski functionals (volume, surface area, integral mean curvature, and the Euler characteristic) of a 3D binary image, with optional morphological operations (erode / dilate / open / close). The input can be a binary ROI, one label of a MultiROI, or a Channel plus a threshold; the voxel size is taken from the grid geometry so results come out in physical units. After computing, the panel lists the functionals table and can publish the morphology result as a new binary Channel.",
    "scenarios": "Quantitative analysis of 3D structures in materials and life science - porous media, foams, trabecular bone, packed particles. The Minkowski functionals are robust integral-geometry descriptors of porosity, specific surface area, mean curvature, and connectivity (via the Euler characteristic).",
    "requirements": "First use: click Setup Environment (builds a local compute environment from Dragonfly's own Python and installs quantimpy; needs internet once). No GPU required. NOTE: QuantImPy is GPL-3.0-or-later and runs ONLY in its own venv subprocess - it is never imported into Dragonfly's own Python (license kept arm's-length). On Dragonfly 2027.1 (Python 3.14) the bundled Python cannot build this environment: install a python.org Python (3.12; other versions not verified) and enter it in the panel's Base Python field; Dragonfly 2025.1 needs no separate Python."
  }
}

{
  "title": "Recent Apps Highlighter",
  "cn": {
    "func": "功能：自动监控 Prototype Apps 菜单的使用情况，并把最近使用过的 N 个菜单项（默认 3 个）变得一眼可见：菜单项加粗 + 彩色圆点标记、菜单顶部固定一个 “★ 最近使用” 区块（点击即等同点击原菜单项），并可选实验性的背景色高亮。监控随 Dragonfly 启动自动激活（无需先打开本面板）；每次点击 Prototype Apps 下的任意菜单项都会记入使用历史（保存在 %LOCALAPPDATA%\\DragonflyPrototypeLabs\\RecentApps\\usage.json，跨重启保留）。设置面板可调高亮数量（1–10）、开关加粗/圆点/置顶区块/背景色、改高亮颜色、查看完整使用历史（次数 + 最近使用时间）和清空历史。中英文界面切换后历史仍然有效（内部用英文源标题作稳定键）。",
    "scenarios": "适用场景：启用了大量 Prototype Apps 插件后菜单很长，想快速回到刚用过的几个工具；多人共用一台工作站时查看最近用过哪些应用；演示/培训时把常用条目固定在菜单顶部。",
    "requirements": "环境需求：无需安装/联网/GPU/虚拟环境，纯进程内 PyQt6。仅监控 Prototype Apps 菜单本身（App Store 的“启动”按钮等其他打开方式不计入）。背景色高亮为实验性功能，视 Dragonfly 主题而定可能不显示——加粗、圆点与置顶区块不受影响。"
  },
  "en": {
    "func": "What it does: automatically monitors usage of the Prototype Apps menu and makes the N most recently used entries (default 3) instantly visible: bold text + a colored dot marker on the entries, a pinned '★ recently used' block at the very top of the menu (clicking a pinned entry triggers the original), and an optional experimental background-color highlight. The monitor auto-starts with Dragonfly (no need to open this panel first); every click on a Prototype Apps menu entry is recorded to a usage history (%LOCALAPPDATA%\\DragonflyPrototypeLabs\\RecentApps\\usage.json, kept across restarts). The settings panel adjusts the highlight count (1-10), toggles bold/dot/pinned-block/background, changes the highlight color, shows the full usage history (times used + last used) and can clear it. History survives the 中文/English UI toggle (entries are keyed by their English source titles internally).",
    "scenarios": "Typical scenarios: with many Prototype Apps plugins enabled the menu gets long — jump straight back to the tools you just used; on a shared workstation, see which apps were used recently; pin the entries you demo most to the top during demos/training.",
    "requirements": "Requirements: no install/internet/GPU/venv — pure in-process PyQt6. Only the Prototype Apps menu itself is monitored (launches via the App Store's Launch button etc. are not counted). The background-color highlight is experimental and may not show depending on the Dragonfly theme — bold, dot and the pinned block are unaffected."
  }
}

