{
  "title": "Recipe Executor",
  "cn": {
    "func": "在 Dragonfly 内用一个内置窗口(可停靠面板)运行 Prototype Labs 的 script recipe——一个轻量的\"执行 recipe\"原生工具,用和其它插件一样的窗口代替网页。流程:检查/连接 Prototype Labs TCP 服务器 → 选择 recipe(从内置 recipe 库下拉、浏览一个 .py/.json/.md 文件、或把某个文件加入库)→ 若该 recipe 用到运行时变量(input_file/input_dir/output_dir 等)则填写输入文件或文件夹与输出文件夹 → 点 Run,以 Dragonfly GUI Sync 方式在 Dragonfly UI 线程执行,并显示远端 stdout/stderr 日志;还提供 Interrupt 按钮中断 UI 线程。复用了网页客户端完全相同的 TCP 协议、recipe 加载(含 JSON workflow 用 script_builder 组装、sidecar .py 回退)、输入/输出运行时变量注入逻辑。",
    "scenarios": "适合不想打开完整 Prototype Labs GUI、只需要\"选一个 recipe 并在 Dragonfly 里跑一下\"的场景:快速执行库里的某个已保存 recipe、跑一个别人给的 .py/.json recipe、或对某个输入文件/文件夹批量运行需要 input/output 的 recipe。",
    "requirements": "需要 Prototype Labs TCP 服务器正在运行(Prototype Apps > Server Management 启动)。in-process 运行,仅用标准库 socket 与 Dragonfly 自带 python,无需 venv、GPU、联网。JSON workflow recipe 的自动组装需要 script_builder.py + script_blocks(在 GenericMenuItems 或仓库中);找不到时会回退到同名 .py 或给出提示。"
  },
  "en": {
    "func": "Runs a Prototype Labs script recipe from a built-in dockable window inside Dragonfly - a lightweight, native 'execute recipe' tool - a window like every other plugin instead of a browser page. Flow: check/connect to the Prototype Labs TCP server -> pick a recipe (from the built-in recipe library dropdown, browse a .py/.json/.md file, or add a file to the library) -> if the recipe uses runtime variables (input_file/input_dir/output_dir, etc.) fill in the input file/folder and output folder -> Run, which executes it in Dragonfly's UI thread via GUI Sync and shows the remote stdout/stderr log; an Interrupt button stops the UI thread. Reuses the web client's exact TCP protocol, recipe loading (JSON-workflow assembly via script_builder, sidecar .py fallback), and input/output runtime-variable injection.",
    "scenarios": "For when you don't want the full Prototype Labs GUI and only need to 'pick a recipe and run it in Dragonfly': quickly execute a saved library recipe, run a .py/.json recipe someone sent you, or run an input/output recipe against a chosen file/folder.",
    "requirements": "Requires the Prototype Labs TCP server running (start it from Prototype Apps > Server Management). Runs in-process using only the stdlib socket and Dragonfly's bundled python - no venv, GPU, or internet. JSON-workflow recipe assembly needs script_builder.py + script_blocks (in GenericMenuItems or the repo); if not found it falls back to a sidecar .py or shows a hint."
  }
}

{
  "title": "Richardson-Lucy Deconvolution (RedLionfish)",
  "cn": {
    "func": "对三维图像进行 Richardson-Lucy 反卷积（去卷积），用于消除点扩散函数（PSF）造成的模糊、恢复图像清晰度。选择一个图像 Channel 作为输入，指定点扩散函数——既可选用已有的 PSF Channel，也可由 x/y/z 三个方向的高斯 sigma 自动生成合成高斯 PSF；设置迭代次数（默认 10）并选择 GPU 或 CPU 计算方式后点击 Deconvolve，插件调用 RedLionfish 的 doRLDeconvolutionFromNpArrays 完成反卷积，并将结果作为与源网格对齐的新 Channel 发布。优先使用 GPU，若无可用 GPU 会自动回退到 CPU。仅支持三维数据。",
    "scenarios": "适用于共聚焦/宽场荧光显微、光片显微等因光学系统 PSF 而模糊的三维图像去模糊，也可用于工业 CT 等需要点扩散反卷积以提升分辨率的场景。",
    "requirements": "首次使用点击 Setup Environment（使用 Dragonfly 自带 Python 构建本地计算环境，联网安装 RedLionfish 与 numpy，仅需一次）。GPU 反卷积需要可用的 OpenCL/PyOpenCL 环境，否则自动使用 CPU。仅支持三维数据，且需要一个点扩散函数（PSF）。在 Dragonfly 2027.1（Python 3.14）上不能用 Dragonfly 自带的 Python 创建该环境：请安装 python.org 的 Python（3.12、3.13 或 3.14）并填入面板的 Base Python；Dragonfly 2025.1 无需另装 Python。"
  },
  "en": {
    "func": "Performs 3D Richardson-Lucy deconvolution to remove point-spread-function (PSF) blur and restore sharpness. Pick an image Channel as input and specify the PSF - either an existing PSF Channel or a synthetic Gaussian generated from per-axis (x/y/z) sigmas; set the iteration count (default 10), choose GPU or CPU, and click Deconvolve. The plugin runs RedLionfish's doRLDeconvolutionFromNpArrays and publishes the result as a new Channel aligned with the source grid. GPU is used first and falls back to CPU automatically when no GPU is available. 3D data only.",
    "scenarios": "Deblurring 3D images blurred by an optical PSF - confocal/widefield fluorescence, light-sheet microscopy - and any workflow (e.g. industrial CT) where PSF deconvolution improves resolution.",
    "requirements": "First use: click Setup Environment (builds a local compute environment from Dragonfly's own Python and installs RedLionfish + numpy from PyPI; needs internet once). GPU deconvolution needs a working OpenCL/PyOpenCL stack, otherwise it runs on CPU. Works on 3D data only and requires a PSF. On Dragonfly 2027.1 (Python 3.14) the bundled Python cannot build this environment: install a python.org Python (3.12, 3.13 or 3.14) and enter it in the panel's Base Python field; Dragonfly 2025.1 needs no separate Python."
  }
}

{
  "title": "Remote DL Inferring",
  "cn": {
    "func": "该插件在 Dragonfly 内提供一个可停靠面板,用于在【远程】Dragonfly 服务器上运行深度学习分割模型的推理(将模型应用到图像)。面板顶部可设置远程服务器的地址、端口和访问令牌(token);下方是与独立应用完全一致的 Remote DL Inferring 标签页(从服务器模型列表选择模型,或上传一个模型 zip,应用到 Channel 生成 MultiROI,并支持逐切片的可视化反馈)。所有网络请求发送到您在顶部设置的服务器,因此可以用一台没有 GPU 的电脑上的 Dragonfly,把推理任务交给另一台带 GPU 的 Dragonfly 服务器(通过 Tailscale IP 如 100.64.0.2 或局域网 IP 如 192.168.0.82)。连接远程服务器必须提供正确的 token;连接本机 127.0.0.1 则无需 token。",
    "scenarios": "适用于把 DL 推理从本地(无 GPU/性能有限)转移到远程 GPU 服务器的场景:在客户端 Dragonfly 中选好图像后,一键提交到远程服务器推理,并在本地实时查看分割结果预览。与 Remote DL Training 插件配套使用(先训练、后推理)。",
    "requirements": "需要一台正在运行、且已启动 Prototype Labs 服务器的远程(或本机)Dragonfly,以及该服务器的访问 token(远程连接必需)。本插件的界面代码来自 gui_qt(与独立应用、嵌入式 Prototype Labs 共用),请同时安装 Prototype Labs 嵌入式包(提供 gui_qt)。无需 venv,运行于 Dragonfly 自带 Python。"
  },
  "en": {
    "func": "A dockable panel, inside Dragonfly, for running deep-learning segmentation inference (applying a model to an image) on a REMOTE Dragonfly server. The top of the panel sets the remote server's address, port and access token; below it is the exact Remote DL Inferring tab from the standalone app (pick a model from the server's model list or upload a model zip, apply it to a Channel to produce a MultiROI, with slab-by-slab visual feedback). Every request goes to the server you set at the top, so a GPU-less machine's Dragonfly can offload inference to another GPU-equipped Dragonfly server (via a Tailscale IP such as 100.64.0.2 or a LAN IP such as 192.168.0.82). A remote connection requires the correct token; a 127.0.0.1 connection needs none.",
    "scenarios": "For offloading DL inference from a local (GPU-less / limited) machine to a remote GPU server: choose the image in the client Dragonfly, submit it to the remote server with one click, and watch the segmentation preview locally in real time. Pairs with the Remote DL Training plugin (train, then infer).",
    "requirements": "Needs a running remote (or local) Dragonfly with the Prototype Labs server started, plus that server's access token (required for remote connections). The panel's UI comes from the gui_qt package (shared with the standalone app and the embedded Prototype Labs), so also install the Prototype Labs embedded package (which provides gui_qt). No venv; runs in Dragonfly's own Python."
  }
}

