    {"heading": "Introduction", "blocks": [
      {"kind": "p", "text": "**Show Connections of All Objects** analyzes every published object in the current Dragonfly session and draws a **relationship graph** so you can see, at a glance, how objects were **derived** from one another, which share a geometry, and which came from files."},
      {"kind": "note", "text": "This feature is provided by a third party (Prototype Labs / Apps), not officially developed or supported by Dragonfly. It runs entirely in-process on the object model and uses no large language model."}
