{
  "title": "Skeleton Analysis (skan)",
  "cn": {
    "func": "该插件将三维数据中的二值结构转化为骨架(一条一像素宽的中心线网络)并进行测量。您选择输入对象——ROI、MultiROI 中的单个或全部标签,或按您设定的强度阈值二值化的 Channel——然后点击运行。插件会在三维空间中将形状细化为中心线,并计算分支统计信息:分支数量、各分支长度、端点与连接点数量,以及分支之间的连接关系。结果以分支表格形式显示并可导出为 CSV,计算得到的骨架会作为一个与原始数据对齐的新 Channel 发布回场景中,便于您在三维中叠加查看。",
    "scenarios": "适用于任何需要量化网络状或纤维状结构(而不仅仅是其体积)的场合。例如:在生命科学成像中测量血管、神经元或植物根系的分支长度与连接性;在材料科学和工业 CT 中表征纤维、裂纹或孔隙通道网络;以及在通用三维图像分析中分析丝状或树突状结构。",
    "requirements": "首次使用时,请在面板中点击\"Setup Environment(设置环境)\"以构建分析环境(默认使用 Dragonfly 自带的 Python;一次性安装需要联网)。无需 GPU。在 Dragonfly 2027.1（Python 3.14）上不能用 Dragonfly 自带的 Python 创建该环境：请安装 python.org 的 Python（3.12、3.13 或 3.14）并填入面板的 Base Python；Dragonfly 2025.1 无需另装 Python。"
  },
  "en": {
    "func": "This plugin turns a binary structure in your 3D data into a skeleton (a one-voxel-thick centerline network) and measures it. You pick an input — an ROI, a single label or all labels of a MultiROI, or a Channel thresholded by an intensity value you set — and click Run. The plugin thins the shape down to its centerlines in 3D and computes branch statistics: the number of branches, their lengths, endpoint and junction counts, and how branches connect. Results appear as a branch table you can export to CSV, and the computed skeleton is published back into the scene as a new Channel aligned to your original data so you can see it overlaid in 3D.",
    "scenarios": "Useful anywhere you need to quantify network- or fiber-like structures rather than just their volume. Examples: measuring branch length and connectivity of blood vessels, neurons, or plant roots in life-science imaging; characterizing fiber, crack, or pore-channel networks in materials science and industrial CT; and analyzing filament or dendrite structures in general 3D image analysis.",
    "requirements": "On first use, click Setup Environment in the panel to build the analysis environment (uses Dragonfly's own Python by default; needs internet for the one-time install). No GPU required. On Dragonfly 2027.1 (Python 3.14) the bundled Python cannot build this environment: install a python.org Python (3.12, 3.13 or 3.14) and enter it in the panel's Base Python field; Dragonfly 2025.1 needs no separate Python."
  }
}

{
  "title": "Slice Registration (Non-Rigid)",
  "cn": {
    "func": "对一个 Dragonfly image Channel（Z 方向为一叠 2D 切片的图像栈）逐切片做非刚性/弹性配准，输出一个已对齐的新 Channel。基于成熟开源库 SimpleITK（ITK）：可选线性预配准（平移/刚性/仿射），再叠加非刚性步骤——B-spline 自由变形（FFD）或 diffeomorphic Demons。参考方式支持“逐前一张（顺序传播，适合序列切片的漂移）”与“固定参考切片（全部对到某一张）”。可调相似性度量（Mattes 互信息/均方差/相关）、迭代次数、采样比例、多分辨率金字塔层数、B-spline 网格密度、Demons 迭代与平滑 sigma。输出保留源 Channel 的 spacing 与 origin，并给出逐切片对齐质量诊断 CSV。**Manual Adjustment（手工微调）页**：当自动配准仍有个别切片没对好时，可逐张手工纠正——顶部选择已发布的 image Channel（刚跑完配准会自动选中其输出，否则默认第一个），中间显示该 Channel 的 XY 切片（切片号可用箭头增减或直接输入跳转），用平移/旋转/缩放按钮（步长可调）微调当前切片；当前切片以可调透明度叠加显示在上一张或下一张切片之上作为对位参考（可切换参考为上一张/下一张/不显示）。可选双线性或最近邻重采样（后者保持原值不变）。Save 把变换后的切片写回该 Channel（原地修改、需确认、不可撤销），Cancel 放弃本次微调并重新载入切片，Close 关闭窗口。",
    "scenarios": "适用于连续切片（serial-section）显微、组织切片、电镜、以及任何 Z 向切片之间存在局部形变而不仅是平移/旋转的图像栈对齐。Dragonfly 自带的 slice registration 只做刚性/平移；当切片之间有弯曲、拉伸、局部扭曲时用本插件的弹性配准。",
    "requirements": "需要一个至少 2 张切片的 Channel。首次使用需在 Setup 页创建独立 venv 并安装 numpy 与 SimpleITK（联网，约几十 MB，CPython 3.10 有预编译 wheel，无需编译）。运行不需要 GPU、Fiji、ImageJ 或 Java。在 Dragonfly 2027.1（Python 3.14）上不能用 Dragonfly 自带的 Python 创建该环境：请安装 python.org 的 Python（3.12、3.13 或 3.14）并填入面板的 Base Python；Dragonfly 2025.1 无需另装 Python。"
  },
  "en": {
    "func": "Elastically aligns the 2D slices of a Dragonfly image Channel (a Z stack) to each other and publishes an aligned Channel. Built on the mature open-source SimpleITK (ITK): an optional linear pre-alignment (translation / rigid / affine) followed by a non-rigid step - B-spline free-form deformation (FFD) or diffeomorphic Demons. Reference modes are 'previous slice (sequential, propagated)' for serial-section drift and 'fixed reference slice (all-to-one)'. Tunable similarity metric (Mattes MI / mean squares / correlation), iterations, sampling fraction, multi-resolution pyramid levels, B-spline grid density, and Demons iterations/smoothing sigma. Output keeps the source Channel's spacing and origin, plus a per-slice alignment-quality diagnostics CSV. **Manual Adjustment tab**: when automatic registration still leaves a slice off, correct it by hand - pick a published image Channel at the top (the registration output is preselected right after a run, otherwise the first Channel), see its XY slice in the middle (step the slice index with arrows or type it to jump), and nudge the current slice with translate / rotate / scale buttons with adjustable steps. The current slice is drawn over the previous or next slice at an adjustable opacity as an alignment reference (switch the reference to previous / next / none). Bilinear or nearest-neighbour resampling (the latter preserves original values exactly). Save writes the transformed slice back into that Channel (in place, confirmed, not undoable), Cancel discards the manual transform and reloads the slice, Close closes the window.",
    "scenarios": "For serial-section microscopy, histology stacks, electron microscopy, and any stack where consecutive slices differ by local deformation, not just translation/rotation. Dragonfly's built-in slice registration is rigid/translation only; use this plugin's elastic registration when slices bend, stretch, or warp locally.",
    "requirements": "Requires a Channel with at least 2 slices. First use builds an isolated venv and installs numpy + SimpleITK from PyPI (internet, ~tens of MB; prebuilt CPython 3.10 wheels, no compilation). No GPU, Fiji, ImageJ, or Java required. On Dragonfly 2027.1 (Python 3.14) the bundled Python cannot build this environment: install a python.org Python (3.12, 3.13 or 3.14) and enter it in the panel's Base Python field; Dragonfly 2025.1 needs no separate Python."
  }
}

{
  "title": "SPAM DVC (Panel): Digital Volume Correlation",
  "cn": {
    "func": "新增一个可停靠的“SPAM DVC”面板，用于在两个已对齐的三维图像之间进行数字体相关（DVC）分析。选择参考态与变形态两个 Channel（可选限定一个 ROI），设置相关参数（局部子集或全局有限元模式）后运行；计算得到的位移场和应变场会以新的 DVC_* Channel 写回场景，可直接进行 2D/3D 可视化。每次运行还可选生成一份 Word（.docx）分析报告，包含参数、切片图、统计数据和结果解读。",
    "scenarios": "适用于对同一样品在加载前后进行成像的原位 CT 实验——例如材料力学（岩石、土壤、泡沫、复合材料、增材制造件的压缩/拉伸试验）、骨骼或组织的生物力学研究，以及量化内部变形与应变的工业 CT 质量分析。",
    "requirements": "需要 WSL2 并一次性安装随附的 SPAM 计算环境（提供一键安装包）；计算在后台运行，不会卡住 Dragonfly。"
  },
  "en": {
    "func": "Adds a dockable \"SPAM DVC\" panel that performs Digital Volume Correlation (DVC) between two aligned 3D images. You pick a reference and a deformed Channel (optionally restricted to an ROI), set the correlation parameters (local subset or global FEM mode), and run; the computed displacement and strain fields come back as new DVC_* Channels in the scene, ready for 2D/3D visualization. Optionally, each run also produces a Word (.docx) analysis report with parameters, slice images, statistics, and interpretation.",
    "scenarios": "Ideal for in-situ CT experiments where the same sample is imaged before and after loading — e.g. mechanics of materials (compression/tension tests on rocks, soils, foams, composites, additive-manufactured parts), biomechanics of bone or tissue, and industrial CT quality studies quantifying internal deformation and strain.",
    "requirements": "Requires WSL2 with the provided SPAM compute environment installed once (one-click installer included); computation runs in the background without freezing Dragonfly."
  }
}

{
  "title": "Spot / Puncta Detection (spotiflow)...",
  "cn": {
    "func": "使用深度学习模型 Spotiflow 在二维或三维图像 Channel 中检测亚像素级的点状/斑点目标（如荧光点、颗粒、种子点）。选择一个图像 Channel、一个预训练模型、概率阈值与最小间距，插件即在 GPU 上完成检测，并将结果以两种形式返回：一个由小球体种子点组成的 MultiROI（发布回场景，可用于测量与可视化），以及一张包含每个点亚像素坐标与数量统计的表格（可导出为 CSV）。同时提供可选的\"训练\"页，用您自己标注的点对模型进行微调。所有繁重计算都在插件专属的 CUDA 虚拟环境中以子进程方式运行，绝不进入 Dragonfly 自带的 Python。",
    "scenarios": "适用于任何需要自动检测与计数点状目标的场景：荧光显微镜中的信号点/斑点（FISH、smFISH）、细胞核或颗粒的中心点定位、材料中的析出相或气泡计数等。预训练模型面向荧光图像；用于 CT 或其他模态时可能需要用少量标注点重新训练。",
    "requirements": "首次使用请点击\"Setup Environment\"（使用 Dragonfly 自带 Python 构建运行环境，下载 torch + spotiflow 数 GB）；需要联网和 NVIDIA GPU。预训练模型权重在首次检测时自动下载（同样需要联网），不随插件打包。在 Dragonfly 2027.1（Python 3.14）上不能用 Dragonfly 自带的 Python 创建该环境：请安装 python.org 的 Python（3.12 或 3.13）并填入面板的 Base Python；Dragonfly 2025.1 无需另装 Python。"
  },
  "en": {
    "func": "Detects subpixel 2D/3D spots / puncta (fluorescent dots, particles, seed points) in an image Channel using the deep-learning Spotiflow model. Pick an image Channel, a pretrained model, a probability threshold and a minimum distance, and the plugin runs detection on your GPU and returns the result two ways: a MultiROI of small seed spheres (published back into the scene, ready for measurement and visualization), and a table of every spot's subpixel coordinates plus the total count (exportable as CSV). An optional Train tab fine-tunes the model on your own labeled points. All heavy work runs in the plugin's dedicated CUDA venv as a subprocess and never enters Dragonfly's own Python.",
    "scenarios": "Ideal whenever you need automated detection and counting of point-like targets: fluorescence-microscopy signals / puncta (FISH, smFISH), nuclei or particle centroid localization, precipitate or bubble counting in materials, and similar. The pretrained models are fluorescence-oriented; for CT or other modalities you may need to retrain on a few labeled points.",
    "requirements": "First use: click Setup Environment (builds a Python environment with Dragonfly's own Python and downloads torch + spotiflow, several GB); needs internet + an NVIDIA GPU. Pretrained model weights download automatically on the first detection (also needs internet) and are not bundled with the plugin. On Dragonfly 2027.1 (Python 3.14) the bundled Python cannot build this environment: install a python.org Python (3.12 or 3.13) and enter it in the panel's Base Python field; Dragonfly 2025.1 needs no separate Python."
  }
}

{
  "title": "From STL to Image (Hands-on Workshop)",
  "cn": {
    "func": "功能：一个上手练习项目，是“从图像到 STL”的逆过程——把一个只有表面的 STL 网格变回一张三维二值图像（体素化）。七个内容标签页 + 证书页：概念（完整流程、网格回顾、体素化、网格 vs 图像）→ 导入 STL（trimesh 导入 STL/OBJ/PLY，或一键生成立方体/圆柱/球/圆环/垫圈示例）→ 创建包围盒（最小包围盒 AABB 或有向包围盒 OBB，二选一，详细讲解区别，两者均可用）→ 由包围盒创建空白 ROI（指定 x/y/z 体素间距，建议相同，并报告生成的体素维度 nx×ny×nz）→ Export Mesh to ROI（把网格表面光栅化进 ROI，得到空心壳）→ 填充 ROI（把壳填成实体）→ 转换成二值图像（ROI→0/1 的 Channel）。第 2–6 步使用 Dragonfly 真正的原生操作（getBoundingBox / copyShapeFromBox / Export Mesh to ROI = mesh.getAsROI / fillInnerHoles / getAsChannel）；每一步都既有一键操作按钮，也有“在 Dragonfly 界面里怎么做”的手把手弹窗，并用大量弹窗解释基础概念。全部在进程内运行，无需安装/GPU/联网。\n\n「概念」页上的 **Execute All Steps with Current Settings（按当前设置执行全部步骤）** 会无人值守地跑完六个工作流步骤——使用所选网格、创建包围盒、生成空 ROI、把网格表面导出进去、填充成实体、再转换为二值图像——每一步都使用你按下按钮那一刻它自己那一页显示的设置。它并不取代逐页手工操作：每个步骤按钮和每份「学习」文档都原样保留。它适用于第二遍（改了包围盒类型或体素间距之后重跑），也适用于讲师用一次按下演示完整流程。本次运行会发布一个 ROI 和二值图像；是否先创建示例 STL 由一个勾选项决定，只有当会话中根本没有网格时才默认勾选。所有标签页始终保持可用——若某一步所需的输入尚不存在，按下它自己的按钮时会拒绝执行，并说明必须先运行哪一步。",
    "scenarios": "适用场景：理解“网格→体素图像”的体素化流程；把 CAD/STL 变回体素图像用于体积测量、有限元/流体仿真前处理、或作为深度学习的分割标签；理解最小包围盒与有向包围盒的差别、体素间距与图像大小/内存的关系、空心壳与实体填充的区别；用自己的 STL 走一遍完整流程。它与“从图像到 STL：入门”构成一对互逆流程。",
    "requirements": "环境需求：无需安装、无需联网、无需 GPU、无需虚拟环境——用 Dragonfly 自带的 numpy/scipy/trimesh 在进程内运行。STL/OBJ/PLY 导入用 trimesh（Dragonfly 自带的原生网格加载 DLL 在进程内不稳定）。"
  },
  "en": {
    "func": "What it does: a hands-on project that is the inverse of 'From Image to STL' — it turns a surface-only STL mesh back into a 3D binary image (voxelisation). Seven content tabs + a Certificate tab: Concepts (the pipeline, mesh recap, voxelisation, mesh vs image) → Import STL (trimesh import of STL/OBJ/PLY, or one-click cube/cylinder/sphere/torus/washer samples) → Create bounding box (minimal AABB or oriented OBB, your choice, difference explained in detail, both usable) → Create empty ROI from the box (choose x/y/z voxel spacing, equal suggested, reports the resulting nx×ny×nz dimensions) → Export Mesh to ROI (rasterise the mesh surface into the ROI = a hollow shell) → Fill the ROI (fill the shell into a solid) → Convert to a binary image (ROI → a 0/1 Channel). Steps 2–6 use Dragonfly's real native operations (getBoundingBox / copyShapeFromBox / Export Mesh to ROI = mesh.getAsROI / fillInnerHoles / getAsChannel); every step pairs a one-click action button with a step-by-step 'how to do this in the Dragonfly GUI' pop-up, plus many concept pop-ups. All in-process, no install/GPU/internet.\n\n**Execute All Steps with Current Settings** on the Concepts tab runs the six workflow steps unattended - use the selected mesh, create the bounding box, lay out the empty ROI, export the mesh surface into it, fill it to a solid and convert it to a binary image - each step with whatever its own tab shows at the moment you press it. It does NOT replace working through the tabs by hand: every step button and every Learn document stays exactly where it is. It is for the second pass, after you have changed the box type or the voxel spacing, and for an instructor demonstrating the finished pipeline in one press. The run publishes an ROI and the binary image; creating a sample STL first is a tick box, on only when your session holds no mesh at all. Every tab stays open at all times - a step whose input does not exist yet refuses at its own button and names the step that has to run first.",
    "scenarios": "Typical scenarios: understand mesh→voxel-image voxelisation; turn CAD/STL back into a voxel image for volume measurement, FEA/CFD pre-processing, or as a deep-learning segmentation label; understand minimal vs oriented bounding boxes, spacing vs image size/memory, and hollow shell vs solid fill; run the full pipeline on your own STL. It and 'From Image to STL: The Basics' form an inverse pair.",
    "requirements": "Requirements: no install, no internet, no GPU, no venv — runs in-process on Dragonfly's own numpy/scipy/trimesh. STL/OBJ/PLY import uses trimesh (Dragonfly's native mesh-loader DLL is unreliable in-process)."
  }
}

