    "scenarios": "Useful wherever local surface geometry matters: materials science and industrial CT (wall-thickness and roughness of parts, deviation of a scanned part from a reference/CAD-derived mesh), additive manufacturing quality checks, and life science (curvature and shape analysis of bones, cells, membranes, or other segmented anatomical surfaces).",
