          "text": "Coincident vertices are merged before anything else. An STL stores every triangle with its own three vertices, so without merging a perfectly closed 1160-triangle vessel reports **1160 components** and **watertight = no**. Measured on a real specimen: 1160 components before merging, 1 after."
