          "kind": "p",
          "text": "Step 1 shows the face count, vertex count, watertight flag, component count, volume and surface area **before** you reach Run. For a mesh above 300000 faces that check is not started automatically — press **Check geometry**."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "Installation & enabling",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "steps",
          "items": [
            "Open **Prototype Apps ▸ App Store**, find *Vessel Morphometry* in the **Measurements & Analysis** group, and enable it.",
            "Restart Dragonfly. Plugins are discovered at startup, so a restart is required.",
            "The item appears as **Prototype Apps ▸ Vessel morphometry along the centerline...**",
