      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "**One vessel per run.** The centerline is the longest geodesic path through the skeleton, i.e. the main trunk. A mesh containing several vessels, or a tree with long side branches, is measured along that trunk only, and the component count in step 1 tells you when that is what you have."
