{
  "title": "Vessel Centerlines (vmtk)",
  "cn": {
    "func": "血管中心线（vmtk）从 Dragonfly 场景中的封闭管状表面网格（血管、气道或其他管道）提取中心线网络。选择一个表面，选择端点/种子方式（自动，或手动输入表面点 id），可选翻转法线、提取分支标签、附加 Frangi/Sato 血管性标量，点击运行。结果作为新的中心线网络 Graph 发布：顶点携带 MaximumInscribedSphereRadius（最大内切球半径）标量，边为中心线各段，另有可选的分支（group）id。中心线基于 Voronoi 图（vmtkcenterlines）计算，分支由 vmtkbranchextractor 提取。",
    "scenarios": "适用于血管/气道/多孔管网的几何量化：沿中心线读取局部半径以定位狭窄或动脉瘤；按分支拆分网络做逐段测量；将中心线作为下游流动/骨架分析的输入。仅使用 vmtk 的纯 BSD-3 中心线与血管性路径，刻意避开 TetGen 四面体网格化路径（其 TetGen 依赖为限制商用的 Modified-MIT 许可）。",
    "requirements": "首次使用需要机器上装有 conda（Miniconda/Anaconda/Miniforge）——vmtk 无法用 pip 安装，只能通过 conda 分发。在 Setup 选项卡点击\"Setup Environment\"，它会用 conda-forge 新建一个独立 conda 环境并安装 vmtk 1.5 + numpy（会拉取 VTK/ITK，约几分钟，需联网；conda 若不在 PATH 上可在\"Conda\"框里指定）。仅用 CPU，无需 GPU。输入需为封闭的三角化表面网格。在 Dragonfly 2027.1（Python 3.14）上不能用 Dragonfly 自带的 Python 创建该环境：请安装 python.org 的 Python（3.12、3.13 或 3.14）并填入面板的 Base Python；Dragonfly 2025.1 无需另装 Python。"
  },
  "en": {
    "func": "Vessel Centerlines (vmtk) extracts a centerline network from a closed tubular surface mesh in your Dragonfly scene (a vessel, airway, or other tubular structure). Pick a surface, choose how endpoints are seeded (auto, or type surface point ids), optionally flip normals, extract branch labels, and append a Frangi/Sato vesselness scalar, then click Run. The result is published as a new centerline-network Graph: vertices carry a MaximumInscribedSphereRadius scalar, edges are centerline segments, and an optional branch (group) id is attached. Centerlines are computed from the Voronoi diagram (vmtkcenterlines); branches come from vmtkbranchextractor.",
    "scenarios": "Useful for quantifying vessel / airway / tubular-network geometry: reading the local inscribed-sphere radius along the centerline to locate stenoses or aneurysms; splitting the network by branch for per-segment measurement; and feeding the centerline into downstream flow or skeleton analysis. Only vmtk's pure-BSD-3 centerline and vesselness paths are used; the TetGen tet-meshing path (whose TetGen dependency carries a Modified-MIT non-commercial restriction) is deliberately avoided.",
    "requirements": "First use requires conda (Miniconda/Anaconda/Miniforge) on the machine -- vmtk is not pip-installable; it is distributed only via conda. Click \"Setup Environment\" on the Setup tab: it builds an isolated conda env with vmtk 1.5 + numpy from conda-forge (pulls VTK/ITK; a few minutes; needs internet; set the \"Conda\" field if conda is not on PATH). CPU only -- no GPU required. The input must be a closed, triangulated surface mesh. On Dragonfly 2027.1 (Python 3.14) the bundled Python cannot build this environment: install a python.org Python (3.12, 3.13 or 3.14) and enter it in the panel's Base Python field; Dragonfly 2025.1 needs no separate Python."
  }
}

{
  "title": "AI Work Log (Generate Work Log)",
  "cn": {
    "func": "用一个“本地运行、离线、不依赖 Ollama 等外部软件”的大语言模型（LLM），把 Dragonfly 的会话日志自动整理成一份 Markdown 工作日志。做法分两步：先用确定性规则对日志做预过滤（从 Dragonfly 的 ActionLog 宏记录 + Application 应用日志里，抽取“加载的文件路径/名称、保存/导出的文件、关键操作流程”，并丢弃视图切换、相机平移旋转、图例/可见性等无关噪声），再把这份紧凑的关键事件清单交给本地 LLM，让它解读并生成结构化的 Markdown（含 概要 / 加载的文件 / 保存的文件 / 关键操作 / 错误告警 等小节）。文件路径由规则保证逐字保留，模型只负责归纳与翻译，不会臆造。UI 顶部可设置“日志库保存路径”并持久化（推荐指向一个 Obsidian 仓库来管理日志库）；有“语言”选择（默认中文，可切换英文），决定生成的 Markdown 语言；有“生成工作日志 / 创建新日志 / 覆盖当前日志 / 删除当前日志”按钮；预览框可在保存前手动编辑。日志来源可选“实时当前 Dragonfly 会话”（自动定位当前会话的 ActionLog + Application 日志）或“手动选择磁盘上的日志文件”。此外还有一个“会话快照”区（在 Dragonfly 内运行时可见），可勾选把当前会话的快照并入日志：① 主界面截图（对 Dragonfly 主窗口截图）；② Multiple Screenshots 面板里的全部图片（Dragonfly 自带功能，逐张导出）；③ 已发布对象列表（Channel/ROI/MultiROI/Mesh 等，逐字给出名称、类型与体素尺寸）；截图会随日志一起保存到 <日志名>.assets 子文件夹并以相对链接嵌入（Obsidian 可直接显示）。还有“保存 Session 文件”勾选项，勾选后会在日志旁另存一份 .ORSSession 会话文件，便于日后重新打开完整场景。模型：默认 Qwen3-8B（Apache-2.0），弱机可切 Qwen3-4B（light），大显存可切 Qwen3-32B（best）；插件会检测显卡显存并推荐最合适的档位。运行时用 llama-cpp-python 在插件自建的 venv 里加载 GGUF 量化模型，检测到 NVIDIA 显卡时可选 CUDA 加速，否则用 CPU（一次性生成，CPU 也可接受）。全程本地，日志内容不出本机。",
    "scenarios": "适用于：想为每天/每个项目的 Dragonfly 操作自动留一份可读的工作记录（做了哪些分割/测量/重建、加载和导出了哪些数据文件），用于交接、复盘、写报告或归档；把这些 Markdown 放进 Obsidian 形成可搜索、可双链的“工作日志库”。中文团队默认中文输出，需要英文时一键切换。",
    "requirements": "首次使用需要：1) 联网一次，点“Setup Environment”自建 venv 并安装 llama-cpp-python + huggingface_hub；2) 点“Download Model”下载所选 Qwen3 GGUF（约 2.5–20 GB，一次性）。模型下载保存位置可在“Local LLM Model”里的“Model folder”中自选并持久化——默认在插件目录（C 盘），可改到其他盘（如 D:\\）以节省 C 盘空间（仅影响新下载）。之后生成时无需联网。CPU 即可运行；有 NVIDIA 显卡时可选 CUDA 加速更快。日志来源为 Dragonfly 自身写在 %LOCALAPPDATA%\\comet\\<版本>\\logs 下的 ActionLog/Application 日志（本插件只读取，不修改）。不依赖 Ollama / LM Studio 等任何外部程序。在 Dragonfly 2027.1（Python 3.14）上不能用 Dragonfly 自带的 Python 创建该环境：请安装 python.org 的 Python（3.12、3.13 或 3.14）并填入面板的 Base Python；Dragonfly 2025.1 无需另装 Python。"
  },
  "en": {
    "func": "Turns Dragonfly's session log into a Markdown work log using a LOCAL, offline LLM (no Ollama or other external software). Two steps: (1) a deterministic pre-filter extracts the key events from Dragonfly's ActionLog (macro recorder) + Application log — files loaded (with paths), files saved/exported, and meaningful operations — while dropping noise (view switches, camera pan/rotate, legend/visibility tweaks); (2) the compact event list is handed to the local LLM, which interprets it and writes structured Markdown (Summary / Files Loaded / Files Saved / Key Operations / Errors sections). File paths are kept verbatim by the pre-filter; the model only organizes and translates, and is instructed never to invent facts. The panel top has a persisted log-library save path (point it at an Obsidian vault); a language selector (Chinese default, switch to English) controlling the output language; and Generate / Create-new / Overwrite / Delete buttons. The editable preview lets you tweak before saving. Log source is either the live current Dragonfly session (auto-locates the session's ActionLog + Application log) or hand-picked log files. A 'Session Snapshot' group (shown when running inside Dragonfly) can fold a snapshot of the CURRENT session into the log via checkboxes: (a) a screenshot of the main window; (b) every image in the built-in Multiple-Screenshots panel (exported one by one); (c) a list of published objects (Channels/ROIs/MultiROIs/Meshes… with exact names, types and voxel dimensions). Screenshots are saved into a <logname>.assets sub-folder next to the log and embedded with relative links (Obsidian renders them inline). A 'Save session file' checkbox additionally writes the whole scene to a .ORSSession file beside the log so it can be reopened later. Model: Qwen3-8B by default (Apache-2.0); Qwen3-4B (light) for weak machines, Qwen3-32B (best) for big GPUs — the plugin detects your VRAM and recommends a tier. Inference runs via llama-cpp-python loading a GGUF in the plugin's own venv (optional CUDA on NVIDIA GPUs, else CPU — fine for a one-shot summary). Fully local; the log never leaves the machine.",
    "scenarios": "For keeping an automatic, readable record of each day's / project's Dragonfly work (which segmentations/measurements/reconstructions were done, which data files were loaded and exported) — for handover, review, reports, or archiving; drop the Markdown into Obsidian for a searchable, back-linked work-log library. Chinese teams get Chinese output by default and can switch to English on demand.",
    "requirements": "First run: (1) go online once and click 'Setup Environment' to build the venv and install llama-cpp-python + huggingface_hub; (2) click 'Download Model' to fetch the chosen Qwen3 GGUF (~2.5–20 GB, one-time). The model download folder is user-selectable and persisted ('Model folder' under 'Local LLM Model') — it defaults to the plugin folder (C: drive) but can be pointed at another drive (e.g. D:\\) to save C: space (affects new downloads only). Generation afterwards is offline. Runs on CPU; optional CUDA acceleration on NVIDIA GPUs. Reads Dragonfly's own ActionLog/Application logs under %LOCALAPPDATA%\\comet\\<version>\\logs (read-only). No dependency on Ollama / LM Studio or any external app. On Dragonfly 2027.1 (Python 3.14) the bundled Python cannot build this environment: install a python.org Python (3.12, 3.13 or 3.14) and enter it in the panel's Base Python field; Dragonfly 2025.1 needs no separate Python."
  }
}

